(1456459, 190210, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done!  Very emotive.  Was it set up or is this a real grave site?  One little thing that may help out a tad with your border.  It is sometimes more effective to put a one or two pixel dark in between the image and your one or two pixel light then the dark again!  I found this to be very effective in several of my images.<br/>TC</td>', 'Very nicely done!  Very emotive.  Was it set up or is this a real grave site?  One little thing that may help out a tad with your border.  It is sometimes more effective to put a one or two pixel dark in between the image and your one or two pixel light then the dark again!  I found this to be very effective in several of my images.TC', '2005-06-15 01:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
