(1457015, 187192, 5015, '<td valign="top">Brilliant photo, but I would put it in another challenge - not in the "darkness" challenge.  The focus is on the flower, which is light.  If this was entered for a challenge "light" or "something new from the old" etc. it might have been better.  Good composition, however.  Good luck!</td>', 'Brilliant photo, but I would put it in another challenge - not in the "darkness" challenge.  The focus is on the flower, which is light.  If this was entered for a challenge "light" or "something new from the old" etc. it might have been better.  Good composition, however.  Good luck!', '2005-06-15 07:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1457020, 189029, 5015, '<td valign="top">The one higlighted stone in the back off-centre puts the photo out of the darkness challenge for me.  Personally I would have used that hint of light to enter this photo for a challenge like "light" or even "hope".  But I think it was a clever idea.</td>', 'The one higlighted stone in the back off-centre puts the photo out of the darkness challenge for me.  Personally I would have used that hint of light to enter this photo for a challenge like "light" or even "hope".  But I think it was a clever idea.', '2005-06-15 07:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
