(1457101, 187356, 36981, '<td valign="top">Terrific!!  I love this photo and everything about it.  The concept, the lighting and the motion are all great and very evocative.</td>', 'Terrific!!  I love this photo and everything about it.  The concept, the lighting and the motion are all great and very evocative.', '2005-06-15 08:32:40.000000', NULL, 1),
