(1457181, 188368, 327, '<td valign="top">Good looking mask. I think  you met the challenge, it''s dark okay. I would of like to see this a bit ''darker''..really. Maybe adjust the levels, it''s pretty bright and would be more spooky if darker. Still it''s okay and on topic. Best of luck~</td>', 'Good looking mask. I think  you met the challenge, it''s dark okay. I would of like to see this a bit ''darker''..really. Maybe adjust the levels, it''s pretty bright and would be more spooky if darker. Still it''s okay and on topic. Best of luck~', '2005-06-15 09:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1457182, 187142, 327, '<td valign="top">Creepy feel, this is a good entry. Best of luck.</td>', 'Creepy feel, this is a good entry. Best of luck.', '2005-06-15 09:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1457186, 188529, 327, '<td valign="top">Even without the bird this would of been good. The leading line..to the dark pit is very nice and really adds to the over all deep, dark, spooky feel. Good one.</td>', 'Even without the bird this would of been good. The leading line..to the dark pit is very nice and really adds to the over all deep, dark, spooky feel. Good one.', '2005-06-15 09:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
