(1457365, 190241, 20204, '<td valign="top">Looks like the red channel blew its highlights a bit, and some detail was lost in the flower''s center.  These can be very tough to photograph and retain 100% detail in, especially given the toneality range in this shot which definitely exceeds most digicams.  A nice composition though, and I like the petals fading into shadow.</td>', 'Looks like the red channel blew its highlights a bit, and some detail was lost in the flower''s center.  These can be very tough to photograph and retain 100% detail in, especially given the toneality range in this shot which definitely exceeds most digicams.  A nice composition though, and I like the petals fading into shadow.', '2005-06-15 10:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1457366, 188909, 20204, '<td valign="top">Our of focus.  The pavement crack seems a distraction to me as well.</td>', 'Our of focus.  The pavement crack seems a distraction to me as well.', '2005-06-15 10:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1457369, 189539, 33672, '<td valign="top">Whew.... This brings back some memories. Nice perspective and shadows!</td>', 'Whew.... This brings back some memories. Nice perspective and shadows!', '2005-06-15 10:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
