(1457387, 189599, 20204, '<td valign="top">The image is technically well done, but somewhat cliche.  I''d also question the violin.  If the theme is suicide, then music seems to distract from it.  If the theme is frustrated musician, then there isn''t enough supporting elements for the musical side.</td>', 'The image is technically well done, but somewhat cliche.  I''d also question the violin.  If the theme is suicide, then music seems to distract from it.  If the theme is frustrated musician, then there isn''t enough supporting elements for the musical side.', '2005-06-15 10:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1457390, 190218, 20204, '<td valign="top">I''ve always wanted to try star trails, cool effect.  The only thing I''d suggest is a calmer night; the boat''s motion turned it a bit too soft for my liking.  Otherwise, a great composition and idea.</td>', 'I''ve always wanted to try star trails, cool effect.  The only thing I''d suggest is a calmer night; the boat''s motion turned it a bit too soft for my liking.  Otherwise, a great composition and idea.', '2005-06-15 10:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
