(1457949, 188242, 38032, '<td valign="top">I don''t get it - is this a real photograph that you took - or something else? ...<br/>The question is:  You took an image at sunset (or sunrise) with that bolt of lightning ... and a hand was in from of the camera??? ... Or is this an image of another image - with a hand in front of it.  <br/>The lightnight looks a little radical to actually be reall ... and in the last week - so I''m just curious if I''m missing something!</td>', 'I don''t get it - is this a real photograph that you took - or something else? ...The question is:  You took an image at sunset (or sunrise) with that bolt of lightning ... and a hand was in from of the camera??? ... Or is this an image of another image - with a hand in front of it.  The lightnight looks a little radical to actually be reall ... and in the last week - so I''m just curious if I''m missing something!', '2005-06-15 13:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
