(1458222, 188343, 39075, '<td valign="top">Not sure I like the red.  I like the glow.  I would like it better if it was toned down a little.  Good composition.</td>', 'Not sure I like the red.  I like the glow.  I would like it better if it was toned down a little.  Good composition.', '2005-06-15 14:59:48.000000', NULL, 1),
