(1458244, 190181, 39075, '<td valign="top">I think all of the red and off white colors distract from the darkness.  I like the concept though.</td>', 'I think all of the red and off white colors distract from the darkness.  I like the concept though.', '2005-06-15 15:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
