(1458272, 188800, 20530, '<td valign="top">Love the composition of this one.  The white area on the left effectively serves as an entry point. My eye is immediately drawn in and follows the white rail right into the darkness.  The pole emphasizes this, by acting as an arrow pointing down. Much more than a picture of a stairway.</td>', 'Love the composition of this one.  The white area on the left effectively serves as an entry point. My eye is immediately drawn in and follows the white rail right into the darkness.  The pole emphasizes this, by acting as an arrow pointing down. Much more than a picture of a stairway.', '2005-06-15 15:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1458274, 188910, 21915, '<td valign="top">untitled ?</td>', 'untitled ?', '2005-06-15 15:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1458276, 190175, 20530, '<td valign="top">Cool buzzard. Great capture and nice backlighting. The busy background is distracting to me, however.</td>', 'Cool buzzard. Great capture and nice backlighting. The busy background is distracting to me, however.', '2005-06-15 15:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
