(1458353, 188235, 20530, '<td valign="top">I''m giving this one a high score because the title really does it for me. Takes guts to say that out loud. I also like the silhouette against the light cloud. The halo is a little distracting to me, and I wonder how it would have looked as a vertical image with more of the steeple showing?</td>', 'I''m giving this one a high score because the title really does it for me. Takes guts to say that out loud. I also like the silhouette against the light cloud. The halo is a little distracting to me, and I wonder how it would have looked as a vertical image with more of the steeple showing?', '2005-06-15 15:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1458355, 189081, 20530, '<td valign="top">Nice title. Really puts it into perspective. I like the highlights visible on his body and legs. The large tree in the background effectively serves to emphasize the feeling of despair.</td>', 'Nice title. Really puts it into perspective. I like the highlights visible on his body and legs. The large tree in the background effectively serves to emphasize the feeling of despair.', '2005-06-15 15:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1458356, 188316, 36583, '<td valign="top">I like this shot a great deal. This may be one of my favorites in the challenge. A great BW shot with terrific textures. Plus, the whole "off into the scary unknown" story it tells fits the challenge and you didn''t even have to take the picture in the dark!</td>', 'I like this shot a great deal. This may be one of my favorites in the challenge. A great BW shot with terrific textures. Plus, the whole "off into the scary unknown" story it tells fits the challenge and you didn''t even have to take the picture in the dark!', '2005-06-15 15:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1458357, 190154, 36583, '<td valign="top">I like the light in the eyes... Very cool. I would have preferred focus, but you may have been going for this.</td>', 'I like the light in the eyes... Very cool. I would have preferred focus, but you may have been going for this.', '2005-06-15 15:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1458362, 189030, 20530, '<td valign="top">Very touching. Actually brought tears to my eyes. I''m reluctant to criticize it, but the harsh yellow color detracts from the image, in my eyes. Also would have liked to see the ring in focus and perhaps reflecting more light.</td>', 'Very touching. Actually brought tears to my eyes. I''m reluctant to criticize it, but the harsh yellow color detracts from the image, in my eyes. Also would have liked to see the ring in focus and perhaps reflecting more light.', '2005-06-15 15:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1458363, 187510, 36583, '<td valign="top">I really am not sure what this is (I see the title), but it''s pretty cool. There''s a weird zombies at night kind of thing going for me, which may be the result of looking for the "darkness" in the shot. Well captured.</td>', 'I really am not sure what this is (I see the title), but it''s pretty cool. There''s a weird zombies at night kind of thing going for me, which may be the result of looking for the "darkness" in the shot. Well captured.', '2005-06-15 15:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1458364, 190155, 37410, '<td valign="top">wonderful! good job 10</td>', 'wonderful! good job 10', '2005-06-15 15:51:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1458365, 189708, 33947, '<td valign="top">Lighting is special and neat. Too bad the water doesn''t look more like water and less like a mushy blur.</td>', 'Lighting is special and neat. Too bad the water doesn''t look more like water and less like a mushy blur.', '2005-06-15 15:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1458366, 190184, 37410, '<td valign="top">good idea, I like the shot</td>', 'good idea, I like the shot', '2005-06-15 15:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1458369, 189310, 33947, '<td valign="top">Great take on the challenge. A hard idea to execute given your subject, but, I give you points for trying. 6</td>', 'Great take on the challenge. A hard idea to execute given your subject, but, I give you points for trying. 6', '2005-06-15 15:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1458373, 190218, 20530, '<td valign="top">Like the image. It''s almost 2 photographs in one. Too bad there wasn''t a stationary object in the foreground to give it more interest.</td>', 'Like the image. It''s almost 2 photographs in one. Too bad there wasn''t a stationary object in the foreground to give it more interest.', '2005-06-15 15:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1458378, 190302, 30061, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of this shot.  The candle is great, as is the movement of the flame.  However, the face loses something for me.  I think perhaps if the slope of the nose showed more so that it didn''t seem cut off, it would have been less distracting.  As it is, my eye tends to be drawn toward the nostril rather than the overall photo.  Again, great idea.</td>', 'I like the idea of this shot.  The candle is great, as is the movement of the flame.  However, the face loses something for me.  I think perhaps if the slope of the nose showed more so that it didn''t seem cut off, it would have been less distracting.  As it is, my eye tends to be drawn toward the nostril rather than the overall photo.  Again, great idea.', '2005-06-15 15:58:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1458384, 188584, 33947, '<td valign="top">I like your idea. Fits the challenge well. Look out, birdie.</td>', 'I like your idea. Fits the challenge well. Look out, birdie.', '2005-06-15 15:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1458385, 189173, 32714, '<td valign="top">I would love to see this photo in color.</td>', 'I would love to see this photo in color.', '2005-06-15 15:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
