(1458910, 189034, 19025, '<td valign="top">I saw a black widow in my lawn chair and almost sat on it..this is good for darkness...scared the crap out of me when I saw it...lol.</td>', 'I saw a black widow in my lawn chair and almost sat on it..this is good for darkness...scared the crap out of me when I saw it...lol.', '2005-06-15 19:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
