(1458963, 189739, 24099, '<td valign="top">nice focus.  You could have dressed her in shabby clothes and made her look homeless.  that would have really driven the point home.  The Flash was a bad call, a street light would have looked more convincing.  Black and white was great call.   I gave you a 6.</td>', 'nice focus.  You could have dressed her in shabby clothes and made her look homeless.  that would have really driven the point home.  The Flash was a bad call, a street light would have looked more convincing.  Black and white was great call.   I gave you a 6.', '2005-06-15 19:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1458965, 189616, 21183, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  Pure and simple. One little candle with so much black space around it really seems to emphasise the ''darkness'', even though the eye becomes drawn toward the flame of the candle. Your photo, I think, meets the challenge well and works for me on both an artistic and emotional level. I''m still learning about the  technical side of photography, so I don''t feel able to comment on ways you might improve on that, but the image looks clear - in focus - and I like the composition.  Giving this a 10.</td>', 'Beautiful.  Pure and simple. One little candle with so much black space around it really seems to emphasise the ''darkness'', even though the eye becomes drawn toward the flame of the candle. Your photo, I think, meets the challenge well and works for me on both an artistic and emotional level. I''m still learning about the  technical side of photography, so I don''t feel able to comment on ways you might improve on that, but the image looks clear - in focus - and I like the composition.  Giving this a 10.', '2005-06-15 19:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1458966, 190161, 19025, '<td valign="top">made me cry...i was homeless once...short time ago..</td>', 'made me cry...i was homeless once...short time ago..', '2005-06-15 19:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1458967, 189587, 37330, '<td valign="top">The concept of this picture is well thought out.  The contrast of black in the back to the light shinning from above onto the hand is beautiful. Having the bars not perfectly centered definitely adds some dynamics to the picture. An all around great picture!</td>', 'The concept of this picture is well thought out.  The contrast of black in the back to the light shinning from above onto the hand is beautiful. Having the bars not perfectly centered definitely adds some dynamics to the picture. An all around great picture!', '2005-06-15 19:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1458970, 189592, 30817, '<td valign="top">I admire your ingenuity and creative voice.  This is one of the better textured abstracts I have seen in a very long time.  I have always felt that when unknown objects within the frame of a photograph create a bridge to the viewer ... the process is akin to developing a friendship.</td>', 'I admire your ingenuity and creative voice.  This is one of the better textured abstracts I have seen in a very long time.  I have always felt that when unknown objects within the frame of a photograph create a bridge to the viewer ... the process is akin to developing a friendship.', '2005-06-15 19:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1458980, 186975, 37302, '<td valign="top">this is okay, but i do not like the weird frame you put on it and there is nothing here that really jumps out at me</td>', 'this is okay, but i do not like the weird frame you put on it and there is nothing here that really jumps out at me', '2005-06-15 20:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1458982, 190185, 37302, '<td valign="top">nice fireworks shot 7</td>', 'nice fireworks shot 7', '2005-06-15 20:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1458983, 190247, 37302, '<td valign="top">original 7<br/></td>', 'original 7', '2005-06-15 20:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1458984, 187434, 37302, '<td valign="top">very grainy</td>', 'very grainy', '2005-06-15 20:09:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1458985, 188364, 37302, '<td valign="top">you should up your contrast on this. also leave the frames off they do nothing for your photo</td>', 'you should up your contrast on this. also leave the frames off they do nothing for your photo', '2005-06-15 20:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1458988, 190213, 32754, '<td valign="top">Smoky green background and silhouetted singer really work well here..I like the sense of hands moving with motion blur...composition is excellent...8</td>', 'Smoky green background and silhouetted singer really work well here..I like the sense of hands moving with motion blur...composition is excellent...8', '2005-06-15 20:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1458989, 189775, 37302, '<td valign="top">My first 10 very nice. did you catch anything?</td>', 'My first 10 very nice. did you catch anything?', '2005-06-15 20:11:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1458990, 189331, 35548, '<td valign="top">Hey is that the toenail fungus thing a do dad I have seen on tv commercials?  If darkness means that, keep your shoes on and stay out in the sun :-) 6</td>', 'Hey is that the toenail fungus thing a do dad I have seen on tv commercials?  If darkness means that, keep your shoes on and stay out in the sun :-) 6', '2005-06-15 20:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1458991, 187064, 35548, '<td valign="top">I think your message is being lost in an out of focus photo.  3</td>', 'I think your message is being lost in an out of focus photo.  3', '2005-06-15 20:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1458992, 189018, 37302, '<td valign="top">this is fun and I love it 10</td>', 'this is fun and I love it 10', '2005-06-15 20:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1458993, 187746, 35548, '<td valign="top">I like this,  you printed this so close to the edge I think some folk are going to miss the image, but that is what I like the most about it. 8</td>', 'I like this,  you printed this so close to the edge I think some folk are going to miss the image, but that is what I like the most about it. 8', '2005-06-15 20:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1458995, 189409, 37302, '<td valign="top">very grainy <br/></td>', 'very grainy ', '2005-06-15 20:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1458998, 190302, 37302, '<td valign="top">like the photo hate the frame.</td>', 'like the photo hate the frame.', '2005-06-15 20:17:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459000, 190271, 37302, '<td valign="top">photo is okay the frame is not needed</td>', 'photo is okay the frame is not needed', '2005-06-15 20:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459001, 189299, 11923, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if the fuzzy nature of this image is intentional but I love the abstract aspect of it.  I think the title fits the image in general and works for the challenge and I like the black/white look.  It does strain my eyes a bit because of the blur, but overall I really enjoy it.  It possibly will be voted down by many but I think there''s a good crispness (despite the subject appearing blurry) and nice tones, the abstract nature really gives it oomph, so I''m giving a 6.</td>', 'I''m not sure if the fuzzy nature of this image is intentional but I love the abstract aspect of it.  I think the title fits the image in general and works for the challenge and I like the black/white look.  It does strain my eyes a bit because of the blur, but overall I really enjoy it.  It possibly will be voted down by many but I think there''s a good crispness (despite the subject appearing blurry) and nice tones, the abstract nature really gives it oomph, so I''m giving a 6.', '2005-06-15 20:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459002, 189940, 35548, '<td valign="top">The stem in this image realy needs to be in focus. if it were, you would have a nice photo.</td>', 'The stem in this image realy needs to be in focus. if it were, you would have a nice photo.', '2005-06-15 20:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459003, 187475, 11923, '<td valign="top">Love the title!  Very striking image, I enjoy the red on black look.  Good clarity/focus, interesting use of the subject.  Well done.  6</td>', 'Love the title!  Very striking image, I enjoy the red on black look.  Good clarity/focus, interesting use of the subject.  Well done.  6', '2005-06-15 20:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459006, 190254, 35548, '<td valign="top">photo quality is suffering from something.</td>', 'photo quality is suffering from something.', '2005-06-15 20:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459008, 190285, 37302, '<td valign="top">very nicely done.</td>', 'very nicely done.', '2005-06-15 20:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459009, 189325, 11923, '<td valign="top">I think you did a very good job in using candlelight in your image, I always muss it up when I try, there''s a healthy glow and the colors still have a nice richness.  I think the image suffers a bit in composition though.  The candles don''t have a.. hmm.. purpose in their arrangement - which could very well have been intentional - and that makes the placement seem careless.  That carelessness (just my interpretation!) distracts me.  The colors as I said are very nice with the candlelight, the focus is a bit soft, but I''ve found it difficult to get a crisp image using soft light, so you''ve done very well there.  The only other suggestion besides a different arrangement of the subject is a border to pull everything together.  I think this image would benefit from one.  Nice work!  5.</td>', 'I think you did a very good job in using candlelight in your image, I always muss it up when I try, there''s a healthy glow and the colors still have a nice richness.  I think the image suffers a bit in composition though.  The candles don''t have a.. hmm.. purpose in their arrangement - which could very well have been intentional - and that makes the placement seem careless.  That carelessness (just my interpretation!) distracts me.  The colors as I said are very nice with the candlelight, the focus is a bit soft, but I''ve found it difficult to get a crisp image using soft light, so you''ve done very well there.  The only other suggestion besides a different arrangement of the subject is a border to pull everything together.  I think this image would benefit from one.  Nice work!  5.', '2005-06-15 20:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459011, 190306, 37302, '<td valign="top">i like the shot, i do not like the frame. I have seen this a lot on this challenge. I think your photo should stand on it''s own without a frame. don''t you think this photo does? i do.</td>', 'i like the shot, i do not like the frame. I have seen this a lot on this challenge. I think your photo should stand on it''s own without a frame. don''t you think this photo does? i do.', '2005-06-15 20:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459013, 190158, 11923, '<td valign="top">Beautiful crispness, the white seems just a shade blown out on the left side and the shadows on the right unbalance it as well, if it was toned a bit down on the left and brightened a bit on the right I think it''d be perfect.  The colors work really well together, the white with the darkness of the guinness and the rust color of the brick is nice.   I think as another suggestion I would crop the image at the top right below that first flower, or if possible swap in a basket with ONLY greenery, no colorful flowers, they distract my eye away from the subject and the colors don''t quite match the look of the rest of the image.  Other than the fact that guinness is soooo gross tasting, I''ve no other comments!  :)   Very nice.  I gave a 6</td>', 'Beautiful crispness, the white seems just a shade blown out on the left side and the shadows on the right unbalance it as well, if it was toned a bit down on the left and brightened a bit on the right I think it''d be perfect.  The colors work really well together, the white with the darkness of the guinness and the rust color of the brick is nice.   I think as another suggestion I would crop the image at the top right below that first flower, or if possible swap in a basket with ONLY greenery, no colorful flowers, they distract my eye away from the subject and the colors don''t quite match the look of the rest of the image.  Other than the fact that guinness is soooo gross tasting, I''ve no other comments!  :)   Very nice.  I gave a 6', '2005-06-15 20:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459016, 188059, 11923, '<td valign="top">Now this is dark.  Both in the emotion and in the image itself.  Great title, nice tones.  I wish there was a bit more ''grit'' to it, physically - maybe dirtied hands or something, but otherwise, I really dig it.  - 7.</td>', 'Now this is dark.  Both in the emotion and in the image itself.  Great title, nice tones.  I wish there was a bit more ''grit'' to it, physically - maybe dirtied hands or something, but otherwise, I really dig it.  - 7.', '2005-06-15 20:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459020, 188784, 11923, '<td valign="top">Yikes, with landmarks like that you''ll be lucky to end up in the right state/country.  Interesting take on the challenge, I like the abstract nature but I wish there was something a bit more.. I don''t know.. solid to the image to anchor it a bit.  I realize its showing something alcohol induced but I think if you had something solid to counter-balance the floating squiggles it might enhance the intoxicated look to the image.  With an image like this I also think a simple black border might tie it all together, my eyes tend to wander out of the picture as I follow the squiggles up and to the right.  Interesting.  4.</td>', 'Yikes, with landmarks like that you''ll be lucky to end up in the right state/country.  Interesting take on the challenge, I like the abstract nature but I wish there was something a bit more.. I don''t know.. solid to the image to anchor it a bit.  I realize its showing something alcohol induced but I think if you had something solid to counter-balance the floating squiggles it might enhance the intoxicated look to the image.  With an image like this I also think a simple black border might tie it all together, my eyes tend to wander out of the picture as I follow the squiggles up and to the right.  Interesting.  4.', '2005-06-15 20:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459024, 189708, 11923, '<td valign="top">Beautiful tones, lovely image and very nice clarity/focus, but I don''t envision ''darkness'' when I see this really.  That said, obviously you do so its really a moot point.  The picture doesn''t speak to me of darkness so I''m scoring on general impact and technical work.  I gave a 6</td>', 'Beautiful tones, lovely image and very nice clarity/focus, but I don''t envision ''darkness'' when I see this really.  That said, obviously you do so its really a moot point.  The picture doesn''t speak to me of darkness so I''m scoring on general impact and technical work.  I gave a 6', '2005-06-15 20:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459028, 189030, 11923, '<td valign="top">I think the title is carrying a heavy burden in this image, conveying what you see with the picture - I have done this as well, its not a bad thing necessarily.  That said, I DO see (just based on the picture alone) many ways it could be interpreted with something dark, there is definitely an emotive aspect to it and the imagination can come up with a number of scenarios light &amp; dark from it.  I would say with a sharper focus and perhaps a slight shift to the left, so the frame on the left is completely in the photo and there isn''t that blackness on the right it would be an even better image.  I gave a 4.</td>', 'I think the title is carrying a heavy burden in this image, conveying what you see with the picture - I have done this as well, its not a bad thing necessarily.  That said, I DO see (just based on the picture alone) many ways it could be interpreted with something dark, there is definitely an emotive aspect to it and the imagination can come up with a number of scenarios light & dark from it.  I would say with a sharper focus and perhaps a slight shift to the left, so the frame on the left is completely in the photo and there isn''t that blackness on the right it would be an even better image.  I gave a 4.', '2005-06-15 20:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459037, 189598, 11923, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid I don''t relate to the darkness you''re trying to convey here.  In general, I find the composition a bit uninspired - what are you trying to say with the frog  being alone?  Is it loneliness?  Ugliness?  Both?  Being little in a big world?  Being drab in a colorful world?  Any of those could be dark related but I can''t see your vision at the moment.   I think the focus is pretty good, the lighting is decent, though could be better.  I would have to say that the biggest improvement would be an evident purpose in the composition.  That said, it could just be me as a random viewer who is missing something obvious, which wouldn''t be the first time.  I can only go with what I see/interpret so  I gave a 3.</td>', 'I''m afraid I don''t relate to the darkness you''re trying to convey here.  In general, I find the composition a bit uninspired - what are you trying to say with the frog  being alone?  Is it loneliness?  Ugliness?  Both?  Being little in a big world?  Being drab in a colorful world?  Any of those could be dark related but I can''t see your vision at the moment.   I think the focus is pretty good, the lighting is decent, though could be better.  I would have to say that the biggest improvement would be an evident purpose in the composition.  That said, it could just be me as a random viewer who is missing something obvious, which wouldn''t be the first time.  I can only go with what I see/interpret so  I gave a 3.', '2005-06-15 20:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459038, 187982, 36050, '<td valign="top">It has to much blur, and I can''t see clearly were is the darkness approaching.</td>', 'It has to much blur, and I can''t see clearly were is the darkness approaching.', '2005-06-15 20:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459042, 188138, 36050, '<td valign="top">Maybe you tried to get the expresion on the face of the boy, but it''s to dark.</td>', 'Maybe you tried to get the expresion on the face of the boy, but it''s to dark.', '2005-06-15 20:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459044, 188138, 11923, '<td valign="top">I''m really enjoying this.  The pose is unusual, fantastic, even the fact that the model is centered doesn''t hurt the image.  I like the play on darkness both in the color of skin and the use of silhouette.  My only wishes are that the background would be a little brighter to give a greater contrast, the line across the back be a bit more even and maybe a slim black border to finish off the image.  I''m guessing this was posed but if not and you happened to catch it on the fly, its very nicely done (even if it is posed its great).  I gave a 6.</td>', 'I''m really enjoying this.  The pose is unusual, fantastic, even the fact that the model is centered doesn''t hurt the image.  I like the play on darkness both in the color of skin and the use of silhouette.  My only wishes are that the background would be a little brighter to give a greater contrast, the line across the back be a bit more even and maybe a slim black border to finish off the image.  I''m guessing this was posed but if not and you happened to catch it on the fly, its very nicely done (even if it is posed its great).  I gave a 6.', '2005-06-15 20:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459045, 190219, 36050, '<td valign="top">Maybe a little bit less light could represent it better.</td>', 'Maybe a little bit less light could represent it better.', '2005-06-15 20:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459051, 190128, 36050, '<td valign="top">Crop part of the floor in the bottom, and it''s blurry, maybe because of the exposition time.</td>', 'Crop part of the floor in the bottom, and it''s blurry, maybe because of the exposition time.', '2005-06-15 20:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459052, 189307, 11923, '<td valign="top">I was going to just rate this and move on but I figured I''d do better to comment as well.  I found myself a bit disappointed in the image due to the title.  The title gave me an expectation of light being explored somehow that I didn''t find the image to live up to.  It definitely fits the challenge and the greeny-yellow color works well against the black background but I''m not finding anything that captures my attention with the composition.  If an example of what I''m trying to say would help, the first thing that comes to mind when thinking of your title and an idea of a photograph that could portray it, would be an image of dustmotes in a stream of light, this I think would give some interesting things for the viewer to look at and (to me) delves more into the wonder of light.  But that''s just my opinion and as we know everyone has them for better or worse.  I hope this helps in some way!  I gave a 3</td>', 'I was going to just rate this and move on but I figured I''d do better to comment as well.  I found myself a bit disappointed in the image due to the title.  The title gave me an expectation of light being explored somehow that I didn''t find the image to live up to.  It definitely fits the challenge and the greeny-yellow color works well against the black background but I''m not finding anything that captures my attention with the composition.  If an example of what I''m trying to say would help, the first thing that comes to mind when thinking of your title and an idea of a photograph that could portray it, would be an image of dustmotes in a stream of light, this I think would give some interesting things for the viewer to look at and (to me) delves more into the wonder of light.  But that''s just my opinion and as we know everyone has them for better or worse.  I hope this helps in some way!  I gave a 3', '2005-06-15 20:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459053, 190263, 36050, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, creepy. Maybe the shoes of the girl on the right are not the best ones, but it''s nice.</td>', 'Nice photo, creepy. Maybe the shoes of the girl on the right are not the best ones, but it''s nice.', '2005-06-15 20:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459054, 189030, 33400, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but I don''t see it on this one.  Also, the wedding ring is on the wrong hand.</td>', 'Sorry, but I don''t see it on this one.  Also, the wedding ring is on the wrong hand.', '2005-06-15 20:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459055, 190256, 36050, '<td valign="top">Too much smoke. Maybe the same factory in the middle of the night, without the smoke.</td>', 'Too much smoke. Maybe the same factory in the middle of the night, without the smoke.', '2005-06-15 20:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459059, 190166, 11923, '<td valign="top">Nice dank image.  I like the emotion behind it and the title.  I enjoy the atmosphere where its created.  There are a couple of things I''d suggest trying differently if you''ve a mind to:  Shifting the focus of the image just a smidge to the right so you cut out the beginning of the wall on the left where it triangles out and changing the color of your models skirt.  The pristine nature of the white seems very out of place in the environment and with what she''s wearing.  I''m not sure why.   It DOES pull your attention TO the model but just something about its extreme contrast to the surroundings seems a bit off.  Maybe if it was dirtier or a more muted color.. not sure.   Oh.. maybe if just a hint of the model''s face was visible, that might be an idea, maybe just seeing one eye peeking through her hair.. not a huge deal really though.  I think this is a great image over all, I gave a 6.</td>', 'Nice dank image.  I like the emotion behind it and the title.  I enjoy the atmosphere where its created.  There are a couple of things I''d suggest trying differently if you''ve a mind to:  Shifting the focus of the image just a smidge to the right so you cut out the beginning of the wall on the left where it triangles out and changing the color of your models skirt.  The pristine nature of the white seems very out of place in the environment and with what she''s wearing.  I''m not sure why.   It DOES pull your attention TO the model but just something about its extreme contrast to the surroundings seems a bit off.  Maybe if it was dirtier or a more muted color.. not sure.   Oh.. maybe if just a hint of the model''s face was visible, that might be an idea, maybe just seeing one eye peeking through her hair.. not a huge deal really though.  I think this is a great image over all, I gave a 6.', '2005-06-15 20:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459060, 189521, 11923, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective, great colors, great focus/clarity.  I love the tones, its got a nice richness and I of course love the textures surrounding the whole picture.  The only nitpick I have would be to crop it a bit more on the left to get rid of what looks like a glare spot in the bottom left.  Nicely done.  I gave a 7.</td>', 'Nice perspective, great colors, great focus/clarity.  I love the tones, its got a nice richness and I of course love the textures surrounding the whole picture.  The only nitpick I have would be to crop it a bit more on the left to get rid of what looks like a glare spot in the bottom left.  Nicely done.  I gave a 7.', '2005-06-15 20:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459063, 189029, 33400, '<td valign="top">I''m wondering if the one stone that is angled and brighter was intentional?<br/>Nice pic.</td>', 'I''m wondering if the one stone that is angled and brighter was intentional?Nice pic.', '2005-06-15 21:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459067, 189776, 11923, '<td valign="top">I see the correlation to darkness and I think the idea is a great one.  I''m not sure the composition pulls it off however.  As a suggestion to try, I would go from a different angle, so the fern left is perpendicular to you  --| it''d be sticking out that way instead of towards you, then if possible have most of it blending into a black background and use some placed light sources to shine down on the end of the fern so you see how it is in fact trying to reach the light, even better might be to have the light source shining at a spot just beyond the fern''s reach to give the struggle a bit more oomph.  As it is, the image has some lovely rich color but the focus is just a bit soft and I think the impact is soft too based on the title/idea it appears you''re trying to convey.  I gave a 4.</td>', 'I see the correlation to darkness and I think the idea is a great one.  I''m not sure the composition pulls it off however.  As a suggestion to try, I would go from a different angle, so the fern left is perpendicular to you  --| it''d be sticking out that way instead of towards you, then if possible have most of it blending into a black background and use some placed light sources to shine down on the end of the fern so you see how it is in fact trying to reach the light, even better might be to have the light source shining at a spot just beyond the fern''s reach to give the struggle a bit more oomph.  As it is, the image has some lovely rich color but the focus is just a bit soft and I think the impact is soft too based on the title/idea it appears you''re trying to convey.  I gave a 4.', '2005-06-15 21:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459068, 187364, 36831, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Might be even better with longer focus... maybe not.</td>', 'Very nice. Might be even better with longer focus... maybe not.', '2005-06-15 21:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459072, 190252, 36831, '<td valign="top">Great use of shadows.</td>', 'Great use of shadows.', '2005-06-15 21:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459073, 189733, 11923, '<td valign="top">Hahaha.  Nice.  Not sure if everyone else will find this as amusing as I do, but I enjoyed it.  The lettering is a bit soft on focus and I think for the best impact it should be bold and bright.  Good times.  I gave a 5.</td>', 'Hahaha.  Nice.  Not sure if everyone else will find this as amusing as I do, but I enjoyed it.  The lettering is a bit soft on focus and I think for the best impact it should be bold and bright.  Good times.  I gave a 5.', '2005-06-15 21:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459074, 190276, 33400, '<td valign="top">I get it, but at first thought the title was "Blind" - which I think would have been closer to this.  Very interesting picture.  Good job.</td>', 'I get it, but at first thought the title was "Blind" - which I think would have been closer to this.  Very interesting picture.  Good job.', '2005-06-15 21:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459080, 189516, 36831, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot. Love the composition. Great name. Why are the trees leafless in mid-june?</td>', 'Excellent shot. Love the composition. Great name. Why are the trees leafless in mid-june?', '2005-06-15 21:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459082, 189540, 11923, '<td valign="top">Other than the candle feeling a bit too cropped off at the bottom I think this is fantastic!  Well.. actually if there was any way to highlight just the smoke with a strategically placed light source I think that''d be the only other thing that''d make the image better.  Even though the darkness is what is being portrayed a smidge more light (on the smoke) would give just a nice highlight I think.  I gave a 7</td>', 'Other than the candle feeling a bit too cropped off at the bottom I think this is fantastic!  Well.. actually if there was any way to highlight just the smoke with a strategically placed light source I think that''d be the only other thing that''d make the image better.  Even though the darkness is what is being portrayed a smidge more light (on the smoke) would give just a nice highlight I think.  I gave a 7', '2005-06-15 21:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459084, 190129, 36831, '<td valign="top">Very original.</td>', 'Very original.', '2005-06-15 21:09:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459088, 189521, 36831, '<td valign="top">Lens envy...</td>', 'Lens envy...', '2005-06-15 21:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459095, 190283, 11923, '<td valign="top">I really like how different this looks.  Great colors and the texture showing with the way the colors are manifested is wonderful.  Has a very spooky feeling to it.  I gave a 6.</td>', 'I really like how different this looks.  Great colors and the texture showing with the way the colors are manifested is wonderful.  Has a very spooky feeling to it.  I gave a 6.', '2005-06-15 21:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459097, 190274, 554, '<td valign="top">perfect use of b/w and grain.....good job</td>', 'perfect use of b/w and grain.....good job', '2005-06-15 21:11:31.000000', NULL, 1),
