(1459237, 187539, 38072, '<td valign="top">I like the "looking-through-the-door" idea here.  I''m wondering if it would be more effective to have the darkness be on the *other* side of the door -- so we''re looking at the darkness rather than looking at the light.  I dunno... I''m just rambling I guess.  6</td>', 'I like the "looking-through-the-door" idea here.  I''m wondering if it would be more effective to have the darkness be on the *other* side of the door -- so we''re looking at the darkness rather than looking at the light.  I dunno... I''m just rambling I guess.  6', '2005-06-15 22:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
