(1459496, 190125, 39075, '<td valign="top">Nice use of the word death.  I would have liked to have seen the focus shifted a little so "death" was all in focus with "our" fadding away.</td>', 'Nice use of the word death.  I would have liked to have seen the focus shifted a little so "death" was all in focus with "our" fadding away.', '2005-06-16 00:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459516, 188242, 37719, '<td valign="top">If the hand wasn''t in the photo this would have been a stronger entry.</td>', 'If the hand wasn''t in the photo this would have been a stronger entry.', '2005-06-16 00:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459545, 187929, 21714, '<td valign="top">Sad and frightening. I like it.<br/>I do however feel that some grain or noise would add more character to the image. I think it''s a bit too smooth to create the full impact since you''re not really talking of peace and calm here. <br/>It works the way it is, but, an opinion.</td>', 'Sad and frightening. I like it.I do however feel that some grain or noise would add more character to the image. I think it''s a bit too smooth to create the full impact since you''re not really talking of peace and calm here. It works the way it is, but, an opinion.', '2005-06-16 00:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459572, 187294, 36323, '<td valign="top">love the expression</td>', 'love the expression', '2005-06-16 00:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459578, 186975, 37252, '<td valign="top">too small to really give a good eval. You may want to check out the tutorials for how to resize for DPC</td>', 'too small to really give a good eval. You may want to check out the tutorials for how to resize for DPC', '2005-06-16 00:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459582, 189462, 37103, '<td valign="top">This photo is just magic.  I''m adding it to my favorites and I hope it wins.  I love that the pony on the left fades into darkness, the white pony is a great counterpoint.  One seems to be moving toward the darkness, the other afraid of it.  And if all that isn''t great enough you have the skyline in the back with just the perfect hint of sunset.  I''m a huge fan, good luck. 10.</td>', 'This photo is just magic.  I''m adding it to my favorites and I hope it wins.  I love that the pony on the left fades into darkness, the white pony is a great counterpoint.  One seems to be moving toward the darkness, the other afraid of it.  And if all that isn''t great enough you have the skyline in the back with just the perfect hint of sunset.  I''m a huge fan, good luck. 10.', '2005-06-16 00:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459584, 187475, 37103, '<td valign="top">This photo is in my top two for this challenge.  What an eerie, creepy great interpretation of darkness.  I don''t know how you managed to get all the feet exposed the same amount and lined up almost exactly the same.  I love the implication that there is a line to get into hell (at least that''s how I read it).  Excellent use of perspective, excellent idea.  I would love to hear how this one was done. 10.</td>', 'This photo is in my top two for this challenge.  What an eerie, creepy great interpretation of darkness.  I don''t know how you managed to get all the feet exposed the same amount and lined up almost exactly the same.  I love the implication that there is a line to get into hell (at least that''s how I read it).  Excellent use of perspective, excellent idea.  I would love to hear how this one was done. 10.', '2005-06-16 00:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459586, 190282, 37103, '<td valign="top">I like this idea, but unfortunatley it does not translate to darkness for me.  Yes the flash illuminates darkness, but there just isn''t enough of a connection for me.  I don''t know how much you played with changing the darkness, but a darker image with more contrast might have added a nice touch.</td>', 'I like this idea, but unfortunatley it does not translate to darkness for me.  Yes the flash illuminates darkness, but there just isn''t enough of a connection for me.  I don''t know how much you played with changing the darkness, but a darker image with more contrast might have added a nice touch.', '2005-06-16 01:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459588, 189299, 37103, '<td valign="top">I can''t make out what I''m seeing in this photo, and for me that makes it difficult to understand how it is a reference to darkness.</td>', 'I can''t make out what I''m seeing in this photo, and for me that makes it difficult to understand how it is a reference to darkness.', '2005-06-16 01:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459589, 188667, 37103, '<td valign="top">I do like the idea of using lightning, but the rest of this image is so grainy and the foreground is so dark that it creates problems.  Maybe if you cropped the iamge right below the line between the trees and the sky it would be a more powerful image.</td>', 'I do like the idea of using lightning, but the rest of this image is so grainy and the foreground is so dark that it creates problems.  Maybe if you cropped the iamge right below the line between the trees and the sky it would be a more powerful image.', '2005-06-16 01:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459590, 187573, 37103, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see what this image looked like when it was 640 pixels in width and more in focus.  I think that would also improve viewers response to it.</td>', 'I would have liked to see what this image looked like when it was 640 pixels in width and more in focus.  I think that would also improve viewers response to it.', '2005-06-16 01:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459595, 189410, 39111, '<td valign="top">sorry, i don''t see how this fits the "darkness" challenge.</td>', 'sorry, i don''t see how this fits the "darkness" challenge.', '2005-06-16 01:06:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459596, 187192, 37103, '<td valign="top">This photo did not really fit this challenge for me.  All the lines of all the branches in the background are a little distracting.  If the tree was really dead/burned it would be nice to have that be more apparent.</td>', 'This photo did not really fit this challenge for me.  All the lines of all the branches in the background are a little distracting.  If the tree was really dead/burned it would be nice to have that be more apparent.', '2005-06-16 01:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459597, 189307, 37103, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what the object is in this photo.  I think it may be more compelling if we could see what it is.  Right now it just appears to be circles on a black background which does not really suggest darkness to me.  I may be missing something, but it''s nice to have a photo that makes a good strong connection to the challenge topic.</td>', 'I''m not sure what the object is in this photo.  I think it may be more compelling if we could see what it is.  Right now it just appears to be circles on a black background which does not really suggest darkness to me.  I may be missing something, but it''s nice to have a photo that makes a good strong connection to the challenge topic.', '2005-06-16 01:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459598, 188674, 39111, '<td valign="top">there are hardly any grays in this pic.  i must assume that''s what you were going for, but it''s not so appealing for me.  i would have liked to make out a bit more of the tombstone.</td>', 'there are hardly any grays in this pic.  i must assume that''s what you were going for, but it''s not so appealing for me.  i would have liked to make out a bit more of the tombstone.', '2005-06-16 01:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459599, 187419, 37103, '<td valign="top">To me although this is a photo of a lightbulb it does not convey darkness (either in itself, or in the emotion it provokes).  Perhaps if the lamp were surrounded by darkness it would have more symbolic meaning.</td>', 'To me although this is a photo of a lightbulb it does not convey darkness (either in itself, or in the emotion it provokes).  Perhaps if the lamp were surrounded by darkness it would have more symbolic meaning.', '2005-06-16 01:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
