(1459665, 189232, 39111, '<td valign="top">i have no idea what this is and the title doesn''t help.  also, sorry, i don''t really feel ''darkness'' with this shot and the title cements that feeling.</td>', 'i have no idea what this is and the title doesn''t help.  also, sorry, i don''t really feel ''darkness'' with this shot and the title cements that feeling.', '2005-06-16 01:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459667, 190166, 39111, '<td valign="top">where was this taken?  this is one of the few shots that went for (in my opinion) human darkness, i.e. suffering, hate, anger, loss, etc and GOT IT!  i love it, so raw.</td>', 'where was this taken?  this is one of the few shots that went for (in my opinion) human darkness, i.e. suffering, hate, anger, loss, etc and GOT IT!  i love it, so raw.', '2005-06-16 01:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459668, 188748, 36238, '<td valign="top">I like the shadow-play, but it''s a bit distracting having the front ''King'' piece out of focus.  Good photo nonetheless</td>', 'I like the shadow-play, but it''s a bit distracting having the front ''King'' piece out of focus.  Good photo nonetheless', '2005-06-16 01:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459678, 190293, 21367, '<td valign="top">Cool concept and good way of expressing what darkness is to you.  To the viewer without the title this might be confusing.  The shot as it is (crop) may have worked better with a longer DOF to where we could see all the bumps and pits  in the frame in focus.   <br/> <br/>I may have used a person eyes closed (blind or someone pretending) sitting at a table in a dimly lit area, running their finger across the braille page as if they were reading.  <br/> <br/>I think your idea blindness = darkness could have been a top placer if executed differently.  The shot as it is (shallow dof) makes it difficult to visualize that this is braille.   A good thought provoking attempt.</td>', 'Cool concept and good way of expressing what darkness is to you.  To the viewer without the title this might be confusing.  The shot as it is (crop) may have worked better with a longer DOF to where we could see all the bumps and pits  in the frame in focus.    I may have used a person eyes closed (blind or someone pretending) sitting at a table in a dimly lit area, running their finger across the braille page as if they were reading.   I think your idea blindness = darkness could have been a top placer if executed differently.  The shot as it is (shallow dof) makes it difficult to visualize that this is braille.   A good thought provoking attempt.', '2005-06-16 02:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459683, 190133, 21367, '<td valign="top">Very cool image, but I think the tint detracts from the over all shot.  I might have had the model powder her face to an eerie white and then lit it from underneath with a soft white light as you did with the green.  Very nice composition and set up but for me the green seems to take away from what would be a soft but serious photo.</td>', 'Very cool image, but I think the tint detracts from the over all shot.  I might have had the model powder her face to an eerie white and then lit it from underneath with a soft white light as you did with the green.  Very nice composition and set up but for me the green seems to take away from what would be a soft but serious photo.', '2005-06-16 02:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459685, 189297, 5015, '<td valign="top">Great idea!  Perhaps a "scary" bedtime story book would have been more appropriate.  I don''t know if Peter Rabbit is that scary.  Good interpretation of the challenge topic, however.  Good luck with the voting.</td>', 'Great idea!  Perhaps a "scary" bedtime story book would have been more appropriate.  I don''t know if Peter Rabbit is that scary.  Good interpretation of the challenge topic, however.  Good luck with the voting.', '2005-06-16 02:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459686, 189314, 5015, '<td valign="top">Great photo - could have finished quite high in the Construction challenge of last week.  Quality photo.  Good luck with the voting.</td>', 'Great photo - could have finished quite high in the Construction challenge of last week.  Quality photo.  Good luck with the voting.', '2005-06-16 02:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459687, 189413, 5015, '<td valign="top">Great photo - must be a good camera (and a good photographer!)  The light, color and quality is so good, that I find it hard to associate the photo with "darkness". Good luck with the voting.</td>', 'Great photo - must be a good camera (and a good photographer!)  The light, color and quality is so good, that I find it hard to associate the photo with "darkness". Good luck with the voting.', '2005-06-16 02:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459689, 189603, 36278, '<td valign="top">Awesome!  I really just love it.</td>', 'Awesome!  I really just love it.', '2005-06-16 02:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459691, 187581, 5015, '<td valign="top">A good photo, but the focus of this picture is right on the roses.  /the first thing that strikes you when you see the photo is the light and life of the roses.  There is darness in the background, but it is overshaddowed by the roses.  Good luck with the voting.</td>', 'A good photo, but the focus of this picture is right on the roses.  /the first thing that strikes you when you see the photo is the light and life of the roses.  There is darness in the background, but it is overshaddowed by the roses.  Good luck with the voting.', '2005-06-16 02:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459692, 190113, 21367, '<td valign="top">Lighting and Setting seem to be holding you back here.  On Camera flash or vehicle lights will always leave a harsh shadow.   The setting really takes away from the subject.  I might have taken the shot in a different location that would have centered focus on the mask...  You know what would be fun (mask as prop)is to have the person with the mask in a bed with hand reaching out giving the view the idea that he/she is going to get in bed with that...or worse monster masked person with a cigarette giving the viewer the impression he/she just...well you know.<br/> <br/>Anyways I think Lighting and Location could be a bit better, I like the angle as it makes the monster person look bigger than life.</td>', 'Lighting and Setting seem to be holding you back here.  On Camera flash or vehicle lights will always leave a harsh shadow.   The setting really takes away from the subject.  I might have taken the shot in a different location that would have centered focus on the mask...  You know what would be fun (mask as prop)is to have the person with the mask in a bed with hand reaching out giving the view the idea that he/she is going to get in bed with that...or worse monster masked person with a cigarette giving the viewer the impression he/she just...well you know. Anyways I think Lighting and Location could be a bit better, I like the angle as it makes the monster person look bigger than life.', '2005-06-16 02:29:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459700, 190302, 31133, '<td valign="top">This is a good image which also meets the challenge well. For me though, the frame is too large, especially since all that remains at the top are nostrils. Nice sepia toning and good sharpness on the guy.</td>', 'This is a good image which also meets the challenge well. For me though, the frame is too large, especially since all that remains at the top are nostrils. Nice sepia toning and good sharpness on the guy.', '2005-06-16 02:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1459705, 190083, 21367, '<td valign="top">Nice crop and composition, I might have used even softer light...possible shine the light through a white bed sheet or the likes.  As bright as it is my first thought is that it is plastic mask. A little softer diffused light would add to the mystic of the shot, I believe, making it more of a what is it than a what it is.</td>', 'Nice crop and composition, I might have used even softer light...possible shine the light through a white bed sheet or the likes.  As bright as it is my first thought is that it is plastic mask. A little softer diffused light would add to the mystic of the shot, I believe, making it more of a what is it than a what it is.', '2005-06-16 02:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
