(1460312, 188235, 38997, '<td valign="top">I like your title!!</td>', 'I like your title!!', '2005-06-16 11:17:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460342, 189732, 36981, '<td valign="top">Fab photo!  I love this image.  I''m not sure if it''s supposed to be scary, but the originality made me laugh.  The composition is beautiful and the shadows and light are wonderful as well.  Great job!</td>', 'Fab photo!  I love this image.  I''m not sure if it''s supposed to be scary, but the originality made me laugh.  The composition is beautiful and the shadows and light are wonderful as well.  Great job!', '2005-06-16 11:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460346, 188669, 36981, '<td valign="top">I wish I understood this.  I suspect it is simply my ignorance that I don''t recognize these objects at all.  Nonetheless, I love the image.  The contrast of textures is beautiful, and the lighting on the metallic objects are great as well.  I''ll check back when the challenge ends to see what they are.  Great job!</td>', 'I wish I understood this.  I suspect it is simply my ignorance that I don''t recognize these objects at all.  Nonetheless, I love the image.  The contrast of textures is beautiful, and the lighting on the metallic objects are great as well.  I''ll check back when the challenge ends to see what they are.  Great job!', '2005-06-16 11:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460350, 189560, 36981, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot.   THe photo is very well done - I hope your model didn''t get burned!  The light from the match is beautiful, and the title adds a great tension.  Well done!</td>', 'I like this a lot.   THe photo is very well done - I hope your model didn''t get burned!  The light from the match is beautiful, and the title adds a great tension.  Well done!', '2005-06-16 11:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460353, 190165, 36981, '<td valign="top">Great take on the challenge, beautiful play of light &amp; shadow.</td>', 'Great take on the challenge, beautiful play of light & shadow.', '2005-06-16 11:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460358, 190283, 36981, '<td valign="top">Freaky, and I mean that in a good way.  I love this interpretation and the fact that it took me a minute to figure it out.  Well done!</td>', 'Freaky, and I mean that in a good way.  I love this interpretation and the fact that it took me a minute to figure it out.  Well done!', '2005-06-16 11:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460363, 189297, 36981, '<td valign="top">I like the concept a lot; darkness is so significant when you''re a child!  The book is the perfect choice, and I love including the flashlight.  I wish that the picture looked a little less staged: the book looks positioned by an adult for the photo.  I assume that''s part of a bed that I''m looking at, but I would have preferred more clues as it took me a while to figure that out.  Perhaps including more of the bed frame would have helped?  Good try.</td>', 'I like the concept a lot; darkness is so significant when you''re a child!  The book is the perfect choice, and I love including the flashlight.  I wish that the picture looked a little less staged: the book looks positioned by an adult for the photo.  I assume that''s part of a bed that I''m looking at, but I would have preferred more clues as it took me a while to figure that out.  Perhaps including more of the bed frame would have helped?  Good try.', '2005-06-16 11:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460368, 188977, 36981, '<td valign="top">Very eerie!  I like the spookiness of the sky, the fact that other objects are silhouetted (sp?), and the composition.  Great job!</td>', 'Very eerie!  I like the spookiness of the sky, the fact that other objects are silhouetted (sp?), and the composition.  Great job!', '2005-06-16 11:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460374, 190175, 36981, '<td valign="top">Great moment to capture the bird!  I would have preferred the OOF background to be a little smoother - is this pixelation or over-sharpening?  The bird''s head doesn''t stand out quite enough, which I think it would have were the background softer.  Good try!</td>', 'Great moment to capture the bird!  I would have preferred the OOF background to be a little smoother - is this pixelation or over-sharpening?  The bird''s head doesn''t stand out quite enough, which I think it would have were the background softer.  Good try!', '2005-06-16 11:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460378, 190271, 36981, '<td valign="top">Beautiful to see dark clouds rolling in like that, and the tree in the foreground really makes the picture complete with it''s wind-blown branches.  Great job!</td>', 'Beautiful to see dark clouds rolling in like that, and the tree in the foreground really makes the picture complete with it''s wind-blown branches.  Great job!', '2005-06-16 11:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460380, 187573, 3102, '<td valign="top">You''ll definitely want to read up on how to compress and size images properly.  The quality here is horrific at best, I''m afraid.  The image is only 3k when the site allows images up to 150k.  Check out the tutorials on the site to learn how to maximize the quality.  This could have been a pretty good shot with a little TLC :)</td>', 'You''ll definitely want to read up on how to compress and size images properly.  The quality here is horrific at best, I''m afraid.  The image is only 3k when the site allows images up to 150k.  Check out the tutorials on the site to learn how to maximize the quality.  This could have been a pretty good shot with a little TLC :)', '2005-06-16 11:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460381, 190164, 39111, '<td valign="top">this is very interesting...was this person posing?  a stranger?  you?  i''m trying to decide if i would prefer this more closely cropped.</td>', 'this is very interesting...was this person posing?  a stranger?  you?  i''m trying to decide if i would prefer this more closely cropped.', '2005-06-16 11:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
