(1460393, 190001, 36981, '<td valign="top">Great capture of the moment!  I would have liked to have seen this in a larger size, but well done nonetheless.</td>', 'Great capture of the moment!  I would have liked to have seen this in a larger size, but well done nonetheless.', '2005-06-16 11:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460394, 187378, 39111, '<td valign="top">hmmm, this reminds me of a poster i saw years ago...i would have liked the cup and creamer to be whiter, more contrast.</td>', 'hmmm, this reminds me of a poster i saw years ago...i would have liked the cup and creamer to be whiter, more contrast.', '2005-06-16 11:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460395, 188286, 39111, '<td valign="top">In the other corners the lit areas are very grainy and odd looking.</td>', 'In the other corners the lit areas are very grainy and odd looking.', '2005-06-16 11:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460397, 189603, 26526, '<td valign="top">I really like the perspective used in this photograph. Terrific sky. Great focus and fitting tone. Full of highly visual symbolism, death, resurrection, heaven. Fits this challenge. Very creative and well done!</td>', 'I really like the perspective used in this photograph. Terrific sky. Great focus and fitting tone. Full of highly visual symbolism, death, resurrection, heaven. Fits this challenge. Very creative and well done!', '2005-06-16 11:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460398, 190309, 36981, '<td valign="top">Nice colors &amp; capture, and a good idea as well.  It bothers me slightly that the circle isn''t completely round.  I wonder if it would have seemed more balanced (assuming that it can''t be made more regular) to have had the breaking point of it either at the top or bottom.  Well done nonetheless.</td>', 'Nice colors & capture, and a good idea as well.  It bothers me slightly that the circle isn''t completely round.  I wonder if it would have seemed more balanced (assuming that it can''t be made more regular) to have had the breaking point of it either at the top or bottom.  Well done nonetheless.', '2005-06-16 11:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460399, 189691, 39111, '<td valign="top">i bet this was fun to shoot.</td>', 'i bet this was fun to shoot.', '2005-06-16 11:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460400, 189708, 33672, '<td valign="top">This could''ve worked in the fantasy challenge too.  Very very nice. Nice use of lighting and shadows. One of my top picks</td>', 'This could''ve worked in the fantasy challenge too.  Very very nice. Nice use of lighting and shadows. One of my top picks', '2005-06-16 11:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460402, 188112, 39111, '<td valign="top">bizarre. i like it but would have preferred a much closer crop on the left.  it would have even more punch for me if you''d cropped off to the point of taking off a bit of the boys head at the top of the frame.  love the colors though.</td>', 'bizarre. i like it but would have preferred a much closer crop on the left.  it would have even more punch for me if you''d cropped off to the point of taking off a bit of the boys head at the top of the frame.  love the colors though.', '2005-06-16 11:55:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460403, 189773, 36981, '<td valign="top">Great eerieness to this.  The lighting &amp; use of negative space are terrific too.  It bothers me slightly that the head is a little tilted, since the rest of the composition is so centered, but I like it nonetheless.</td>', 'Great eerieness to this.  The lighting & use of negative space are terrific too.  It bothers me slightly that the head is a little tilted, since the rest of the composition is so centered, but I like it nonetheless.', '2005-06-16 11:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460404, 186999, 39111, '<td valign="top">sorry, don''t get it.</td>', 'sorry, don''t get it.', '2005-06-16 11:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460407, 187510, 36981, '<td valign="top">Wow!  This is a terrific shot, and perfect for the challenge.  It evokes so many emotions (thanks for the clarity of the title - it really sets the whole image up!)  Well done.</td>', 'Wow!  This is a terrific shot, and perfect for the challenge.  It evokes so many emotions (thanks for the clarity of the title - it really sets the whole image up!)  Well done.', '2005-06-16 11:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460408, 190294, 39111, '<td valign="top">wooo...so crisp.    the bright lights of the buildings make it look like it''s late at night, but the sky says otherwise.</td>', 'wooo...so crisp.    the bright lights of the buildings make it look like it''s late at night, but the sky says otherwise.', '2005-06-16 11:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460409, 190232, 33672, '<td valign="top">Besides the fact that I hate spiders the DOF is different than I would''ve done. Where it is in focus is very crisp but I''d have tried to keep the whole creature in focus.</td>', 'Besides the fact that I hate spiders the DOF is different than I would''ve done. Where it is in focus is very crisp but I''d have tried to keep the whole creature in focus.', '2005-06-16 11:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460412, 190304, 33672, '<td valign="top">Beuatiful title and photo.</td>', 'Beuatiful title and photo.', '2005-06-16 11:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460413, 188537, 39111, '<td valign="top">i like the lower half of this image but the washed out green portion in the top upper left hand side is too distracting from some of the neat detais (keyboard, belt).</td>', 'i like the lower half of this image but the washed out green portion in the top upper left hand side is too distracting from some of the neat detais (keyboard, belt).', '2005-06-16 11:58:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460414, 188286, 36981, '<td valign="top">I really like the concept, the car, and the image.  The light on the upper left bothers me a bit, as does the object in the lower left.  I wonder if a tilted crop could have removed those objects, but kept the car &amp; neighbor''s window intact.</td>', 'I really like the concept, the car, and the image.  The light on the upper left bothers me a bit, as does the object in the lower left.  I wonder if a tilted crop could have removed those objects, but kept the car & neighbor''s window intact.', '2005-06-16 11:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460415, 188684, 36981, '<td valign="top">Looks like it to me!  Great job.</td>', 'Looks like it to me!  Great job.', '2005-06-16 11:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1460416, 189775, 39111, '<td valign="top">neat, i like this a lot.  i wish i could see just a tiiiiny  bit more of the man on the left.</td>', 'neat, i like this a lot.  i wish i could see just a tiiiiny  bit more of the man on the left.', '2005-06-16 11:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
