(1460558, 189420, 36981, '<td valign="top">I think this is well done, but it''s not very interesting for me.  Somehow it doesn''t feel abstract enough for me to find it simply visually interesting, but nor is it a concrete subject that holds interest.  Perhaps a stranger angle, or more of the lights ... I like the color and the softness of the lights, however.</td>', 'I think this is well done, but it''s not very interesting for me.  Somehow it doesn''t feel abstract enough for me to find it simply visually interesting, but nor is it a concrete subject that holds interest.  Perhaps a stranger angle, or more of the lights ... I like the color and the softness of the lights, however.', '2005-06-16 13:14:10.000000', NULL, 1),
