(1460574, 189691, 36981, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, with a nice red tone to the face.  I like the negative space and the flames are very pretty.   There''s something that doesn''t work for me completely, and I think it might be the makeup/mask.  I think that the point would have been made without the costume at all, and might have been more powerful that way.  Nonetheless, great job. 8</td>', 'Nicely done, with a nice red tone to the face.  I like the negative space and the flames are very pretty.   There''s something that doesn''t work for me completely, and I think it might be the makeup/mask.  I think that the point would have been made without the costume at all, and might have been more powerful that way.  Nonetheless, great job. 8', '2005-06-16 13:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
