(1461524, 187305, 38492, '<td valign="top">Great capture, lovely colours. I''m trying to reconcile the title with the picture, but I like the concept, and it works well against the dark background. 7</td>', 'Great capture, lovely colours. I''m trying to reconcile the title with the picture, but I like the concept, and it works well against the dark background. 7', '2005-06-16 19:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1461525, 188140, 38492, '<td valign="top">Nicely executed, and very atmospheric - 6</td>', 'Nicely executed, and very atmospheric - 6', '2005-06-16 19:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1461528, 188343, 38492, '<td valign="top">Not sure her facial emotion is all that sincere. Good capture and tones. 5</td>', 'Not sure her facial emotion is all that sincere. Good capture and tones. 5', '2005-06-16 19:43:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1461541, 187573, 4226, '<td valign="top">You can use 640 pixels, I wonder why you have this so small ??</td>', 'You can use 640 pixels, I wonder why you have this so small ??', '2005-06-16 19:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1461544, 189738, 38492, '<td valign="top">Nice. I''m guessing this is staged, as the current phase of the moon is gibbous... But it certainly meets the challenge! 5</td>', 'Nice. I''m guessing this is staged, as the current phase of the moon is gibbous... But it certainly meets the challenge! 5', '2005-06-16 19:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1461545, 190294, 4226, '<td valign="top">Night life as darkness ? hmmmm I am trying to figure out how and why ? if its the night, its ok.. if its the life, oh man you got to do something about it :D<br/>Nice colors ... 6</td>', 'Night life as darkness ? hmmmm I am trying to figure out how and why ? if its the night, its ok.. if its the life, oh man you got to do something about it :DNice colors ... 6', '2005-06-16 19:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1461556, 190302, 22379, '<td valign="top">empending darkness. This is definatly one of the more clever uses of light to represent darkness in this challenge. Was there a light source other than the candle? where the light is falling doesn''t seem to be quiteright, but i might just be nuts. Excellent crop and you really captured the bend of the flame from the blast of breathe well.</td>', 'empending darkness. This is definatly one of the more clever uses of light to represent darkness in this challenge. Was there a light source other than the candle? where the light is falling doesn''t seem to be quiteright, but i might just be nuts. Excellent crop and you really captured the bend of the flame from the blast of breathe well.', '2005-06-16 19:50:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1461564, 189515, 38492, '<td valign="top">So who''s reflected in the eye? Certainly an interesting capture. Still not sure about it, though. 4</td>', 'So who''s reflected in the eye? Certainly an interesting capture. Still not sure about it, though. 4', '2005-06-16 19:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1461568, 189603, 22379, '<td valign="top">i was out hoeing my yard and i thought of this photo - my little mind said i wonder if that was a real scythe in that darkness photo, because i could really ue that to cut some weeds right about now. Now i am done babbling, i am bumping up your photo.</td>', 'i was out hoeing my yard and i thought of this photo - my little mind said i wonder if that was a real scythe in that darkness photo, because i could really ue that to cut some weeds right about now. Now i am done babbling, i am bumping up your photo.', '2005-06-16 19:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1461577, 190273, 22379, '<td valign="top">This image is exceptionaly beautiful for such a simple and every day subject. <br/>I''ve never looked at vertical blinds with such admiration before. Kudos for taking something mudane and making it beautiful.</td>', 'This image is exceptionaly beautiful for such a simple and every day subject. I''ve never looked at vertical blinds with such admiration before. Kudos for taking something mudane and making it beautiful.', '2005-06-16 19:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1461579, 190231, 36981, '<td valign="top">Not only great lightning, but great composition with the lantern as well.  How clever of you to position the lightning exactly there!</td>', 'Not only great lightning, but great composition with the lantern as well.  How clever of you to position the lightning exactly there!', '2005-06-16 19:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1461580, 188021, 22379, '<td valign="top">This photo cracked me up.<br/>Oh eh, pun, sorry.<br/>I can just envision a little chick pulling the cord for the ceiling lamp and hoping under the blue and white checkered blankets. I gave this photo an extra point for origiality and creative thinking.</td>', 'This photo cracked me up.Oh eh, pun, sorry.I can just envision a little chick pulling the cord for the ceiling lamp and hoping under the blue and white checkered blankets. I gave this photo an extra point for origiality and creative thinking.', '2005-06-16 19:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1461582, 189433, 38492, '<td valign="top">Not really sure what this is trying to say on the subject of darkness. Poor composition, the eye is constantly drawn to the model''s face, distracting from the rope in the centre, which is surely the portrayal of ''darkenss''? Good quality photo otherwise, though. 4</td>', 'Not really sure what this is trying to say on the subject of darkness. Poor composition, the eye is constantly drawn to the model''s face, distracting from the rope in the centre, which is surely the portrayal of ''darkenss''? Good quality photo otherwise, though. 4', '2005-06-16 19:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1461583, 188839, 36981, '<td valign="top">Excellent take on the challenge.  The grimness of the setting, the model''s pose and the lighting all convey darkness to me.</td>', 'Excellent take on the challenge.  The grimness of the setting, the model''s pose and the lighting all convey darkness to me.', '2005-06-16 19:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1461585, 188749, 22379, '<td valign="top">A very emotional depiction. I hope for the sake of all involved it was staged only.</td>', 'A very emotional depiction. I hope for the sake of all involved it was staged only.', '2005-06-16 19:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1461586, 188957, 36981, '<td valign="top">I think the composition would have worked better for me if the candle had been in the lower part of the picture rather than the top.</td>', 'I think the composition would have worked better for me if the candle had been in the lower part of the picture rather than the top.', '2005-06-16 19:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1461588, 189347, 22379, '<td valign="top">I am sure glad i didnt wake up in the middle of the night with that face(ial expression) looming over me. Creepy creepy!</td>', 'I am sure glad i didnt wake up in the middle of the night with that face(ial expression) looming over me. Creepy creepy!', '2005-06-16 19:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1461589, 188438, 38492, '<td valign="top">I''m trying hard to like this photo, but I''m finding the curtain too distracting. This would have been much better if it had been tied back, or hanging still. It does meet the challenge, though. 4</td>', 'I''m trying hard to like this photo, but I''m finding the curtain too distracting. This would have been much better if it had been tied back, or hanging still. It does meet the challenge, though. 4', '2005-06-16 19:59:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1461591, 189540, 36981, '<td valign="top">Ah, another candle shot, but with a difference.  I like this one.  Great plumes and great composition.</td>', 'Ah, another candle shot, but with a difference.  I like this one.  Great plumes and great composition.', '2005-06-16 20:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1461592, 187294, 38119, '<td valign="top">I love this photo.<br/> <br/>The color, the lighting, the expression. I just want to turn around to see what it is she is staring at.<br/> <br/>10<br/> <br/>Only thing constructive I think I could say is that in the left half there are a few spots catching light from something. But this being the basic I''m not sure there was much you could have done to remove those. :)</td>', 'I love this photo. The color, the lighting, the expression. I just want to turn around to see what it is she is staring at. 10 Only thing constructive I think I could say is that in the left half there are a few spots catching light from something. But this being the basic I''m not sure there was much you could have done to remove those. :)', '2005-06-16 20:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1461595, 189940, 38492, '<td valign="top">Lovely capture - nicely focussing on the dead flower head. Certainly meets the challenge! 7</td>', 'Lovely capture - nicely focussing on the dead flower head. Certainly meets the challenge! 7', '2005-06-16 20:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1461596, 189733, 36981, '<td valign="top">A point up for humour, then down for misspelling.</td>', 'A point up for humour, then down for misspelling.', '2005-06-16 20:02:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1461598, 189462, 22379, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo, but i find one thing about it a little disconcerting. It really looks (maybe is) like a photo taken in the dark with a flash. All the light was sucked up by the first horse. I would have liked to have seen mor than a hint of the third. More of the faceof the brown. I love the concept however.</td>', 'I really like this photo, but i find one thing about it a little disconcerting. It really looks (maybe is) like a photo taken in the dark with a flash. All the light was sucked up by the first horse. I would have liked to have seen mor than a hint of the third. More of the faceof the brown. I love the concept however.', '2005-06-16 20:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1461601, 188556, 22379, '<td valign="top">Darkness is a time to prey. Beatuiful. Personally i would have taken the photo so that 2/3rds were in darkness and his face in the third, but that''s just me. Very nice.</td>', 'Darkness is a time to prey. Beatuiful. Personally i would have taken the photo so that 2/3rds were in darkness and his face in the third, but that''s just me. Very nice.', '2005-06-16 20:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1461605, 190118, 36981, '<td valign="top">I love her expression and the lighting.  The pattern on the bedding distracts for me, but not enough to dock points.</td>', 'I love her expression and the lighting.  The pattern on the bedding distracts for me, but not enough to dock points.', '2005-06-16 20:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1461606, 187475, 22379, '<td valign="top">Not entirely sure why, but this gives me the creeping willies - so if that was your intention 10 stars! Maybe i am just scare of the basement - i wouldnt know i''ve never had one.</td>', 'Not entirely sure why, but this gives me the creeping willies - so if that was your intention 10 stars! Maybe i am just scare of the basement - i wouldnt know i''ve never had one.', '2005-06-16 20:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1461607, 189775, 36981, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful.  I love this picture and the various lights.</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful.  I love this picture and the various lights.', '2005-06-16 20:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1461612, 188257, 38492, '<td valign="top">Very atmospheric picture, leading the eye into darkness! 7</td>', 'Very atmospheric picture, leading the eye into darkness! 7', '2005-06-16 20:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1461613, 190118, 22379, '<td valign="top">Is that her hair that is swisping red above her head? I love whatever-it-is it really makes the photo. And the monsters cant touch you where the blanket covers. Bumping up.</td>', 'Is that her hair that is swisping red above her head? I love whatever-it-is it really makes the photo. And the monsters cant touch you where the blanket covers. Bumping up.', '2005-06-16 20:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1461623, 190118, 20530, '<td valign="top">Good photo, I like her expression. Seems to have a yellowish cast. Also the red  thing above her head is a little distracting. Is that what she''s afraid of, or is it just something in the background?</td>', 'Good photo, I like her expression. Seems to have a yellowish cast. Also the red  thing above her head is a little distracting. Is that what she''s afraid of, or is it just something in the background?', '2005-06-16 20:09:42.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1461625, 186993, 36981, '<td valign="top">I love the church and the composition, but what is going on with the grass in front?  Did a hue/saturation adjustment go wrong?  Still a decent score because of the beauty of the chapel, but it lost a couple of points for me because of the greens.</td>', 'I love the church and the composition, but what is going on with the grass in front?  Did a hue/saturation adjustment go wrong?  Still a decent score because of the beauty of the chapel, but it lost a couple of points for me because of the greens.', '2005-06-16 20:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1461627, 188104, 38492, '<td valign="top">Good capture of the cross - some odd blurring happening on the left when it''s not on the the right... The imagery is of death, meeting the challenge adequately. I think I would have preffered to see the arm of the cross bisected by the horizon, though, it would have given more impact to the picture. 4</td>', 'Good capture of the cross - some odd blurring happening on the left when it''s not on the the right... The imagery is of death, meeting the challenge adequately. I think I would have preffered to see the arm of the cross bisected by the horizon, though, it would have given more impact to the picture. 4', '2005-06-16 20:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1461629, 190010, 36981, '<td valign="top">Nice &amp; eerie.  The fact that the altar(?) is apparent in the background is a little distracting; I would have preferred just the candles &amp; the model.  Nonetheless, good effort.</td>', 'Nice & eerie.  The fact that the altar(?) is apparent in the background is a little distracting; I would have preferred just the candles & the model.  Nonetheless, good effort.', '2005-06-16 20:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1461632, 189153, 36981, '<td valign="top">Agreed.  Good effort.</td>', 'Agreed.  Good effort.', '2005-06-16 20:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1461633, 188549, 38492, '<td valign="top">capture quality is poor, and I''m not sure how the dark look in her eyes works with the tile to potray ''darkness''. 3</td>', 'capture quality is poor, and I''m not sure how the dark look in her eyes works with the tile to potray ''darkness''. 3', '2005-06-16 20:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1461638, 188243, 35947, '<td valign="top">The cloud (?) infront is distacting.  Like how you composed it.</td>', 'The cloud (?) infront is distacting.  Like how you composed it.', '2005-06-16 20:14:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1461640, 188316, 35947, '<td valign="top">Caves are very dark!  What are all the white spots?</td>', 'Caves are very dark!  What are all the white spots?', '2005-06-16 20:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1461642, 188078, 11923, '<td valign="top">I think I just lost the huge comment I left about your image by making it a favorite!  Boo!  Alright here we go again.  I''m not seeing a connection to darkness other than the title, so I''m not sure what aspect you''re trying to portray.  Perhaps she''s a dream girl?  So someone you see dancing while you''re asleep?  That''s the best I can come up with, but its likely not the interpretation you were looking for.  That said, I really enjoy this image.  It has a wonderful sultry look to it, which the use of the red and the model''s expression helps boost.  My one suggestion would be to crop a bit off the left side.  While I think the red there does make for some interesting negative space, it just seems a bit too much, a bit too unbalanced.  Perhaps cropping right where that dark triangle at the bottom left begins to form.. that way you still have an expanse of red but it isn''t quite as much or as overpowering.  So all in all I''m giving a 7, but I would''ve given a point higher if I was able to understand your darkness connection from what I was seeing.  Still, very well done, thank you!</td>', 'I think I just lost the huge comment I left about your image by making it a favorite!  Boo!  Alright here we go again.  I''m not seeing a connection to darkness other than the title, so I''m not sure what aspect you''re trying to portray.  Perhaps she''s a dream girl?  So someone you see dancing while you''re asleep?  That''s the best I can come up with, but its likely not the interpretation you were looking for.  That said, I really enjoy this image.  It has a wonderful sultry look to it, which the use of the red and the model''s expression helps boost.  My one suggestion would be to crop a bit off the left side.  While I think the red there does make for some interesting negative space, it just seems a bit too much, a bit too unbalanced.  Perhaps cropping right where that dark triangle at the bottom left begins to form.. that way you still have an expanse of red but it isn''t quite as much or as overpowering.  So all in all I''m giving a 7, but I would''ve given a point higher if I was able to understand your darkness connection from what I was seeing.  Still, very well done, thank you!', '2005-06-16 20:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1461644, 190125, 35947, '<td valign="top">Very interesting find.  Like the focus of the words (how it fades)</td>', 'Very interesting find.  Like the focus of the words (how it fades)', '2005-06-16 20:16:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1461648, 190279, 35947, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what this is?</td>', 'I''m not sure what this is?', '2005-06-16 20:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1461649, 190248, 35947, '<td valign="top">artistic.  made me do a double take.</td>', 'artistic.  made me do a double take.', '2005-06-16 20:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1461651, 190256, 32602, '<td valign="top">This brought to mind Blake''s poem that speaks of dark Satanic mills. I like the shroud of haze around the lights and obscuring the the top of the chimneys. The image is effective and fits the challenge well.</td>', 'This brought to mind Blake''s poem that speaks of dark Satanic mills. I like the shroud of haze around the lights and obscuring the the top of the chimneys. The image is effective and fits the challenge well.', '2005-06-16 20:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1461652, 187581, 20530, '<td valign="top">The thing about an image like this is that it needs to be practically flawless to outshine the others that have come before.  A few improvements that would help it work better for me are: A vertical crop, and/or eliminate the "chopped stem  on the right and include the "chopped" tip of flower at top. Images that go out of the picture like that serve to draw the eye out of the image.  Flipping it would help (Westerners read images from left to right) and there''s some negative pschological effect about images that appear to "face" the left.  Lastly, the brown spots bother me a little. I do like the black background and the lighting is nice. Sorry so long, had a lot to say.</td>', 'The thing about an image like this is that it needs to be practically flawless to outshine the others that have come before.  A few improvements that would help it work better for me are: A vertical crop, and/or eliminate the "chopped stem  on the right and include the "chopped" tip of flower at top. Images that go out of the picture like that serve to draw the eye out of the image.  Flipping it would help (Westerners read images from left to right) and there''s some negative pschological effect about images that appear to "face" the left.  Lastly, the brown spots bother me a little. I do like the black background and the lighting is nice. Sorry so long, had a lot to say.', '2005-06-16 20:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1461653, 190282, 35947, '<td valign="top">I can hear the Canon''s!  Yes!  YES!  Darkness is owning a Nikon!  JK!  But if you feel you can no longer go on with it let me know and I''ll make a good home for it!</td>', 'I can hear the Canon''s!  Yes!  YES!  Darkness is owning a Nikon!  JK!  But if you feel you can no longer go on with it let me know and I''ll make a good home for it!', '2005-06-16 20:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1461658, 189592, 38492, '<td valign="top">There''s more detail than I want to see in this photo, and yet not enough! The wierd double / triple exposure is also distracting. 3</td>', 'There''s more detail than I want to see in this photo, and yet not enough! The wierd double / triple exposure is also distracting. 3', '2005-06-16 20:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1461659, 190068, 35947, '<td valign="top">The light is very bright!  It might "speak" more (IMO) if they were facing away from the light.  Does that make sense?</td>', 'The light is very bright!  It might "speak" more (IMO) if they were facing away from the light.  Does that make sense?', '2005-06-16 20:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1461660, 190117, 11923, '<td valign="top">Well.. I''m not exactly sure what it is I''m seeing here.  Is it a part of wall that is being highlighted by a flashlight?  Or a figure of some sort?  I can see the darkness connection, without it there is no light and light helps accentuate darkness but if this is what you''re trying to portray (which I could be mistaken in assuming!) the manner it was done was a bit uninspiring and flat.  Going with my assumption, I might suggest a different composition, particularly with the title you''ve used.  Maybe a globe that is bathed mostly in darkness with a small bit of light being shone upon it, thus giving an impression of a heavenly light?  Again, I could be way off base with what you''re trying to convey so my comments may be quite unhelpful.  With the my limited ability to understand what you were going for I can only go by what I see and I''m not sure what it is, so I gave a 2.</td>', 'Well.. I''m not exactly sure what it is I''m seeing here.  Is it a part of wall that is being highlighted by a flashlight?  Or a figure of some sort?  I can see the darkness connection, without it there is no light and light helps accentuate darkness but if this is what you''re trying to portray (which I could be mistaken in assuming!) the manner it was done was a bit uninspiring and flat.  Going with my assumption, I might suggest a different composition, particularly with the title you''ve used.  Maybe a globe that is bathed mostly in darkness with a small bit of light being shone upon it, thus giving an impression of a heavenly light?  Again, I could be way off base with what you''re trying to convey so my comments may be quite unhelpful.  With the my limited ability to understand what you were going for I can only go by what I see and I''m not sure what it is, so I gave a 2.', '2005-06-16 20:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1461661, 187967, 20530, '<td valign="top">That''s precious. Really like the compostion and how the arch of the flowers mimic the curve of theframe.</td>', 'That''s precious. Really like the compostion and how the arch of the flowers mimic the curve of theframe.', '2005-06-16 20:21:23.000000', NULL, 1),
