(1461890, 190111, 37544, '<td valign="top">There seems to be alot going on in the photo.  My eyes are having trouble trying to figure out what to focus on. I think that it was a good idea for the challenge but maybe the wrong time of day.  Too much traffic and the shot is a little blurry, but that could be from when you uploaded it.</td>', 'There seems to be alot going on in the photo.  My eyes are having trouble trying to figure out what to focus on. I think that it was a good idea for the challenge but maybe the wrong time of day.  Too much traffic and the shot is a little blurry, but that could be from when you uploaded it.', '2005-06-16 21:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
