(1461894, 188839, 22379, '<td valign="top">I bet youre getting a fair bit of flack for the glarefrom the window? I think it adds to the emotion of the image - lightness outside, darkness within. Just as we often put on a brave face for the world outside, when we are torn appart within.</td>', 'I bet youre getting a fair bit of flack for the glarefrom the window? I think it adds to the emotion of the image - lightness outside, darkness within. Just as we often put on a brave face for the world outside, when we are torn appart within.', '2005-06-16 21:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1461897, 190059, 37544, '<td valign="top">I am having a hard time relating this picture to the theme.  So I will just judge it on quality.  I like the softness of the photo, the lighting is good, no hot spots.  I wish that the whites of the eye were more visible. 5</td>', 'I am having a hard time relating this picture to the theme.  So I will just judge it on quality.  I like the softness of the photo, the lighting is good, no hot spots.  I wish that the whites of the eye were more visible. 5', '2005-06-16 21:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1461905, 187154, 38492, '<td valign="top">For this abstract to work would require removing the odd coloured thing on the left, and ensuring the whole of the left hand side was darkened. Also, the double exposure of the face makes this a little odd. Having a halo of the match as it moves around in front of the subject would also tighten this up better. The objects silhouetted by the blue ball are slightly too blurred, as well. 5</td>', 'For this abstract to work would require removing the odd coloured thing on the left, and ensuring the whole of the left hand side was darkened. Also, the double exposure of the face makes this a little odd. Having a halo of the match as it moves around in front of the subject would also tighten this up better. The objects silhouetted by the blue ball are slightly too blurred, as well. 5', '2005-06-16 21:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1461906, 189776, 37544, '<td valign="top">This was a great idea.  Everybody knows that plants will s-t-r-e-t-c-h towards light. I get it and I like it.  This is different from the other entries I have seen and that is a plus.  I love it when photos are not what I expected to see. 6</td>', 'This was a great idea.  Everybody knows that plants will s-t-r-e-t-c-h towards light. I get it and I like it.  This is different from the other entries I have seen and that is a plus.  I love it when photos are not what I expected to see. 6', '2005-06-16 21:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1461908, 189115, 38492, '<td valign="top">Can''t see how this meets the challenge as the shadows aren''t very deep. Odd bit of lens flair on there was well. 2</td>', 'Can''t see how this meets the challenge as the shadows aren''t very deep. Odd bit of lens flair on there was well. 2', '2005-06-16 21:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
