(1461993, 189708, 38492, '<td valign="top">Lovely capture! The stones are perfectly focussed, and the long exposure works really well to soften the water. It does need the title to meet the challenge, but that''s no bad thing - it''s all about interpretation, after al! 9<br/> <br/>[If it has no light, how did you capture it? Thanks for teaching me a new word, though!]</td>', 'Lovely capture! The stones are perfectly focussed, and the long exposure works really well to soften the water. It does need the title to meet the challenge, but that''s no bad thing - it''s all about interpretation, after al! 9 [If it has no light, how did you capture it? Thanks for teaching me a new word, though!]', '2005-06-16 21:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
