(1462027, 189372, 30214, '<td valign="top">it''s a nice photo, but it does not leave a particularly dark feeling, and the strom can only be found in the title. You''d need some sky to transmit the feeling of storm, otherwise it just feels like a dusk.</td>', 'it''s a nice photo, but it does not leave a particularly dark feeling, and the strom can only be found in the title. You''d need some sky to transmit the feeling of storm, otherwise it just feels like a dusk.', '2005-06-16 22:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1462028, 189171, 30214, '<td valign="top">nice photo, but I think haing a black bacground does not constitute an image of darkness yet</td>', 'nice photo, but I think haing a black bacground does not constitute an image of darkness yet', '2005-06-16 22:10:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1462030, 189780, 35827, '<td valign="top">awesome idea</td>', 'awesome idea', '2005-06-16 22:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1462031, 190285, 35827, '<td valign="top">great photo that really shows dark emotion</td>', 'great photo that really shows dark emotion', '2005-06-16 22:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1462032, 187263, 30214, '<td valign="top">nice photo, however I''d try to shoot this from above, to imply vertigo and certain suicidal mood. In fact, it has some of it anyway, but the title contradicts it...</td>', 'nice photo, however I''d try to shoot this from above, to imply vertigo and certain suicidal mood. In fact, it has some of it anyway, but the title contradicts it...', '2005-06-16 22:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1462034, 189587, 30061, '<td valign="top">Wow, I really like this photo.  It''s simple, but conveys the message very well.  I also like the one-word title - very effective.  Great shot!</td>', 'Wow, I really like this photo.  It''s simple, but conveys the message very well.  I also like the one-word title - very effective.  Great shot!', '2005-06-16 22:13:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1462043, 188235, 30214, '<td valign="top">I admire your bravely (I  am sure you get a lot of flame for your title) however I don''t really agree with your title. However, theosophy aside, the image itself does not really communicate darkness or threat, IMO. The subject is too small, and the sky is rather bland. I can imagine that a cross can be shot in a scary manner, but it would have to be done quite differently.</td>', 'I admire your bravely (I  am sure you get a lot of flame for your title) however I don''t really agree with your title. However, theosophy aside, the image itself does not really communicate darkness or threat, IMO. The subject is too small, and the sky is rather bland. I can imagine that a cross can be shot in a scary manner, but it would have to be done quite differently.', '2005-06-16 22:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1462047, 190061, 30214, '<td valign="top">nice sky, and presumably without dodging :)<br/>I like the light on the posts, too.</td>', 'nice sky, and presumably without dodging :)I like the light on the posts, too.', '2005-06-16 22:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
