(1462203, 188284, 17837, '<td valign="top">Not sure I see darkness in a FDNY hero...<br/> <br/>Your highlights are blown out. There are ways to make things dark and still have the highlights =)</td>', 'Not sure I see darkness in a FDNY hero... Your highlights are blown out. There are ways to make things dark and still have the highlights =)', '2005-06-16 23:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1462208, 188770, 17837, '<td valign="top">I believe this was a flash shot, and how I see the "darkness" Im just not really feeling this photo. the rule of thirds wouldnt be able to help this photo, and having it smack in the center doesnt do anything either. I think teh subject standing alone doesnt have much an impact.</td>', 'I believe this was a flash shot, and how I see the "darkness" Im just not really feeling this photo. the rule of thirds wouldnt be able to help this photo, and having it smack in the center doesnt do anything either. I think teh subject standing alone doesnt have much an impact.', '2005-06-16 23:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1462210, 189352, 36563, '<td valign="top">It looks to be a little undercooked! Hahaha... ha..... good picture, very imaginative</td>', 'It looks to be a little undercooked! Hahaha... ha..... good picture, very imaginative', '2005-06-16 23:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1462211, 190248, 29009, '<td valign="top">I had to look at this shot for several moments before I figured out the blobs of light was actually a face, even with the title to help.  I think this shot would have been stronger if the entire face was lit, the exposure was longer, and the motion blur was limited to rotation rather movement across the frame.</td>', 'I had to look at this shot for several moments before I figured out the blobs of light was actually a face, even with the title to help.  I think this shot would have been stronger if the entire face was lit, the exposure was longer, and the motion blur was limited to rotation rather movement across the frame.', '2005-06-16 23:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1462215, 187889, 17837, '<td valign="top">another center positioned photo. Would this have been used with the rule of thirds, I think it would have been better. The cables on the wall are distracting, and I think if you zoomed in on the skull itself, it would have a much stronger impact. You have good exposure here, looks as if a wide angle was used here with a large aperture, the focus seems to drop off.</td>', 'another center positioned photo. Would this have been used with the rule of thirds, I think it would have been better. The cables on the wall are distracting, and I think if you zoomed in on the skull itself, it would have a much stronger impact. You have good exposure here, looks as if a wide angle was used here with a large aperture, the focus seems to drop off.', '2005-06-16 23:11:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1462216, 189296, 36981, '<td valign="top">love the concept, love the execution. well done.</td>', 'love the concept, love the execution. well done.', '2005-06-16 23:11:24.000000', NULL, 1),
