(1462230, 188720, 24073, '<td valign="top">4 photos in this challenge met me on a subconsious level, almost like a childhood fear I think.  Anyway this was one of them TY for entering, and GL.</td>', '4 photos in this challenge met me on a subconsious level, almost like a childhood fear I think.  Anyway this was one of them TY for entering, and GL.', '2005-06-16 23:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1462231, 187064, 36563, '<td valign="top">This would be a really wonderful picture, but it looks so fuzzy. I think your camera might have focused on something put in the shadows- I would have focused more on the candles and accented the subject of your title.</td>', 'This would be a really wonderful picture, but it looks so fuzzy. I think your camera might have focused on something put in the shadows- I would have focused more on the candles and accented the subject of your title.', '2005-06-16 23:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1462232, 188749, 17837, '<td valign="top">I woulda liked to seen the label of the JD =)</td>', 'I woulda liked to seen the label of the JD =)', '2005-06-16 23:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1462233, 190214, 36981, '<td valign="top">I really appreciate the concept here, and love the composition.  I think the amount of space that you gave to the ocean and the sky are perfect.  However, I think the lighting or the post-processing on the ocean were a little off - perhaps I''m wrong &amp; the lights on the beach were just too strong to give a more subtle glow rather than a harsher light.  I do wish it were a softer contrast, because this could have been very beautiful.</td>', 'I really appreciate the concept here, and love the composition.  I think the amount of space that you gave to the ocean and the sky are perfect.  However, I think the lighting or the post-processing on the ocean were a little off - perhaps I''m wrong & the lights on the beach were just too strong to give a more subtle glow rather than a harsher light.  I do wish it were a softer contrast, because this could have been very beautiful.', '2005-06-16 23:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1462234, 190270, 17837, '<td valign="top">a great abstract. 8</td>', 'a great abstract. 8', '2005-06-16 23:16:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1462235, 188144, 24073, '<td valign="top">There was 4 photos in this challenge that caught my attention, I think more on a subconsious level more than anything, maybe like a childhood fear thing or something.  At any rate, I like it, and voted it very high despite what my wife was saying about me being crazy.  GL, and TY for entering it.</td>', 'There was 4 photos in this challenge that caught my attention, I think more on a subconsious level more than anything, maybe like a childhood fear thing or something.  At any rate, I like it, and voted it very high despite what my wife was saying about me being crazy.  GL, and TY for entering it.', '2005-06-16 23:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
