(1462288, 187142, 36981, '<td valign="top">I love the lighting &amp; the scene, very spooky.  Somehow, the model isn''t working for me; I guess that given the lighting &amp; the scene he/she isn''t scary enough to pull it off - is it a child perhaps?</td>', 'I love the lighting & the scene, very spooky.  Somehow, the model isn''t working for me; I guess that given the lighting & the scene he/she isn''t scary enough to pull it off - is it a child perhaps?', '2005-06-16 23:27:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1462289, 188235, 17837, '<td valign="top">I dont think you can pass religion off as being dark or destructive because its really a matter of opinion, not a matter of fact.</td>', 'I dont think you can pass religion off as being dark or destructive because its really a matter of opinion, not a matter of fact.', '2005-06-16 23:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1462291, 189775, 17837, '<td valign="top">what is all that crazy light in the background? its very disctracting.</td>', 'what is all that crazy light in the background? its very disctracting.', '2005-06-16 23:29:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1462292, 189030, 36981, '<td valign="top">This evokes a strong emotion in me  I can''t decide if I feel manipulated by sentimentatlity or if it''s real enough to be perfect.  Perhaps too strong a light by the fingertips?</td>', 'This evokes a strong emotion in me  I can''t decide if I feel manipulated by sentimentatlity or if it''s real enough to be perfect.  Perhaps too strong a light by the fingertips?', '2005-06-16 23:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1462295, 187559, 24073, '<td valign="top">I too caught lightning in a photo, however yours has a better landscape, and of course the reflection in the water is sweet.  GL, i hope the best for ya.  I scored ya high in my book.  Great colors too.</td>', 'I too caught lightning in a photo, however yours has a better landscape, and of course the reflection in the water is sweet.  GL, i hope the best for ya.  I scored ya high in my book.  Great colors too.', '2005-06-16 23:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1462298, 188284, 36981, '<td valign="top">Love the concept, and it certainly evokes darkness.  I wish the fabric underneath the cap wasn''t there or wasn''t as noticable.  Perhaps slighly overexposed on the cap?</td>', 'Love the concept, and it certainly evokes darkness.  I wish the fabric underneath the cap wasn''t there or wasn''t as noticable.  Perhaps slighly overexposed on the cap?', '2005-06-16 23:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
