(1462358, 189433, 37252, '<td valign="top">the face, chest, and right hand are too bright. The area above the left knee is distracting  - would have been better if the black background had covered this area also. You may try following the tutorial for resizing your DPC submissions too - just too small of an image here.  Your idea of playtime in the darkness was a good one, just not executed very well.</td>', 'the face, chest, and right hand are too bright. The area above the left knee is distracting  - would have been better if the black background had covered this area also. You may try following the tutorial for resizing your DPC submissions too - just too small of an image here.  Your idea of playtime in the darkness was a good one, just not executed very well.', '2005-06-17 00:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
