(1462673, 190291, 19831, '<td valign="top">I find this a fitting subject for the challenge. A cool perspective, and I like the setting and the ''feel'' of the image, but I kind of feel like a strong focal point could strengthen the shot. It''s kind of there, but needs a little ''oomph'' IMO.</td>', 'I find this a fitting subject for the challenge. A cool perspective, and I like the setting and the ''feel'' of the image, but I kind of feel like a strong focal point could strengthen the shot. It''s kind of there, but needs a little ''oomph'' IMO.', '2005-06-17 03:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
