(1462676, 190008, 19831, '<td valign="top">Fits the challenge ok to me. However, compositionally, I feel that this image could be stronger either by filling the frame more or getting out of the center, but maybe that''s just me :-)</td>', 'Fits the challenge ok to me. However, compositionally, I feel that this image could be stronger either by filling the frame more or getting out of the center, but maybe that''s just me :-)', '2005-06-17 03:39:35.000000', NULL, 1),
