(1462684, 186975, 37380, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept. I like the way you have laid our your border, but for some reason it doesn''t seem to fit the round curves of your subject. I like the blue area in the top right, it adds a certain dynamic to the image.</td>', 'Interesting concept. I like the way you have laid our your border, but for some reason it doesn''t seem to fit the round curves of your subject. I like the blue area in the top right, it adds a certain dynamic to the image.', '2005-06-17 03:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
