(1462686, 190161, 19831, '<td valign="top">I can see the connection of homeless and how it fits the challenge, however, this image of a foot doesn''t say homeless to me, it says this is someones foot, thus I find the connection starting to fall apart. To me, the static composition isn''t very compelling. Perhaps a different perspective could strengthen this presentation. It is a good concept. Just my opinion of course :-)</td>', 'I can see the connection of homeless and how it fits the challenge, however, this image of a foot doesn''t say homeless to me, it says this is someones foot, thus I find the connection starting to fall apart. To me, the static composition isn''t very compelling. Perhaps a different perspective could strengthen this presentation. It is a good concept. Just my opinion of course :-)', '2005-06-17 03:49:10.000000', NULL, 1),
