(1462692, 190013, 37380, '<td valign="top">I learnt the hard way that toy shots don''t do too well in these challenges, hope yours does better. Personally, I love the Simpsons though! You have done a great job at getting that ''spooky'' lighting just right.</td>', 'I learnt the hard way that toy shots don''t do too well in these challenges, hope yours does better. Personally, I love the Simpsons though! You have done a great job at getting that ''spooky'' lighting just right.', '2005-06-17 03:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1462693, 189603, 37380, '<td valign="top">Excellent portrayal of the challenge subject. Good level of dynamic range and your use of sepia really brings out the textures in the sky and ground.</td>', 'Excellent portrayal of the challenge subject. Good level of dynamic range and your use of sepia really brings out the textures in the sky and ground.', '2005-06-17 03:58:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1462694, 190293, 19831, '<td valign="top">Wow. This is an awesome concept. It fits the challenge beatifully, in a very refreshing and creative way to me. I wish I could read braille to know if there is more here to see. Unfortunately, I don''t. Compositionally though, the shot doesn''t seem very stimulating to me. Maybe a different grouping of elements would make a difference? Also I''m thinking perhaps a more even dof, showing the whole image in focus could have a stronger impact?  Like I said, the idea is brilliant, if this is an indication of your normal line of thought and creativity, I''m sure you have and will have a lot of truly awesome photos under your belt.</td>', 'Wow. This is an awesome concept. It fits the challenge beatifully, in a very refreshing and creative way to me. I wish I could read braille to know if there is more here to see. Unfortunately, I don''t. Compositionally though, the shot doesn''t seem very stimulating to me. Maybe a different grouping of elements would make a difference? Also I''m thinking perhaps a more even dof, showing the whole image in focus could have a stronger impact?  Like I said, the idea is brilliant, if this is an indication of your normal line of thought and creativity, I''m sure you have and will have a lot of truly awesome photos under your belt.', '2005-06-17 03:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
