(1462723, 190012, 39430, '<td valign="top">It takes a steady handy hand to hold the camera still, but an even steadier hand to move something in a straight line.  Well done.  :)  Nice effect</td>', 'It takes a steady handy hand to hold the camera still, but an even steadier hand to move something in a straight line.  Well done.  :)  Nice effect', '2005-06-17 04:25:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1462724, 188556, 24486, '<td valign="top">Excellant detail. This would of done well in the Birds challenge.</td>', 'Excellant detail. This would of done well in the Birds challenge.', '2005-06-17 04:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1462728, 189733, 19831, '<td valign="top">Well, maybe you''re just trying to stir up a reaction, so my reaction is...although maybe an interesting idea, IMO, this presentation is not executed very well, and I don''t really find the image stimulating, positively or negatively. Oh, and what is "blavk" ???  I normally could care less about spelling, but if you''re going to let it all out and try to be ''edgy'' or whatever, perhaps more care should go into a simple word like black in your title, an important part of an image like this. Of course, it it is supposed to be b-l-a-V-k, then replace that last sentence with...I don''t get it???</td>', 'Well, maybe you''re just trying to stir up a reaction, so my reaction is...although maybe an interesting idea, IMO, this presentation is not executed very well, and I don''t really find the image stimulating, positively or negatively. Oh, and what is "blavk" ???  I normally could care less about spelling, but if you''re going to let it all out and try to be ''edgy'' or whatever, perhaps more care should go into a simple word like black in your title, an important part of an image like this. Of course, it it is supposed to be b-l-a-V-k, then replace that last sentence with...I don''t get it???', '2005-06-17 04:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1462729, 188059, 39430, '<td valign="top">Good use of the subject and lighting.  This is a common image, but you''ve achieved a great result without the cliche.</td>', 'Good use of the subject and lighting.  This is a common image, but you''ve achieved a great result without the cliche.', '2005-06-17 04:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1462731, 189956, 35316, '<td valign="top">This is a very pleasing picture.  On the one hand, you''ve captured darkness and the oppressiveness that is often associated with it (without going to the extreme like so many of these photos in this challenge), and on the other hand, you have successfully included a sense of hope, light, innocence that makes this photo the winner in my opinion.  Well done!  <br/> <br/>...Do I sense a ribbon on the horizon?</td>', 'This is a very pleasing picture.  On the one hand, you''ve captured darkness and the oppressiveness that is often associated with it (without going to the extreme like so many of these photos in this challenge), and on the other hand, you have successfully included a sense of hope, light, innocence that makes this photo the winner in my opinion.  Well done!   ...Do I sense a ribbon on the horizon?', '2005-06-17 04:31:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1462733, 188296, 39193, '<td valign="top">really really *really great concept and so wonderfully executed. from his expression and erect stare..you can just feel that he is being held there. held in the dark..man really great work!</td>', 'really really *really great concept and so wonderfully executed. from his expression and erect stare..you can just feel that he is being held there. held in the dark..man really great work!', '2005-06-17 04:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1462734, 187510, 35316, '<td valign="top">You have created a mood and a story very effectively here.  I like the light in the distance, representative for me of the hope that these people have in their destination, leaving the darkness behind.  Great photo.  One of my tops.  I do see some graininess in the forground head that I''m sure was unavoidable, but detracts a little in my opinion.  But such is the reality of low light photos.  Good work!</td>', 'You have created a mood and a story very effectively here.  I like the light in the distance, representative for me of the hope that these people have in their destination, leaving the darkness behind.  Great photo.  One of my tops.  I do see some graininess in the forground head that I''m sure was unavoidable, but detracts a little in my opinion.  But such is the reality of low light photos.  Good work!', '2005-06-17 04:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1462735, 190274, 39193, '<td valign="top">wow this is incredibly unnerving! I bet it would have even more of an effect if our perspective was from higher up and not so straight on w/the subject..</td>', 'wow this is incredibly unnerving! I bet it would have even more of an effect if our perspective was from higher up and not so straight on w/the subject..', '2005-06-17 04:34:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1462736, 190010, 39430, '<td valign="top">This photo would probably benefit from closer cropping.</td>', 'This photo would probably benefit from closer cropping.', '2005-06-17 04:34:25.000000', NULL, 1),
