(1462889, 189598, 39021, '<td valign="top">I find the frog too centered. The angle on the division between the metal and the concrete is good. Flash seems to be a bit on the strong side too.</td>', 'I find the frog too centered. The angle on the division between the metal and the concrete is good. Flash seems to be a bit on the strong side too.', '2005-06-17 08:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
