(1462899, 187539, 35602, '<td valign="top">After seeing this, I wish I''d done it.  Don''t go in the basement would have been so much easier than the complicated lighting and blood I drew while taking my entry.</td>', 'After seeing this, I wish I''d done it.  Don''t go in the basement would have been so much easier than the complicated lighting and blood I drew while taking my entry.', '2005-06-17 08:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
