(1462937, 189733, 35357, '<td valign="top">I am confused as to whether I should give this a 10 or a 1.  Interesting idea, in a way, but you wouldn''t catch me putting it on my wall.</td>', 'I am confused as to whether I should give this a 10 or a 1.  Interesting idea, in a way, but you wouldn''t catch me putting it on my wall.', '2005-06-17 08:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1462939, 189232, 35548, '<td valign="top">This image could be stronger if in was sharper</td>', 'This image could be stronger if in was sharper', '2005-06-17 08:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1462946, 189774, 35357, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favourite shots of the challenge and IMO should ribbon.  I like the transition from dim light up, to darkness below.  I think you''ve captured what the best horror movies try to capture by not showing the beast, but leaving it to the viewer''s imagination.  This photo doesn''t even need a title, as it is very apparent.  Good luck!</td>', 'This is one of my favourite shots of the challenge and IMO should ribbon.  I like the transition from dim light up, to darkness below.  I think you''ve captured what the best horror movies try to capture by not showing the beast, but leaving it to the viewer''s imagination.  This photo doesn''t even need a title, as it is very apparent.  Good luck!', '2005-06-17 08:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1462948, 189732, 35357, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favourites of the challenge.  It leaves a lot to the imagination.  I''m wondering if he''s about to bring out The Gimp. :-)</td>', 'This is one of my favourites of the challenge.  It leaves a lot to the imagination.  I''m wondering if he''s about to bring out The Gimp. :-)', '2005-06-17 08:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1462949, 188343, 39021, '<td valign="top">Maybe have the arm a bit lower down over the lower shins. It''s almost cutting the picture in half and seems to dominate too much where it is.</td>', 'Maybe have the arm a bit lower down over the lower shins. It''s almost cutting the picture in half and seems to dominate too much where it is.', '2005-06-17 08:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
