(1462955, 188296, 35357, '<td valign="top">IMO, you''ve done the best job far &amp; above any other at capturing what I believe is the spirit of this challenge, while doing a wonderful job of it.  Just fantastic.  This is one of my picks for a ribbon, good luck!</td>', 'IMO, you''ve done the best job far & above any other at capturing what I believe is the spirit of this challenge, while doing a wonderful job of it.  Just fantastic.  This is one of my picks for a ribbon, good luck!', '2005-06-17 08:59:10.000000', NULL, 1),
