(1463414, 190283, 35947, '<td valign="top">like the processing.  if could see the eye''s might have a little more "pop" IMO</td>', 'like the processing.  if could see the eye''s might have a little more "pop" IMO', '2005-06-17 14:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1463420, 188932, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting angle that works well for this type of challenge. There are sure to be voters giving it a low score because it is a flower. Don''t know if the dandelion on the right adds much to the composition. You might consider applying the rule of thirds with this type of shot where there is a lot of black space. If you were to apply that rule then put it on the right side so the flower faces toward the area with the most black space.</td>', 'Nice lighting angle that works well for this type of challenge. There are sure to be voters giving it a low score because it is a flower. Don''t know if the dandelion on the right adds much to the composition. You might consider applying the rule of thirds with this type of shot where there is a lot of black space. If you were to apply that rule then put it on the right side so the flower faces toward the area with the most black space.', '2005-06-17 14:17:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1463426, 188513, 5792, '<td valign="top">Very nice image and technically well processed. The horizon is bright but not overexposed like we see in many other lesser images.The reflection is gorgeous and the lines and curves of this image are great.</td>', 'Very nice image and technically well processed. The horizon is bright but not overexposed like we see in many other lesser images.The reflection is gorgeous and the lines and curves of this image are great.', '2005-06-17 14:18:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1463431, 190071, 35947, '<td valign="top">Nice reflection!  Neat to see this is day light with more detail.</td>', 'Nice reflection!  Neat to see this is day light with more detail.', '2005-06-17 14:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1463437, 189734, 5792, '<td valign="top">Viewers often wonder what this image looked like before it was artistically manipulated by the photographer in post processing. This works a lot better than most abstract images. It is taken at a good angle. DPCers tend to be more oriented toward "realistic" imagery more so than abstract imagery, particularly if it is accomplished in post processing, and the score you get with this picture will reflect that.</td>', 'Viewers often wonder what this image looked like before it was artistically manipulated by the photographer in post processing. This works a lot better than most abstract images. It is taken at a good angle. DPCers tend to be more oriented toward "realistic" imagery more so than abstract imagery, particularly if it is accomplished in post processing, and the score you get with this picture will reflect that.', '2005-06-17 14:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1463443, 189347, 5792, '<td valign="top">Good perspective, decent angle and nothing is overexposed. Focus is on the soft side. It is a decent, if not unique, photograph.</td>', 'Good perspective, decent angle and nothing is overexposed. Focus is on the soft side. It is a decent, if not unique, photograph.', '2005-06-17 14:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1463454, 190201, 5792, '<td valign="top">This is a very curious image, especially with the fire in the background. It makes the viewer wonder what it all means. The answer is in the petroglyph if you understand what it is.<br/> <br/>This image would score higher if you could come up with a different perspective that emphasizes lines, curves or diagonals.</td>', 'This is a very curious image, especially with the fire in the background. It makes the viewer wonder what it all means. The answer is in the petroglyph if you understand what it is. This image would score higher if you could come up with a different perspective that emphasizes lines, curves or diagonals.', '2005-06-17 14:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1463465, 188627, 5792, '<td valign="top">A very interesting try at using a single, strong directed light to highlight your subject. It adds a harshness and seems to fit the feeling that something awful has happened. The shadow behind the subject is a little distracting and backlighting from above and behind to the back of the head might add more interest to the composition.</td>', 'A very interesting try at using a single, strong directed light to highlight your subject. It adds a harshness and seems to fit the feeling that something awful has happened. The shadow behind the subject is a little distracting and backlighting from above and behind to the back of the head might add more interest to the composition.', '2005-06-17 14:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1463469, 190294, 22379, '<td valign="top">i love the nightlife - i got to boggie - go me! most useless comment EVER! <br/>That you used this photo (and title) for darkness, it maks me wonder what mischief you get up to after dark ;)</td>', 'i love the nightlife - i got to boggie - go me! most useless comment EVER! That you used this photo (and title) for darkness, it maks me wonder what mischief you get up to after dark ;)', '2005-06-17 14:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
