(1463783, 190263, 14211, '<td valign="top">Fantastic......so well shot it gives me goose bumps.</td>', 'Fantastic......so well shot it gives me goose bumps.', '2005-06-17 17:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1463784, 190117, 5792, '<td valign="top">Difficult to tell what this is and the title does not help. Images where it is not easy to tell what they are and where the viewer does not immediately make a connection with generally will not score high. That is true with this image.<br/> <br/>On the technical side this image is very dark but appears to be out of focus with a lot of electronic noise associated with what can be seen. It does not have a full range of tonality. It is very low contrast and needs a true white point.</td>', 'Difficult to tell what this is and the title does not help. Images where it is not easy to tell what they are and where the viewer does not immediately make a connection with generally will not score high. That is true with this image. On the technical side this image is very dark but appears to be out of focus with a lot of electronic noise associated with what can be seen. It does not have a full range of tonality. It is very low contrast and needs a true white point.', '2005-06-17 17:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1463790, 187967, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nice color image. Many viewers will think the round black border, though nicely done, is there just to shoehorn a kid picture into a "darkness" challenge and will vote accordingly. It is even taken from a parent level perspective. They will not "get it". This obviously means something to you but will not communicate it to the average voter.<br/> <br/>On the technical side a viewer might ask why the bench was included in the composition and will not be able to come up with an answer. The back of the hat is slightly overexposed and should be toned down.</td>', 'Nice color image. Many viewers will think the round black border, though nicely done, is there just to shoehorn a kid picture into a "darkness" challenge and will vote accordingly. It is even taken from a parent level perspective. They will not "get it". This obviously means something to you but will not communicate it to the average voter. On the technical side a viewer might ask why the bench was included in the composition and will not be able to come up with an answer. The back of the hat is slightly overexposed and should be toned down.', '2005-06-17 17:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1463794, 189163, 5792, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept and worthy of the challenge. The overall low technical quality of this image will hold it''s score down.</td>', 'Interesting concept and worthy of the challenge. The overall low technical quality of this image will hold it''s score down.', '2005-06-17 17:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1463797, 189066, 22379, '<td valign="top">be sure that your model is perfectaly still when taking a silhouette photo - a shape edge in this style can really make or break the picture.</td>', 'be sure that your model is perfectaly still when taking a silhouette photo - a shape edge in this style can really make or break the picture.', '2005-06-17 17:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1463798, 187858, 5792, '<td valign="top">Voters in a "darkness" challenge will see this as an attempt to shoehorn a flower image into it. You probably picked a flower in poor condition to support the darkness theme but it wil come across as just a bad flower picture.<br/> <br/>The image itself seeems just a touch oversharpened with a general yellow hue above and beyond its natural color. Detail in the center is lost and the tabletop being visible in  the composition does not add strong support for the image.</td>', 'Voters in a "darkness" challenge will see this as an attempt to shoehorn a flower image into it. You probably picked a flower in poor condition to support the darkness theme but it wil come across as just a bad flower picture. The image itself seeems just a touch oversharpened with a general yellow hue above and beyond its natural color. Detail in the center is lost and the tabletop being visible in  the composition does not add strong support for the image.', '2005-06-17 17:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1463805, 188394, 5792, '<td valign="top">This will put a dark damper on anyone''s day. The strong backlighting adds a lot of interest. he uninteresting perspective from which this image was captured will hold down your score. It also looks like the horizon is not level If that were done on purpose exaggerating the angle more might have worked better. Otherwise, you should always make the horizon absolutely rock solid level.</td>', 'This will put a dark damper on anyone''s day. The strong backlighting adds a lot of interest. he uninteresting perspective from which this image was captured will hold down your score. It also looks like the horizon is not level If that were done on purpose exaggerating the angle more might have worked better. Otherwise, you should always make the horizon absolutely rock solid level.', '2005-06-17 17:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1463812, 190068, 5792, '<td valign="top">A campfire is a good choice for a pleasant darkness concept. You are to be commended for thinking of it and presenting it in an appealing way. It might be even more effective if a second person were in the frame and they were engaged in campfire conversation.</td>', 'A campfire is a good choice for a pleasant darkness concept. You are to be commended for thinking of it and presenting it in an appealing way. It might be even more effective if a second person were in the frame and they were engaged in campfire conversation.', '2005-06-17 18:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1463822, 190218, 10124, '<td valign="top">should''ve cropped right above the clouds. the star trails are pretty ugly. the rest is quite nice.</td>', 'should''ve cropped right above the clouds. the star trails are pretty ugly. the rest is quite nice.', '2005-06-17 18:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1463827, 189433, 5792, '<td valign="top">Unsure exactly what the message is here but this may be someone I''d like to spend time with this evening. :)<br/> <br/>This has several technical flaws that will hold back it''s score. The model''s head, shoulder and chest is overexposed. Her skin color has unnatural yellowish skin as if the color balance is not right. It is unclear specifically what she is up to and the top of the little finger should not just tiouch the top of the frae the way it does. Make it either all in or all out but make concious composition decision one way or the other.  The lighted area at the top of the frame above her leg is a distracting element in the image. The images small size does not help it score well.</td>', 'Unsure exactly what the message is here but this may be someone I''d like to spend time with this evening. :) This has several technical flaws that will hold back it''s score. The model''s head, shoulder and chest is overexposed. Her skin color has unnatural yellowish skin as if the color balance is not right. It is unclear specifically what she is up to and the top of the little finger should not just tiouch the top of the frae the way it does. Make it either all in or all out but make concious composition decision one way or the other.  The lighted area at the top of the frame above her leg is a distracting element in the image. The images small size does not help it score well.', '2005-06-17 18:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1463834, 188709, 5792, '<td valign="top">The idea is right but you need to give the viewer a reason for why your subject is pryaing. It has to be more than just for it to change from physical darkmnes to physical light. You leave to much to the imagination of the viewer. The grainy and soft focus approach does not give the viewer enough reason to maintain interest in the compostion. It is intersting that the shadow profile is the sharpest part of the image. It may have special meaning but a viewer could not tell what that might be.</td>', 'The idea is right but you need to give the viewer a reason for why your subject is pryaing. It has to be more than just for it to change from physical darkmnes to physical light. You leave to much to the imagination of the viewer. The grainy and soft focus approach does not give the viewer enough reason to maintain interest in the compostion. It is intersting that the shadow profile is the sharpest part of the image. It may have special meaning but a viewer could not tell what that might be.', '2005-06-17 18:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1463838, 186993, 22379, '<td valign="top">overly post processed. THat poor grass!</td>', 'overly post processed. THat poor grass!', '2005-06-17 18:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1463844, 189310, 22379, '<td valign="top">this seems more like an underexposed picture than a darkness picture from what i can see - sorry.</td>', 'this seems more like an underexposed picture than a darkness picture from what i can see - sorry.', '2005-06-17 18:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1463847, 189725, 5792, '<td valign="top">Large, craggy branches make a good source for a darkness challenge entry. The partial desat look to this image does not really work that well with this image and the general poor technical quality will hold this score down for it. The images seems flat, toneless and not in sharp focus.</td>', 'Large, craggy branches make a good source for a darkness challenge entry. The partial desat look to this image does not really work that well with this image and the general poor technical quality will hold this score down for it. The images seems flat, toneless and not in sharp focus.', '2005-06-17 18:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
