(1463937, 190290, 5792, '<td valign="top">Interesting title for an image of an ear. Many viewers willhave trouble relating this to the challenge topic but they will see the white specks on the black background around it and likely see those as distractions from the image. They should be removed.<br/> <br/>Generally speaking the contrast and tonal range on this image is very good, but the couple small spots on the ear are overexposed.  The strait line on the left side of the ear leaves open the question why the photographer chose to trim it that way. In any regard the image should be rotated counterclockwise to make it perfectly horizonatal.</td>', 'Interesting title for an image of an ear. Many viewers willhave trouble relating this to the challenge topic but they will see the white specks on the black background around it and likely see those as distractions from the image. They should be removed. Generally speaking the contrast and tonal range on this image is very good, but the couple small spots on the ear are overexposed.  The strait line on the left side of the ear leaves open the question why the photographer chose to trim it that way. In any regard the image should be rotated counterclockwise to make it perfectly horizonatal.', '2005-06-17 18:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1463939, 190231, 33732, '<td valign="top">Very striking capture.  Darkness means this?</td>', 'Very striking capture.  Darkness means this?', '2005-06-17 18:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1463940, 189433, 33732, '<td valign="top">This has a meaning in the word and the photo.</td>', 'This has a meaning in the word and the photo.', '2005-06-17 18:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1463942, 190306, 27789, '<td valign="top">i really like the picture, though i''m not quite sure what darkness means to you from this picture, it seems more visceral and less conceptual, but i kind of like that.  if you have some sort of deeper meaning i''d be interested to know what it is</td>', 'i really like the picture, though i''m not quite sure what darkness means to you from this picture, it seems more visceral and less conceptual, but i kind of like that.  if you have some sort of deeper meaning i''d be interested to know what it is', '2005-06-17 18:35:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1463943, 189607, 38078, '<td valign="top">absolutely gorgeous!</td>', 'absolutely gorgeous!', '2005-06-17 18:35:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1463944, 190155, 22379, '<td valign="top">I cannot get beyond this being a display of lights. The only relevent darkness is to show the light imho.</td>', 'I cannot get beyond this being a display of lights. The only relevent darkness is to show the light imho.', '2005-06-17 18:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1463946, 188290, 38078, '<td valign="top">apropriate and effective</td>', 'apropriate and effective', '2005-06-17 18:36:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1463948, 187626, 5792, '<td valign="top">Another decent twise on the all black background with a small lighted object in the frame. This is an excellent way to convey a sense of darkness and a lot of photographers rightly chose to use the technique.<br/> <br/>Focus seems overly soft and you might have considered blocking the light source from the composition. It is a good use of the rule of thirds.</td>', 'Another decent twise on the all black background with a small lighted object in the frame. This is an excellent way to convey a sense of darkness and a lot of photographers rightly chose to use the technique. Focus seems overly soft and you might have considered blocking the light source from the composition. It is a good use of the rule of thirds.', '2005-06-17 18:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1463949, 190237, 38078, '<td valign="top">i was expecting this shot.  seems to be a Darth shot in every challenge.  Well composed.</td>', 'i was expecting this shot.  seems to be a Darth shot in every challenge.  Well composed.', '2005-06-17 18:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
