(1463963, 189356, 39278, '<td valign="top">Oh who`s that incredibly sweet kid? and who`s lampyridae? anyway it`s a very nice picture, but i think it`s more the ''fault'' of the kid. also, i think that the focus should have been on the little bug. :)</td>', 'Oh who`s that incredibly sweet kid? and who`s lampyridae? anyway it`s a very nice picture, but i think it`s more the ''fault'' of the kid. also, i think that the focus should have been on the little bug. :)', '2005-06-17 18:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1463966, 190132, 39278, '<td valign="top">Beautiful indeed :)</td>', 'Beautiful indeed :)', '2005-06-17 18:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1463967, 190164, 38078, '<td valign="top">i think it looks posed.  i apologize if it''s not, but that''s the impression i get because of the lit cigarette and the exposed tatt.</td>', 'i think it looks posed.  i apologize if it''s not, but that''s the impression i get because of the lit cigarette and the exposed tatt.', '2005-06-17 18:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1463968, 188021, 39278, '<td valign="top">Cool idea of darkness.  love it!<br/></td>', 'Cool idea of darkness.  love it!', '2005-06-17 18:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1463970, 187475, 38078, '<td valign="top">it held my attention.</td>', 'it held my attention.', '2005-06-17 18:43:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1463971, 189409, 5792, '<td valign="top">I suspect you included a large amount of space to emphasize the isolation of your subject, but this image might be improved by copping much of the bottom nd right side of the image from the composition. They add little that the lights and darkness don''t already provide.<br/> <br/>Reminds me of a sepia I entered in a challenge a long time ago where I purposely added grain for effect.:<br/>//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=13029<br/> <br/>Hope your does better. :)</td>', 'I suspect you included a large amount of space to emphasize the isolation of your subject, but this image might be improved by copping much of the bottom nd right side of the image from the composition. They add little that the lights and darkness don''t already provide. Reminds me of a sepia I entered in a challenge a long time ago where I purposely added grain for effect.://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=13029 Hope your does better. :)', '2005-06-17 18:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1463973, 190013, 38078, '<td valign="top">doh!</td>', 'doh!', '2005-06-17 18:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
