(1463978, 187746, 38078, '<td valign="top">this is not too dark.  i hope you are not getting complaints about how dark it is.  the extent of the darkness enhances the macabre.</td>', 'this is not too dark.  i hope you are not getting complaints about how dark it is.  the extent of the darkness enhances the macabre.', '2005-06-17 18:46:54.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1463983, 188584, 5792, '<td valign="top">Interesting and refreashing twist on the challenge theme. Good use of depth of field to enhance the effect of danger. The bear looms ominous in the background and the bird seems oblivious to it.<br/> <br/>There are a couple technical flaws that will hold the score down a little. The image is low contrast and looks washed out. The bird should appear jet black on the dark feathers and bleached white of the light ones. The biird itself and the rock it is standing on is oversharpened. There is a halo around the bird that should be cloned away and the rock has a grainy unnatural appearance.</td>', 'Interesting and refreashing twist on the challenge theme. Good use of depth of field to enhance the effect of danger. The bear looms ominous in the background and the bird seems oblivious to it. There are a couple technical flaws that will hold the score down a little. The image is low contrast and looks washed out. The bird should appear jet black on the dark feathers and bleached white of the light ones. The biird itself and the rock it is standing on is oversharpened. There is a halo around the bird that should be cloned away and the rock has a grainy unnatural appearance.', '2005-06-17 18:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1463984, 190165, 38078, '<td valign="top">good eye shadow.</td>', 'good eye shadow.', '2005-06-17 18:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1463986, 190071, 5792, '<td valign="top">Repetition in a photograph gives an image lines that are appealing for the human eye to follow. The reflection in the perfectly still water is great. This image might have been even better if taken further to the left to add a diagonal appearance to the lines and reflection. Decent job, though, as it is.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-06-22 02:25:00.</i></td>', 'Repetition in a photograph gives an image lines that are appealing for the human eye to follow. The reflection in the perfectly still water is great. This image might have been even better if taken further to the left to add a diagonal appearance to the lines and reflection. Decent job, though, as it is.', '2005-06-17 18:52:03.000000', '2005-06-22 03:25:00.000000', 1),
(1463990, 190139, 38078, '<td valign="top">the darkness of a sleeping baby.  i don''t get it.</td>', 'the darkness of a sleeping baby.  i don''t get it.', '2005-06-17 18:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1463992, 190292, 5792, '<td valign="top">Ther is so much potential in this sunset. Color, lighting, and the curves of the inlet are all spectacular. However, this image will score lower because of very poor focus and to a lesser degree that the brightness of the horizon was not toned down in post processing.</td>', 'Ther is so much potential in this sunset. Color, lighting, and the curves of the inlet are all spectacular. However, this image will score lower because of very poor focus and to a lesser degree that the brightness of the horizon was not toned down in post processing.', '2005-06-17 18:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1463999, 187419, 5792, '<td valign="top">Certainly there are a lot of voters that will score this low because it is "not dark enough". Hoever this is really a nicely done image and better than most. Yopu angle and the diagonals of the supports make for an interesting composition.<br/> <br/>The top of the lampshade is overexposed but that could be corrected with dodging. The angle of the light itself is such that it should either be straighted to make it horizontal or angled more to give it more interesting lines.</td>', 'Certainly there are a lot of voters that will score this low because it is "not dark enough". Hoever this is really a nicely done image and better than most. Yopu angle and the diagonals of the supports make for an interesting composition. The top of the lampshade is overexposed but that could be corrected with dodging. The angle of the light itself is such that it should either be straighted to make it horizontal or angled more to give it more interesting lines.', '2005-06-17 18:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1464006, 189307, 5792, '<td valign="top">This is the type of image that means a lot more to the photographer at the time they take it or while working on it in post processing than it is to the casual viewer.  Green is an intersting color in this composition but the abstract nature of the image may be to obscure for most voters to "get it". Technically it is not bad but its score will suffer anyway.</td>', 'This is the type of image that means a lot more to the photographer at the time they take it or while working on it in post processing than it is to the casual viewer.  Green is an intersting color in this composition but the abstract nature of the image may be to obscure for most voters to "get it". Technically it is not bad but its score will suffer anyway.', '2005-06-17 19:00:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1464012, 188243, 5792, '<td valign="top">Good concept and the wispy clouds are nice. It would be even better if there could be dimly lighted low mountains and a horizon to go with it. You might be tempted to artificially darken the bright crescent to keep it from being too overwhelming. The idea of this image is great.</td>', 'Good concept and the wispy clouds are nice. It would be even better if there could be dimly lighted low mountains and a horizon to go with it. You might be tempted to artificially darken the bright crescent to keep it from being too overwhelming. The idea of this image is great.', '2005-06-17 19:02:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1464015, 187154, 5792, '<td valign="top">This image has nice colors. Blue particularly is a good color to use in DPC submissions. General technical quality is good.<br/> <br/>Abstract images like this tend to be obscure to voters and this image will suffer in the scoring department because of it.</td>', 'This image has nice colors. Blue particularly is a good color to use in DPC submissions. General technical quality is good. Abstract images like this tend to be obscure to voters and this image will suffer in the scoring department because of it.', '2005-06-17 19:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1464030, 190213, 5792, '<td valign="top">For the most part this is a beautifully done image. The expression of the singer and the darkness of the place is OK, but the green mist highlighting the silhouette is terrific.<br/> <br/>The disturbing part of the image is the exceptionally noisy looking bacground items surrounding the noiseless smoke. It is so grainy that it actually is distracting to the image. The wall on the left side of the image with the running wires adds little to the composition and you might consider cropping it out of th framing just right of the rightmost wire. The candle seems out of place because it does not seem it could privide the illuminating light for the green smoke and draws the viewer''s eye away from the singer. There is some slight haloing around the singer but it is not terribly bad.<br/> <br/>Despite these defects this is an excellent picture that has mood and instant eye appeal.</td>', 'For the most part this is a beautifully done image. The expression of the singer and the darkness of the place is OK, but the green mist highlighting the silhouette is terrific. The disturbing part of the image is the exceptionally noisy looking bacground items surrounding the noiseless smoke. It is so grainy that it actually is distracting to the image. The wall on the left side of the image with the running wires adds little to the composition and you might consider cropping it out of th framing just right of the rightmost wire. The candle seems out of place because it does not seem it could privide the illuminating light for the green smoke and draws the viewer''s eye away from the singer. There is some slight haloing around the singer but it is not terribly bad. Despite these defects this is an excellent picture that has mood and instant eye appeal.', '2005-06-17 19:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1464035, 188829, 5792, '<td valign="top">A very interesting abstract image. Looks like it was taken through mottled, plastic shower door "glass". The color and lighting are generally appealing. There will be voters that don''t "get it" and vote low.<br/> <br/>Technically the flaw that holds this images back is the many overexposed areas on the palm of the hands. Darken those up with some gingerly burning would help, but you will have to be very careful not to overdo it.</td>', 'A very interesting abstract image. Looks like it was taken through mottled, plastic shower door "glass". The color and lighting are generally appealing. There will be voters that don''t "get it" and vote low. Technically the flaw that holds this images back is the many overexposed areas on the palm of the hands. Darken those up with some gingerly burning would help, but you will have to be very careful not to overdo it.', '2005-06-17 19:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1464039, 190021, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nice dark image. Good focus and cloud detail. There may be too muchh dark at the bottom of the frame and perhaps you should crop an inch or so from the composition. This is an excellent image.</td>', 'Nice dark image. Good focus and cloud detail. There may be too muchh dark at the bottom of the frame and perhaps you should crop an inch or so from the composition. This is an excellent image.', '2005-06-17 19:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1464046, 189516, 5792, '<td valign="top">Good concept and great angles on the tombstones. Black and white is a good choice for this image. It might be even better if you increased the contrast in the image and gave it a true black point. Unfortunately the detail between the stones seems mottled and a little distracting to the overall image.</td>', 'Good concept and great angles on the tombstones. Black and white is a good choice for this image. It might be even better if you increased the contrast in the image and gave it a true black point. Unfortunately the detail between the stones seems mottled and a little distracting to the overall image.', '2005-06-17 19:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1464050, 187475, 37847, '<td valign="top">just don''t get it</td>', 'just don''t get it', '2005-06-17 19:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1464051, 190142, 5792, '<td valign="top">Voters will certainly question it''s inclusion in a darkness challenge but not this one. I''m of scottish descent and understand. :)<br/> <br/>This is a great introspective candid capture. the tones are good and the background detail perfectly fits the image. This should score higher than it probably will.</td>', 'Voters will certainly question it''s inclusion in a darkness challenge but not this one. I''m of scottish descent and understand. :) This is a great introspective candid capture. the tones are good and the background detail perfectly fits the image. This should score higher than it probably will.', '2005-06-17 19:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1464066, 190175, 5792, '<td valign="top">I''ve went on four or five photo safari''s specificall to capture turkey vulture images in the last several weeks and did so during the challenge week but was unable to capture anything worthy of submission for this challenge. I like catching them in the early morning sunning themselves like you have here.<br/> <br/>It is a good capture but the background is overwhelming of the bird. This can be corrected by reducing the background brightness by 10-30 percent and possibly reducing it''s contrast as well. You might try to add some bright highlights to the bird to make it stand out above the background. Unsure if this is better as sepia or would be better as B&amp;W. You might try both to see what you think.</td>', 'I''ve went on four or five photo safari''s specificall to capture turkey vulture images in the last several weeks and did so during the challenge week but was unable to capture anything worthy of submission for this challenge. I like catching them in the early morning sunning themselves like you have here. It is a good capture but the background is overwhelming of the bird. This can be corrected by reducing the background brightness by 10-30 percent and possibly reducing it''s contrast as well. You might try to add some bright highlights to the bird to make it stand out above the background. Unsure if this is better as sepia or would be better as B&W. You might try both to see what you think.', '2005-06-17 19:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1464073, 188242, 5792, '<td valign="top">A good surrealistic image regardless how it was achieved. <br/> <br/>Having taken a lot of lightining images myself it is obviously this is not natural. Certainly there will be voters that feel you are trying to pull something over on them and will vote it lower because of that.<br/> <br/>It appears there are fingers or something that is not a natural gelogic feature coming in from the left side of the frame that is alluded to in the title. Be intersting to see how voters react to this image.</td>', 'A good surrealistic image regardless how it was achieved.  Having taken a lot of lightining images myself it is obviously this is not natural. Certainly there will be voters that feel you are trying to pull something over on them and will vote it lower because of that. It appears there are fingers or something that is not a natural gelogic feature coming in from the left side of the frame that is alluded to in the title. Be intersting to see how voters react to this image.', '2005-06-17 19:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1464075, 189232, 22379, '<td valign="top">what is it?</td>', 'what is it?', '2005-06-17 19:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
