(1464100, 190182, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nice concept that might be better in B&amp; W rather than color. Misty subjects five great tonal range that are perfect for B&amp;W. This image has a bluish unnatural color most apparent on the trees to the right that detract from this otherwise wonderful image.</td>', 'Nice concept that might be better in B& W rather than color. Misty subjects five great tonal range that are perfect for B&W. This image has a bluish unnatural color most apparent on the trees to the right that detract from this otherwise wonderful image.', '2005-06-17 19:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
