(1464214, 188909, 5792, '<td valign="top">Not a unique concept but one that fits the challenge well. Focus is a fundamental issue with all dogital imaging. This image seems soft focused. The DOF is that no-man''s land where it is either too shallow or not shallow enough.</td>', 'Not a unique concept but one that fits the challenge well. Focus is a fundamental issue with all dogital imaging. This image seems soft focused. The DOF is that no-man''s land where it is either too shallow or not shallow enough.', '2005-06-17 21:08:27.000000', NULL, 1),
