(1464450, 189413, 36914, '<td valign="top">The best way to have a guys night out.  A Fridge, shed, large back yard and some hops.</td>', 'The best way to have a guys night out.  A Fridge, shed, large back yard and some hops.', '2005-06-17 23:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1464455, 190280, 34247, '<td valign="top">I like the choice of crop here, as well as the choice of a primary subject. I''m not sure if fear leaps to mind upon viewing the subject, but there''s definitely something amiss there, and this relates well to the challenge topic. The lighting/contrast choice, however, I think is a missed opportunity. Yes, the dark tone might score well with voters, but I feel this image really needed a stronger contrast. A lighter left side of the image, would take care of the ear parts that are still visible (which I think is rather distracting) and at the same time enhance the overall image. More light on the right side would also bring out the detailing and features on the face, adding a starkness and possibly emphasizing the decay aspects of the image. 7</td>', 'I like the choice of crop here, as well as the choice of a primary subject. I''m not sure if fear leaps to mind upon viewing the subject, but there''s definitely something amiss there, and this relates well to the challenge topic. The lighting/contrast choice, however, I think is a missed opportunity. Yes, the dark tone might score well with voters, but I feel this image really needed a stronger contrast. A lighter left side of the image, would take care of the ear parts that are still visible (which I think is rather distracting) and at the same time enhance the overall image. More light on the right side would also bring out the detailing and features on the face, adding a starkness and possibly emphasizing the decay aspects of the image. 7', '2005-06-17 23:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1464457, 189738, 34058, '<td valign="top">This must have been difficult to get a clear shot.  You did a great job at it!</td>', 'This must have been difficult to get a clear shot.  You did a great job at it!', '2005-06-17 23:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1464458, 188133, 36914, '<td valign="top">OK?  Let me guess, taking a shot of the neighborhood from a marry go round at top speed.</td>', 'OK?  Let me guess, taking a shot of the neighborhood from a marry go round at top speed.', '2005-06-17 23:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1464460, 188284, 34247, '<td valign="top">I think the image is a nice take on the challenge, and tries to go beyond a physically dark image and into the realm of emotional darkness. The background material is a bit of a distraction with all the shiny reflection, particularly evidenced in the right upper corner. The lighting on the logo of the hat is a bit too harsh, I feel. And I''m also nagged by the slight tilt of the hat, horizontally. 6</td>', 'I think the image is a nice take on the challenge, and tries to go beyond a physically dark image and into the realm of emotional darkness. The background material is a bit of a distraction with all the shiny reflection, particularly evidenced in the right upper corner. The lighting on the logo of the hat is a bit too harsh, I feel. And I''m also nagged by the slight tilt of the hat, horizontally. 6', '2005-06-17 23:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1464461, 190242, 34058, '<td valign="top">A fellow stargazer!  That''s what I do when it gets dark!</td>', 'A fellow stargazer!  That''s what I do when it gets dark!', '2005-06-17 23:33:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1464463, 190280, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. Great grey tones. STechnical quality is good. Seems  to be on the low contrast side for white. Might want to try setting a white point or by increasing white with a selective color adjustment. Doesn''t really come across as fearful but I doubt voters will have a problem relating this to the challenge topic.</td>', 'Nice composition. Great grey tones. STechnical quality is good. Seems  to be on the low contrast side for white. Might want to try setting a white point or by increasing white with a selective color adjustment. Doesn''t really come across as fearful but I doubt voters will have a problem relating this to the challenge topic.', '2005-06-17 23:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1464465, 189539, 34247, '<td valign="top">It''s a dark primary subject, and a nicely composed and shot image. But to some extent, I feel this is not as thought provoking as some of the other shots in the challenge, the ones that try to go into an exploration of emotional, mental etc darkness. 7</td>', 'It''s a dark primary subject, and a nicely composed and shot image. But to some extent, I feel this is not as thought provoking as some of the other shots in the challenge, the ones that try to go into an exploration of emotional, mental etc darkness. 7', '2005-06-17 23:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1464472, 190304, 34247, '<td valign="top">The image feels flat, and bumped up contrast might have yielded a more effective shot for me. The shiny tip of the nose is a distraction point, imho. I''m also not grabbing on clearly enough on your message. Is this sleep or death? 6</td>', 'The image feels flat, and bumped up contrast might have yielded a more effective shot for me. The shiny tip of the nose is a distraction point, imho. I''m also not grabbing on clearly enough on your message. Is this sleep or death? 6', '2005-06-17 23:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
