(1464743, 190244, 37302, '<td valign="top">To me this is an average photo. It is lit correctly and the photo is sharp but it just doesn''t have that star quality to be the next american idol.. well you know what I mean</td>', 'To me this is an average photo. It is lit correctly and the photo is sharp but it just doesn''t have that star quality to be the next american idol.. well you know what I mean', '2005-06-18 02:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1464744, 189352, 37302, '<td valign="top">okay this is funny!</td>', 'okay this is funny!', '2005-06-18 02:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1464749, 190175, 37380, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, with the light making the feathers somewhat translucent. I do find the background a bit busy for my liking, but the pose of the bird is great. Well done.</td>', 'Nice shot, with the light making the feathers somewhat translucent. I do find the background a bit busy for my liking, but the pose of the bird is great. Well done.', '2005-06-18 03:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1464750, 190135, 37380, '<td valign="top">Lovely gradient in the sky. Good use of sepia.</td>', 'Lovely gradient in the sky. Good use of sepia.', '2005-06-18 03:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1464753, 190296, 37380, '<td valign="top">Dramatic lighting gives this photo a lot of impact.</td>', 'Dramatic lighting gives this photo a lot of impact.', '2005-06-18 03:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1464756, 187981, 37380, '<td valign="top">Lovely detail in the pupil - your use of sepia really brings that out. What is the bar across the photo though? The frame of a pair of glasses?  I really like how you lit the face, making the area around the eye a bit blown out - it really seperates the darker part of the eye and draws the viewers attention to it.</td>', 'Lovely detail in the pupil - your use of sepia really brings that out. What is the bar across the photo though? The frame of a pair of glasses?  I really like how you lit the face, making the area around the eye a bit blown out - it really seperates the darker part of the eye and draws the viewers attention to it.', '2005-06-18 03:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1464759, 190279, 37380, '<td valign="top">Somewhat abstract, I could only figure out that it''s a TV based on the writing. The composition has left me wondering what the main focus point is supposed to be - the switch, antenna or the two round dials? Lighting is good with details of all components of the TV clearly visible.</td>', 'Somewhat abstract, I could only figure out that it''s a TV based on the writing. The composition has left me wondering what the main focus point is supposed to be - the switch, antenna or the two round dials? Lighting is good with details of all components of the TV clearly visible.', '2005-06-18 03:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1464761, 186993, 37103, '<td valign="top">I really like this image.  I''m guessing you inverted it.  I think it would be a little more appealling if the green in fron weren''t so shocking.  Maybe you could desaturate the green or crop just above the plants.</td>', 'I really like this image.  I''m guessing you inverted it.  I think it would be a little more appealling if the green in fron weren''t so shocking.  Maybe you could desaturate the green or crop just above the plants.', '2005-06-18 03:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1464762, 188627, 37380, '<td valign="top">Great use of light has resulted in a high-contrast image that is pleasing to the eye. My only request next time would be for a larger image to really show off how good the photo is.</td>', 'Great use of light has resulted in a high-contrast image that is pleasing to the eye. My only request next time would be for a larger image to really show off how good the photo is.', '2005-06-18 03:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1464764, 188133, 37103, '<td valign="top">This image is cool to look at, I love the turquoise color.  I''m not sure how it works with the title.</td>', 'This image is cool to look at, I love the turquoise color.  I''m not sure how it works with the title.', '2005-06-18 03:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1464766, 190132, 37103, '<td valign="top">Pretty image.  I like how the stem disappears into the black.  For me despite the implication that the dandelion is dying this image does not really bring to mind darkness.</td>', 'Pretty image.  I like how the stem disappears into the black.  For me despite the implication that the dandelion is dying this image does not really bring to mind darkness.', '2005-06-18 03:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1464769, 190212, 37380, '<td valign="top">Great colours in this photo which is lovely and sharp despite beinig shot under difficult circumstances.</td>', 'Great colours in this photo which is lovely and sharp despite beinig shot under difficult circumstances.', '2005-06-18 03:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1464770, 188021, 37103, '<td valign="top">Eggs have never been so creepy.  They almost look illuminated from the inside.  Putting the brown egg in there was a nice touch.  I don''t know how you made the crate disappear into black but it looks great.</td>', 'Eggs have never been so creepy.  They almost look illuminated from the inside.  Putting the brown egg in there was a nice touch.  I don''t know how you made the crate disappear into black but it looks great.', '2005-06-18 03:19:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1464772, 188556, 37380, '<td valign="top">Tack sharp, great lighting, interesting subject - what else is there to say? Well done.</td>', 'Tack sharp, great lighting, interesting subject - what else is there to say? Well done.', '2005-06-18 03:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1464775, 190285, 37103, '<td valign="top">I definitely get a dark, isolated, scary feeling from this image.  It might have been nice to have a touch more of sky.  The girl''s pose is all right, but something about her looks very skeletal and scarier than I like.</td>', 'I definitely get a dark, isolated, scary feeling from this image.  It might have been nice to have a touch more of sky.  The girl''s pose is all right, but something about her looks very skeletal and scarier than I like.', '2005-06-18 03:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1464776, 190256, 37103, '<td valign="top">Great photo.  The fog/clouds covering part of the image really does a lot to create the feeling of darkness/mystery.  I don''t know what this structure is, but it was a perfect choice for this.  9.</td>', 'Great photo.  The fog/clouds covering part of the image really does a lot to create the feeling of darkness/mystery.  I don''t know what this structure is, but it was a perfect choice for this.  9.', '2005-06-18 03:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1464779, 190314, 37380, '<td valign="top">The bright reflection on the snake''s head distracts from what is otherwise a very good shot. Well done.</td>', 'The bright reflection on the snake''s head distracts from what is otherwise a very good shot. Well done.', '2005-06-18 03:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1464783, 190217, 37380, '<td valign="top">Given your tiitle, I was surprised that there was so much more to the image when I scrolled down. You could have easily cropped out the bottom half of the image and it might have resulted in an even more haunting image. Still a lovely image either way though.</td>', 'Given your tiitle, I was surprised that there was so much more to the image when I scrolled down. You could have easily cropped out the bottom half of the image and it might have resulted in an even more haunting image. Still a lovely image either way though.', '2005-06-18 03:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1464784, 188537, 37380, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid that I have a real problem trying to connect this image to the challenge description. The photo is interesting and engaging. It makes me want to see who the person is behind the flash.</td>', 'I''m afraid that I have a real problem trying to connect this image to the challenge description. The photo is interesting and engaging. It makes me want to see who the person is behind the flash.', '2005-06-18 03:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1464786, 188709, 37380, '<td valign="top">Good composition here. I find the shadow behind the girl a bit distracting, but that may have been an artistic decision on your part to have it included. It definitely adds to the light/dark duality present in the image.</td>', 'Good composition here. I find the shadow behind the girl a bit distracting, but that may have been an artistic decision on your part to have it included. It definitely adds to the light/dark duality present in the image.', '2005-06-18 03:33:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1464791, 188243, 37380, '<td valign="top">Not sure about the border, but I like your use of negative space on to add dramatic impact. The wide aspect ratio works well and gives it a panoramic feel. The whisp of cloud prevents the image from becoming too stark.</td>', 'Not sure about the border, but I like your use of negative space on to add dramatic impact. The wide aspect ratio works well and gives it a panoramic feel. The whisp of cloud prevents the image from becoming too stark.', '2005-06-18 03:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1464793, 190010, 19831, '<td valign="top">This is a nice idea. I think compositionally, the photo perhaps would be stronger if a majority of either the top or bottom were cropped out, placing the subject near the top or bottom edge of the image.</td>', 'This is a nice idea. I think compositionally, the photo perhaps would be stronger if a majority of either the top or bottom were cropped out, placing the subject near the top or bottom edge of the image.', '2005-06-18 03:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1464797, 187294, 37380, '<td valign="top">I love the lighting in this photo, and the wind-swept hair look give this photo a very distinctive feel to it. The colours in the eyes are amazing.</td>', 'I love the lighting in this photo, and the wind-swept hair look give this photo a very distinctive feel to it. The colours in the eyes are amazing.', '2005-06-18 03:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1464798, 187464, 37380, '<td valign="top">Although I doubt that they are real, I love the colours in the sky. There appears to be some noise/banding in the top left - but this may simply be a camera issue at high iso settings. Good composition with the horizon at just the right leve for this image.</td>', 'Although I doubt that they are real, I love the colours in the sky. There appears to be some noise/banding in the top left - but this may simply be a camera issue at high iso settings. Good composition with the horizon at just the right leve for this image.', '2005-06-18 03:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1464799, 190255, 19831, '<td valign="top">I like this photo. Very emotive to me. Some voters may hammer it, but I can see the connection and think it fits the challenge well. The people in the background works ok, adds some context to the image, but one minor nitpick- I wish the main subject''s foot was not cut off at the bottom of the photo. Nice shot.</td>', 'I like this photo. Very emotive to me. Some voters may hammer it, but I can see the connection and think it fits the challenge well. The people in the background works ok, adds some context to the image, but one minor nitpick- I wish the main subject''s foot was not cut off at the bottom of the photo. Nice shot.', '2005-06-18 03:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1464800, 190282, 19831, '<td valign="top">I like this idea, but I''m not crazy about the overall presentation/execution. Seems like too much glare and hot spots for me.</td>', 'I like this idea, but I''m not crazy about the overall presentation/execution. Seems like too much glare and hot spots for me.', '2005-06-18 03:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1464802, 189700, 37380, '<td valign="top">The relatively short exposure for this kind of shot has resulted in very short star trails, and could be mistaken by some as motion blur (which is obviously not the case because the rocks are nice and sharp). If possible, I would suggest either a longer exposure to make the star trails appear more deliberate or shorter to make them appear closer to points. Other than that, I really like the shot with a lovely ''National Geographic'' feel to it. Well done.</td>', 'The relatively short exposure for this kind of shot has resulted in very short star trails, and could be mistaken by some as motion blur (which is obviously not the case because the rocks are nice and sharp). If possible, I would suggest either a longer exposure to make the star trails appear more deliberate or shorter to make them appear closer to points. Other than that, I really like the shot with a lovely ''National Geographic'' feel to it. Well done.', '2005-06-18 03:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1464804, 188296, 37380, '<td valign="top">Very imaginative choice of subject. Good use of negative space to add a sense of isolation.</td>', 'Very imaginative choice of subject. Good use of negative space to add a sense of isolation.', '2005-06-18 04:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1464806, 189526, 37380, '<td valign="top">Composition could have been improved by cropping out the red areas of the photo. The eyes are a lovely colour and appear to be nicely in focus. They really pop out of the image to grab your attention. There is a certain amount of low-level noise in the black areas which you might have been able to recover with careful use of levels/curves to make the ''almost-black'' completely black. Composition is great with the eyes placed nicely off-center.</td>', 'Composition could have been improved by cropping out the red areas of the photo. The eyes are a lovely colour and appear to be nicely in focus. They really pop out of the image to grab your attention. There is a certain amount of low-level noise in the black areas which you might have been able to recover with careful use of levels/curves to make the ''almost-black'' completely black. Composition is great with the eyes placed nicely off-center.', '2005-06-18 04:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1464809, 188286, 37380, '<td valign="top">It looks like it was raining a bit when the photo was taken - but it''s hard to tell. It appears that the image was saved with a relatively high compression setting, which has resulted in some jpeg-artifacts - especially in the top-left corner. I would suggest using a higher quality setting when saving your next image to make sure your photos are presented with the high quality they deserve.</td>', 'It looks like it was raining a bit when the photo was taken - but it''s hard to tell. It appears that the image was saved with a relatively high compression setting, which has resulted in some jpeg-artifacts - especially in the top-left corner. I would suggest using a higher quality setting when saving your next image to make sure your photos are presented with the high quality they deserve.', '2005-06-18 04:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1464810, 187192, 37380, '<td valign="top">Great eye-popping colour &amp; focus.</td>', 'Great eye-popping colour & focus.', '2005-06-18 04:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1464811, 189372, 37380, '<td valign="top">It''s definitely a great photo, but I feel that it relies too heavily on the title to show a connection to the challenge. Lovely blue hues here.</td>', 'It''s definitely a great photo, but I feel that it relies too heavily on the title to show a connection to the challenge. Lovely blue hues here.', '2005-06-18 04:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1464813, 190118, 37380, '<td valign="top">Finally a great image depicting how someone feels about the darkness. I like the movement of the hair - it adds a dynamic element to an otherwise still image.</td>', 'Finally a great image depicting how someone feels about the darkness. I like the movement of the hair - it adds a dynamic element to an otherwise still image.', '2005-06-18 04:21:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1464814, 188242, 37380, '<td valign="top">One word - ''wow''.</td>', 'One word - ''wow''.', '2005-06-18 04:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1464816, 188059, 39221, '<td valign="top">love the atmosphere here</td>', 'love the atmosphere here', '2005-06-18 04:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1464823, 187296, 39221, '<td valign="top">THIS is darkness, the whole mood, the feeling of `evil` - i''ve gone through soooo many images on here, and so many misinterpretations (sunsets, lightning, fireworks... these are all a play on LIGHT - something that may compliment darkness - but is NOT darkness itself).<br/></td>', 'THIS is darkness, the whole mood, the feeling of `evil` - i''ve gone through soooo many images on here, and so many misinterpretations (sunsets, lightning, fireworks... these are all a play on LIGHT - something that may compliment darkness - but is NOT darkness itself).', '2005-06-18 04:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1464826, 187730, 39221, '<td valign="top">love the flames, not sure it captures `darkness` for me though.</td>', 'love the flames, not sure it captures `darkness` for me though.', '2005-06-18 04:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1464827, 190175, 39221, '<td valign="top">bird of prey... ultimately means death for its prey...</td>', 'bird of prey... ultimately means death for its prey...', '2005-06-18 04:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1464828, 186975, 39221, '<td valign="top">i like the idea, but i think it could have been executed better</td>', 'i like the idea, but i think it could have been executed better', '2005-06-18 04:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1464829, 189314, 39221, '<td valign="top">nice kind of architecture shot, but doesn''t capture  `darkness` for me though.</td>', 'nice kind of architecture shot, but doesn''t capture  `darkness` for me though.', '2005-06-18 04:39:40.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1464834, 187617, 39221, '<td valign="top">a great night shot,the tree is offputting i think and a crop of the bridge from the right hand side of the tree would''ve been almost perfect - for a night shot -  but i think just because an image is at night - doesn''t mean it portrays darkness, in reality you''re capturing light here.</td>', 'a great night shot,the tree is offputting i think and a crop of the bridge from the right hand side of the tree would''ve been almost perfect - for a night shot -  but i think just because an image is at night - doesn''t mean it portrays darkness, in reality you''re capturing light here.', '2005-06-18 04:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1464839, 189943, 31443, '<td valign="top">This is amazing, straight from 1001 night!</td>', 'This is amazing, straight from 1001 night!', '2005-06-18 04:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1464841, 188549, 39221, '<td valign="top">to dream you need to be asleep :-) and to day dream it needs to be day ;-)<br/> <br/>use of light is correct for darkness, but there''s no feeling in this image other than perhaps the slightly lost look in the eyes, but i''m not feeling the crop or any depth in this shot.</td>', 'to dream you need to be asleep :-) and to day dream it needs to be day ;-) use of light is correct for darkness, but there''s no feeling in this image other than perhaps the slightly lost look in the eyes, but i''m not feeling the crop or any depth in this shot.', '2005-06-18 04:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1464842, 187573, 35786, '<td valign="top">to me, this looks like a good photographer with a bad camera. This is an excellent start!<br/>Vivid colors and good composition. keep shooting!!!!<br/> <br/></td>', 'to me, this looks like a good photographer with a bad camera. This is an excellent start!Vivid colors and good composition. keep shooting!!!! ', '2005-06-18 04:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
