(1464913, 188235, 24486, '<td valign="top">One of the great ironies isn''t it. Love your fellow man but kill him if he follows another religion. It''s going to be real interesting to see how this scores. I hope your title doesn''t hurt the votes you are recieving.</td>', 'One of the great ironies isn''t it. Love your fellow man but kill him if he follows another religion. It''s going to be real interesting to see how this scores. I hope your title doesn''t hurt the votes you are recieving.', '2005-06-18 05:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
