(1465564, 187263, 19746, '<td valign="top">I recognize that staircase!  Similar to an image that ribboned in a challenge a little while ago.  Good expression of darkness, I like the tones and the slight grain. 8<br/> <br/>Alex</td>', 'I recognize that staircase!  Similar to an image that ribboned in a challenge a little while ago.  Good expression of darkness, I like the tones and the slight grain. 8 Alex', '2005-06-18 16:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465567, 189943, 19746, '<td valign="top">That''s at Kagga Kamma?  There''re some cool rocks out that way :)<br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/></td>', 'That''s at Kagga Kamma?  There''re some cool rocks out that way :)      ', '2005-06-18 16:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465568, 187566, 19746, '<td valign="top">Without the flaring and with slightly better lighting this image could definitely be a ribbon contender.  As it is, though, there''s something missing from this otherwise excellent idea.<br/> <br/>5 - good luck :)<br/> <br/>Alex</td>', 'Without the flaring and with slightly better lighting this image could definitely be a ribbon contender.  As it is, though, there''s something missing from this otherwise excellent idea. 5 - good luck :) Alex', '2005-06-18 16:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465569, 187192, 29651, '<td valign="top">Pretty photo, nice color contrast.  I like the dark side of dead tree in the back and vibrant dry needles stand in front. You could increase dof a little more to get the tips in focus.</td>', 'Pretty photo, nice color contrast.  I like the dark side of dead tree in the back and vibrant dry needles stand in front. You could increase dof a little more to get the tips in focus.', '2005-06-18 16:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465570, 189952, 29651, '<td valign="top">interesting texture. I definitely don''t want to go thru this dark tunnel.</td>', 'interesting texture. I definitely don''t want to go thru this dark tunnel.', '2005-06-18 16:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465572, 189263, 29651, '<td valign="top">very interesting composition.</td>', 'very interesting composition.', '2005-06-18 16:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465573, 189773, 29651, '<td valign="top">The square makes this photo interesting. Good use of lights , action and camera!</td>', 'The square makes this photo interesting. Good use of lights , action and camera!', '2005-06-18 16:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465576, 187894, 29651, '<td valign="top">very interesting twist to the subject.</td>', 'very interesting twist to the subject.', '2005-06-18 17:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465586, 187746, 18080, '<td valign="top">Very Clever<br/>10<br/>takes a second to see, as you intended.<br/>Well done</td>', 'Very Clever10takes a second to see, as you intended.Well done', '2005-06-18 17:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465588, 190252, 18080, '<td valign="top">W I N N E R<br/> <br/>Love this shot<br/>10<br/>good luck<br/>Focus is spot on<br/>light level is perfect<br/>great work<br/></td>', 'W I N N E R Love this shot10good luckFocus is spot onlight level is perfectgreat work', '2005-06-18 17:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465592, 187401, 36397, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, good exposure. Original title.</td>', 'Nice picture, good exposure. Original title.', '2005-06-18 17:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465594, 188591, 36397, '<td valign="top">Little detail in dark tones of the statue due to light pillars. These pillars are a little too prominent i.m.o. Still nice picture though!</td>', 'Little detail in dark tones of the statue due to light pillars. These pillars are a little too prominent i.m.o. Still nice picture though!', '2005-06-18 17:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465595, 190262, 36397, '<td valign="top">Link to darkness subject not very obvious. Picture is not very sharp.</td>', 'Link to darkness subject not very obvious. Picture is not very sharp.', '2005-06-18 17:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465598, 188046, 36397, '<td valign="top">Spectacular clouds! Wonderfull! The link to Jesus seems a bit far fetched to me.</td>', 'Spectacular clouds! Wonderfull! The link to Jesus seems a bit far fetched to me.', '2005-06-18 17:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465600, 188318, 36397, '<td valign="top">Simple but nice. Due to this clean character, the picture lacks a bit of expression.</td>', 'Simple but nice. Due to this clean character, the picture lacks a bit of expression.', '2005-06-18 17:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465601, 187614, 36397, '<td valign="top">Picture is not sharp.</td>', 'Picture is not sharp.', '2005-06-18 17:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465602, 189607, 36397, '<td valign="top">Great picture!! I love it! A winner!</td>', 'Great picture!! I love it! A winner!', '2005-06-18 17:45:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465605, 189305, 36397, '<td valign="top">What does this mirage express? The picture is a bit puzzling but  entertains not for very long. Too simple? I don''t know....</td>', 'What does this mirage express? The picture is a bit puzzling but  entertains not for very long. Too simple? I don''t know....', '2005-06-18 17:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465606, 189956, 36397, '<td valign="top">Great! Nice composition.</td>', 'Great! Nice composition.', '2005-06-18 17:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465608, 187689, 36397, '<td valign="top">Picture is not sharp and doesn''t contain something special i.m.o. sorry...</td>', 'Picture is not sharp and doesn''t contain something special i.m.o. sorry...', '2005-06-18 17:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465612, 190056, 36397, '<td valign="top">Dark...really dark, maybe not very sharp but still nice!</td>', 'Dark...really dark, maybe not very sharp but still nice!', '2005-06-18 17:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465620, 188884, 24486, '<td valign="top">Well done. Photographing anything behind glass in water creates its own set of problems that you have overcome. Goods luck</td>', 'Well done. Photographing anything behind glass in water creates its own set of problems that you have overcome. Goods luck', '2005-06-18 18:11:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465632, 190232, 16053, '<td valign="top">Good composition, but the dof is so shallow that almons nothing is in focus</td>', 'Good composition, but the dof is so shallow that almons nothing is in focus', '2005-06-18 18:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465634, 190118, 16053, '<td valign="top">Good technique and good fitting of challenge theme. vey nice photo</td>', 'Good technique and good fitting of challenge theme. vey nice photo', '2005-06-18 18:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465664, 190274, 17837, '<td valign="top">this would be SO much better if all the grain werent there!</td>', 'this would be SO much better if all the grain werent there!', '2005-06-18 19:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465735, 190132, 24976, '<td valign="top">the stem seems oddly cropped by the dark. other than that really nice.</td>', 'the stem seems oddly cropped by the dark. other than that really nice.', '2005-06-18 19:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465748, 190213, 30791, '<td valign="top">oh yeah<br/>thats in the top 10 for sure<br/>10!</td>', 'oh yeahthats in the top 10 for sure10!', '2005-06-18 20:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465794, 188909, 17851, '<td valign="top">Great Idea but it seems to be a bit out of focus to me, maybe a bit more brightness/contrast?<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-06-24 20:46:52.</i></td>', 'Great Idea but it seems to be a bit out of focus to me, maybe a bit more brightness/contrast?', '2005-06-18 20:50:07.000000', '2005-06-24 21:46:52.000000', 1),
(1465795, 190293, 16560, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but there doesn''t seem to be an actual focus point here, just a random scramble of bumps. Perhaps better focus as a single point so that the eyes do not wander would help. Also the in focus parts do not look in focus, though it might be the compression on the jpg causing this.</td>', 'Good idea, but there doesn''t seem to be an actual focus point here, just a random scramble of bumps. Perhaps better focus as a single point so that the eyes do not wander would help. Also the in focus parts do not look in focus, though it might be the compression on the jpg causing this.', '2005-06-18 20:50:48.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1465799, 189771, 16560, '<td valign="top">As a sunset picture, this is not very "wow". Perhaps you could have waited a bit longer so that the sun has neared the ground and caused some backlighting? In that case, it might confuse fewer people wondering about the "darkness" aspect. Also, using the full 640 pixels would be ideal.</td>', 'As a sunset picture, this is not very "wow". Perhaps you could have waited a bit longer so that the sun has neared the ground and caused some backlighting? In that case, it might confuse fewer people wondering about the "darkness" aspect. Also, using the full 640 pixels would be ideal.', '2005-06-18 20:54:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465806, 189173, 16560, '<td valign="top">Ok... I recognize the area this is shot in... and I love the area. However here, it was shot at night, so you had to slow down the shutter but in doing so you ended up letting the clouds blur from movement yet the moon and rocks are in sharp focus. Perhaps you wanted this, but I''m not sure if this conflict is ideal.</td>', 'Ok... I recognize the area this is shot in... and I love the area. However here, it was shot at night, so you had to slow down the shutter but in doing so you ended up letting the clouds blur from movement yet the moon and rocks are in sharp focus. Perhaps you wanted this, but I''m not sure if this conflict is ideal.', '2005-06-18 20:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465810, 188537, 16560, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a bit too much post processing? Large sections of the picture are washed out in the lime green and don''t actually add to the picture.</td>', 'Perhaps a bit too much post processing? Large sections of the picture are washed out in the lime green and don''t actually add to the picture.', '2005-06-18 20:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465811, 190242, 16560, '<td valign="top">The bright background overpowers the foreground, and the tree intersects your main focus, which is very annoying to the eyes (especially because the tree itself is not in focus).</td>', 'The bright background overpowers the foreground, and the tree intersects your main focus, which is very annoying to the eyes (especially because the tree itself is not in focus).', '2005-06-18 20:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465813, 190003, 16560, '<td valign="top">Although I like the light on the upper half, the slight bit of light at the bottom where the leg is doesn''t look right considering the almost completely black middle half. Perhaps full use of the 640 pixels would have helped in terms of detail, because a lot is lost with the smaller size. As for the model''s expression, it doesn''t look "dark", but it probably is just the lack of detail from the small resolution.</td>', 'Although I like the light on the upper half, the slight bit of light at the bottom where the leg is doesn''t look right considering the almost completely black middle half. Perhaps full use of the 640 pixels would have helped in terms of detail, because a lot is lost with the smaller size. As for the model''s expression, it doesn''t look "dark", but it probably is just the lack of detail from the small resolution.', '2005-06-18 21:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465816, 190206, 16560, '<td valign="top">Maybe pushing it a bit... maybe if the winning side were to use black pieces (rather than a brownish finish) it might do better? I don''t think the very centered composition is strong in showing the "darkness" of the loss.</td>', 'Maybe pushing it a bit... maybe if the winning side were to use black pieces (rather than a brownish finish) it might do better? I don''t think the very centered composition is strong in showing the "darkness" of the loss.', '2005-06-18 21:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465818, 189461, 16560, '<td valign="top">The high contrasting white dots on the left side are very annoying, but without spot editting it might be hard to remove without washing out the fox (dog?). I''m not sure I like the crop however, pushing the fox so far to the right and cutting off the neck.</td>', 'The high contrasting white dots on the left side are very annoying, but without spot editting it might be hard to remove without washing out the fox (dog?). I''m not sure I like the crop however, pushing the fox so far to the right and cutting off the neck.', '2005-06-18 21:07:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465819, 190306, 16560, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2005-06-18 21:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465820, 188957, 16560, '<td valign="top">It does not seem to be in focus. The highly centered position of the candle looks out of place in relation to only the top half having any thing.</td>', 'It does not seem to be in focus. The highly centered position of the candle looks out of place in relation to only the top half having any thing.', '2005-06-18 21:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465822, 189170, 16560, '<td valign="top">The difference in color between the light of the flame on the candle and the light on the face is bothering me a bit, and I''m not sure about the position of the light in relation to the face. Maybe a different composition with the light in front of the face (so the flame overlaps the face) might have been stronger?</td>', 'The difference in color between the light of the flame on the candle and the light on the face is bothering me a bit, and I''m not sure about the position of the light in relation to the face. Maybe a different composition with the light in front of the face (so the flame overlaps the face) might have been stronger?', '2005-06-18 21:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465823, 189115, 16560, '<td valign="top">The model is too centered... and the weeds almost overtake the boy in terms of importance in the scene.</td>', 'The model is too centered... and the weeds almost overtake the boy in terms of importance in the scene.', '2005-06-18 21:10:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465824, 189066, 16560, '<td valign="top">I like the color here. The focus on the curtains is nice, but have you considered focusing on the head and causing a sharp silhouette and blurred background? Note sure which would be better, but that was my first thought on seeing the the focus.</td>', 'I like the color here. The focus on the curtains is nice, but have you considered focusing on the head and causing a sharp silhouette and blurred background? Note sure which would be better, but that was my first thought on seeing the the focus.', '2005-06-18 21:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465826, 190129, 16560, '<td valign="top">The composition isn''t particularly strong, with the wallet too centered.</td>', 'The composition isn''t particularly strong, with the wallet too centered.', '2005-06-18 21:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465827, 189776, 16560, '<td valign="top">The leaf looks out of focus and is much too centered. Is that a flash in the dark?</td>', 'The leaf looks out of focus and is much too centered. Is that a flash in the dark?', '2005-06-18 21:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465829, 188549, 16560, '<td valign="top">Looks like intended soft focus. It is clear you wanted the face in shadows, but the contrast between the white of the lower eye and the dark pupil around it look odd. Also the crop is either not tight enough, or too tight, depending on how close or far away you want to be.</td>', 'Looks like intended soft focus. It is clear you wanted the face in shadows, but the contrast between the white of the lower eye and the dark pupil around it look odd. Also the crop is either not tight enough, or too tight, depending on how close or far away you want to be.', '2005-06-18 21:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465832, 189587, 16560, '<td valign="top">I love this.</td>', 'I love this.', '2005-06-18 21:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465834, 189153, 16560, '<td valign="top">Very moody. If only the smoke could be shot without as much blur from the movement.</td>', 'Very moody. If only the smoke could be shot without as much blur from the movement.', '2005-06-18 21:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465836, 190291, 16560, '<td valign="top">Looks like a scene from one of those horror flicks. I suppose you could make this better by summoning in some more fog before you took it.</td>', 'Looks like a scene from one of those horror flicks. I suppose you could make this better by summoning in some more fog before you took it.', '2005-06-18 21:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465838, 187608, 16560, '<td valign="top">I like this... right out of a Hitchcock film.</td>', 'I like this... right out of a Hitchcock film.', '2005-06-18 21:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465840, 188318, 16560, '<td valign="top">The window and dark around it is fine... but maybe a better texturing of the clouds would help push this picture further... but of course you can''t control the look of the clouds.</td>', 'The window and dark around it is fine... but maybe a better texturing of the clouds would help push this picture further... but of course you can''t control the look of the clouds.', '2005-06-18 21:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465841, 189224, 16560, '<td valign="top">Nice moody lighting, but the hair looks a bit fuzzy compared to the chair which is in sharp focus.</td>', 'Nice moody lighting, but the hair looks a bit fuzzy compared to the chair which is in sharp focus.', '2005-06-18 21:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465842, 188884, 16560, '<td valign="top">I can see noise in the picture, perhaps due to high ISO? Maybe remove that with a noise remover...</td>', 'I can see noise in the picture, perhaps due to high ISO? Maybe remove that with a noise remover...', '2005-06-18 21:21:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465843, 187263, 16560, '<td valign="top">Ooooh. The red and green is perfect... and that hint of yellow. The only thing that bothers me is the slight highlights on the hand rails with pulls attention too much due to the high contrast of that and the dark rails.</td>', 'Ooooh. The red and green is perfect... and that hint of yellow. The only thing that bothers me is the slight highlights on the hand rails with pulls attention too much due to the high contrast of that and the dark rails.', '2005-06-18 21:22:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465845, 187464, 16560, '<td valign="top">There is noise in the picture that you might want to consider removing, and it looks almost as if you took this behind a window (slight reflection in the purple). Perhaps the saturation is a bit... hard.</td>', 'There is noise in the picture that you might want to consider removing, and it looks almost as if you took this behind a window (slight reflection in the purple). Perhaps the saturation is a bit... hard.', '2005-06-18 21:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465846, 189521, 24512, '<td valign="top">Great color, I like the title/concept.  flare? on the left lower border could be cropped out</td>', 'Great color, I like the title/concept.  flare? on the left lower border could be cropped out', '2005-06-18 21:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465847, 189350, 16560, '<td valign="top">Perhaps black and white would be more powerful?</td>', 'Perhaps black and white would be more powerful?', '2005-06-18 21:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465849, 187746, 16560, '<td valign="top">I can maybe see a touch of color in the middle there... but... nothing else.</td>', 'I can maybe see a touch of color in the middle there... but... nothing else.', '2005-06-18 21:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465850, 190163, 16560, '<td valign="top">There is too much contrast between the very hard light and lack of focus.</td>', 'There is too much contrast between the very hard light and lack of focus.', '2005-06-18 21:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465852, 190155, 16560, '<td valign="top">I think the contrast between the circular lights versus the more drawn lines of light is too much. Perhaps just only have the lines?</td>', 'I think the contrast between the circular lights versus the more drawn lines of light is too much. Perhaps just only have the lines?', '2005-06-18 21:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465853, 189956, 16560, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2005-06-18 21:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465857, 188709, 16560, '<td valign="top">The light doesn''t seem to help the photo too much, being just there. Perhaps a better position would help. The noise might be a bit much and the frame around the picture is not exactly sized the same on each side.</td>', 'The light doesn''t seem to help the photo too much, being just there. Perhaps a better position would help. The noise might be a bit much and the frame around the picture is not exactly sized the same on each side.', '2005-06-18 21:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465860, 187981, 16560, '<td valign="top">The detail on the eye is wonderful, but I think that black something is a bit distracting especially considering that there is more picture under it. Maybe if the picture just ended with black on the bottom without more light?</td>', 'The detail on the eye is wonderful, but I think that black something is a bit distracting especially considering that there is more picture under it. Maybe if the picture just ended with black on the bottom without more light?', '2005-06-18 21:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465863, 187626, 16560, '<td valign="top">The light itself is distracting from the very evil looking shadow of the face of the statue.</td>', 'The light itself is distracting from the very evil looking shadow of the face of the statue.', '2005-06-18 21:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465865, 187730, 16560, '<td valign="top">Ok.. this is just cool. Note quite darkness I suppose considering it''s.. fire, but very awesome. Maybe you''re a black mage? Anyway, I''d say that the model is not light well enough considering he is in the middle... compared to the very amazing fire.</td>', 'Ok.. this is just cool. Note quite darkness I suppose considering it''s.. fire, but very awesome. Maybe you''re a black mage? Anyway, I''d say that the model is not light well enough considering he is in the middle... compared to the very amazing fire.', '2005-06-18 21:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465867, 189592, 16560, '<td valign="top">I don''t think there is enough stuff in the picture, too much of it is hidden.</td>', 'I don''t think there is enough stuff in the picture, too much of it is hidden.', '2005-06-18 21:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465868, 190182, 16560, '<td valign="top">Haven''t seen the movie but this looks pretty close to what I remember of the trailers. Maybe removing the noise would help.</td>', 'Haven''t seen the movie but this looks pretty close to what I remember of the trailers. Maybe removing the noise would help.', '2005-06-18 21:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465869, 188440, 16560, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.</td>', 'Nice composition.', '2005-06-18 21:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465871, 189757, 16560, '<td valign="top">The title is stretching it a bit. Lovely photo however.</td>', 'The title is stretching it a bit. Lovely photo however.', '2005-06-18 21:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465875, 190237, 16560, '<td valign="top">I thought about doing something like this... The red border is much too strong in comparison to the subject, and the lighting might be a bit too forward... not giving enough shadow. The reflection of the mask''s eyes is too much.</td>', 'I thought about doing something like this... The red border is much too strong in comparison to the subject, and the lighting might be a bit too forward... not giving enough shadow. The reflection of the mask''s eyes is too much.', '2005-06-18 21:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465876, 189732, 16560, '<td valign="top">No idea what is going on here, but it definitely is dark in a horror film idea.</td>', 'No idea what is going on here, but it definitely is dark in a horror film idea.', '2005-06-18 21:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465877, 190290, 16560, '<td valign="top">The ear cuts off too quickly on the edge that attaches to the head.</td>', 'The ear cuts off too quickly on the edge that attaches to the head.', '2005-06-18 21:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465879, 188290, 16560, '<td valign="top">Looks to be too much compression artifacts around the subject. There also seems to be too much cloud cover for stargazing... maybe if there were stars in the picture....</td>', 'Looks to be too much compression artifacts around the subject. There also seems to be too much cloud cover for stargazing... maybe if there were stars in the picture....', '2005-06-18 21:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465882, 189700, 16560, '<td valign="top">The blur of the stars moving is very distracting.</td>', 'The blur of the stars moving is very distracting.', '2005-06-18 21:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465884, 190164, 16560, '<td valign="top">Maybe a black/white or sepia would be stronger.</td>', 'Maybe a black/white or sepia would be stronger.', '2005-06-18 21:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465885, 186987, 16560, '<td valign="top">Too much noise, and out of focus.</td>', 'Too much noise, and out of focus.', '2005-06-18 21:39:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465886, 190300, 16560, '<td valign="top">Cute.</td>', 'Cute.', '2005-06-18 21:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465894, 190219, 16560, '<td valign="top">It looks like you just used desaturation to cause a black/white. I found that in my own entry that it is a horrible way of getting b/w in dimly lit pictures due to low contrast. Try twiddling with the color channels instead. In my case, I isolated only the green channel and set that to b/w and it looked strikingly better. In Photoshop you can do this by using the Channel Mixer and setting green to 100% and the rest to 0% on all color channels.</td>', 'It looks like you just used desaturation to cause a black/white. I found that in my own entry that it is a horrible way of getting b/w in dimly lit pictures due to low contrast. Try twiddling with the color channels instead. In my case, I isolated only the green channel and set that to b/w and it looked strikingly better. In Photoshop you can do this by using the Channel Mixer and setting green to 100% and the rest to 0% on all color channels.', '2005-06-18 21:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465896, 189616, 16560, '<td valign="top">Not quite enough going on. The picture looks to be black and white, yet there is a hint of blue on the flame.</td>', 'Not quite enough going on. The picture looks to be black and white, yet there is a hint of blue on the flame.', '2005-06-18 21:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465897, 187566, 16560, '<td valign="top">What exactly is that green on the side of the head? Maybe a lens flare?</td>', 'What exactly is that green on the side of the head? Maybe a lens flare?', '2005-06-18 21:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465899, 188674, 16560, '<td valign="top">I like the high contrast... except it might be too high because it flattens the image such that the focus (the stone) is washed out and overpowered by everything else around it.</td>', 'I like the high contrast... except it might be too high because it flattens the image such that the focus (the stone) is washed out and overpowered by everything else around it.', '2005-06-18 21:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465900, 188932, 16560, '<td valign="top">You misspelled "darkness" in the title...</td>', 'You misspelled "darkness" in the title...', '2005-06-18 21:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465902, 189734, 16560, '<td valign="top">The extremely high contrast and low color density is just not appealing.</td>', 'The extremely high contrast and low color density is just not appealing.', '2005-06-18 21:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465903, 187475, 16560, '<td valign="top">Very bizarre... but good.</td>', 'Very bizarre... but good.', '2005-06-18 21:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465906, 190125, 16560, '<td valign="top">Perhaps "DEATHS" should be in full focus, rather than part of "OUR" and part of "DEATHS".</td>', 'Perhaps "DEATHS" should be in full focus, rather than part of "OUR" and part of "DEATHS".', '2005-06-18 21:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465908, 188235, 16560, '<td valign="top">Not very appealing. If you are talking about destructive forces... maybe you should have waited for a storm so that the clouds can be forboding and evil to push the image in that direction, rather than relying on the title.</td>', 'Not very appealing. If you are talking about destructive forces... maybe you should have waited for a storm so that the clouds can be forboding and evil to push the image in that direction, rather than relying on the title.', '2005-06-18 21:50:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465909, 190243, 16560, '<td valign="top">Very interesting abstract.</td>', 'Very interesting abstract.', '2005-06-18 21:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465911, 188261, 16560, '<td valign="top">Very nice texturing.</td>', 'Very nice texturing.', '2005-06-18 21:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465912, 190137, 30364, '<td valign="top">That''s well done.  I tried for something a bit similar, with less success.  My spectre was too hard to see; yours is just right, and very convincing.  8</td>', 'That''s well done.  I tried for something a bit similar, with less success.  My spectre was too hard to see; yours is just right, and very convincing.  8', '2005-06-18 21:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465913, 188204, 16560, '<td valign="top">Maybe just a little more light on the pupil so we can see it clearer.</td>', 'Maybe just a little more light on the pupil so we can see it clearer.', '2005-06-18 21:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465915, 190139, 16560, '<td valign="top">Perhaps black and white might be better.</td>', 'Perhaps black and white might be better.', '2005-06-18 21:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465918, 189700, 14476, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot.  I wonder how it would have been if you''d taken a longer time exposure to get more circular action out of those stars.  Not a criticism, just a thought.</td>', 'Lovely shot.  I wonder how it would have been if you''d taken a longer time exposure to get more circular action out of those stars.  Not a criticism, just a thought.', '2005-06-18 21:54:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465920, 189603, 16560, '<td valign="top">Very cute with the costumes and such.</td>', 'Very cute with the costumes and such.', '2005-06-18 21:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465921, 190273, 14476, '<td valign="top">sometimes the simple is the best.  this is an example.</td>', 'sometimes the simple is the best.  this is an example.', '2005-06-18 21:56:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465922, 190253, 30364, '<td valign="top">A very strange, effective image.  Conveys a brooding, malevolent sort of darkness.  A Lord of the Rings sort of scene.  7</td>', 'A very strange, effective image.  Conveys a brooding, malevolent sort of darkness.  A Lord of the Rings sort of scene.  7', '2005-06-18 21:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465925, 188749, 18367, '<td valign="top">I was doing fine till I saw this image.... It evoked such memories.  Yes indeed this does represent darkness to me as I have been there and still feel the pain.  Nineteen years later I still on occasion sit in a silent room and wonder..... what if.<br/> <br/>The tears and heartaches still revisit me on occasion, but luckily I have foregone the search for solace in a bottle.  This image may not be the most technically perfect of submissions, but it is darkness personified....as only one who lost a child could truly appreciate.  Good luck to you</td>', 'I was doing fine till I saw this image.... It evoked such memories.  Yes indeed this does represent darkness to me as I have been there and still feel the pain.  Nineteen years later I still on occasion sit in a silent room and wonder..... what if. The tears and heartaches still revisit me on occasion, but luckily I have foregone the search for solace in a bottle.  This image may not be the most technically perfect of submissions, but it is darkness personified....as only one who lost a child could truly appreciate.  Good luck to you', '2005-06-18 21:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465933, 187608, 30364, '<td valign="top">That''s very good.  Unlike so many of the other good photographs of night scenes, this one has a very clever &amp; effective challenge-related point to it.  You &amp; your TV set have just enough fellow insomniacs to make that point very well.  8</td>', 'That''s very good.  Unlike so many of the other good photographs of night scenes, this one has a very clever & effective challenge-related point to it.  You & your TV set have just enough fellow insomniacs to make that point very well.  8', '2005-06-18 22:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465937, 189351, 10124, '<td valign="top">nice contrast. nice gritty, vintage feel to it. 10</td>', 'nice contrast. nice gritty, vintage feel to it. 10', '2005-06-18 22:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465941, 188839, 30364, '<td valign="top">This composition has a very powerful, artistic feel to it.  While it won''t appeal to  all, the DPC''s best genuine artists like JPR &amp; Goodman &amp; Xion (and others) will probably rate it very highly.  I have more modest artistic credentials, but I agree with what I hope they will say about it!  9</td>', 'This composition has a very powerful, artistic feel to it.  While it won''t appeal to  all, the DPC''s best genuine artists like JPR & Goodman & Xion (and others) will probably rate it very highly.  I have more modest artistic credentials, but I agree with what I hope they will say about it!  9', '2005-06-18 22:14:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465954, 188112, 30364, '<td valign="top">Great expressions!  I''m not crazy about the UV-look lighting, but it does fit this Stephen King sort of scene very well. 7</td>', 'Great expressions!  I''m not crazy about the UV-look lighting, but it does fit this Stephen King sort of scene very well. 7', '2005-06-18 22:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465966, 190165, 37334, '<td valign="top">I just love this image! Great pose, great tones, great balance of light and dark. Just soft enough, just sharp enough.The lack of detail in the eyes is perfect for the challenge.<br/> <br/>You are my green ribbon winner for this challenge - Green ribbon? It''s the one entry that makes me green with envy...that makes me want to throw my camera away and take up knitting instead. So I''m giving you a 3 out of sheer spite...not  really a 10..and a bet that you are a top three winner;)</td>', 'I just love this image! Great pose, great tones, great balance of light and dark. Just soft enough, just sharp enough.The lack of detail in the eyes is perfect for the challenge. You are my green ribbon winner for this challenge - Green ribbon? It''s the one entry that makes me green with envy...that makes me want to throw my camera away and take up knitting instead. So I''m giving you a 3 out of sheer spite...not  really a 10..and a bet that you are a top three winner;)', '2005-06-18 22:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465971, 188204, 37334, '<td valign="top">There a quite a few of these in this challenge - does DPC turn people to the dark side?:)) Yours has to be one of the better ones...I feel quite intimidated by that look! Can''t quite make my mind up as to whether it is sexy or menacing or may be a mixture of both Good lighting 9</td>', 'There a quite a few of these in this challenge - does DPC turn people to the dark side?:)) Yours has to be one of the better ones...I feel quite intimidated by that look! Can''t quite make my mind up as to whether it is sexy or menacing or may be a mixture of both Good lighting 9', '2005-06-18 22:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465979, 189734, 30364, '<td valign="top">Interesting attempt at an alternate view of things.  The world of darkness as visible to a bat, or something like that?  I really prefer something more emotive for this challenge, but yours is a whole lot better &amp; more ambitious than all the many feeble "let''s just take a picture at night-time" efforts.  Well done.  7</td>', 'Interesting attempt at an alternate view of things.  The world of darkness as visible to a bat, or something like that?  I really prefer something more emotive for this challenge, but yours is a whole lot better & more ambitious than all the many feeble "let''s just take a picture at night-time" efforts.  Well done.  7', '2005-06-18 22:49:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465993, 187419, 30364, '<td valign="top">You must by now be fed up with all the "doesn''t meet the challenge" comments, and presumably the associated poor scores.  Especially as it''s a pretty good photograph, and quite interesting from a compositional point of view.  However, whether this light is on or off, the fact is that your image will not be seen as having any meaningful association with "darkness".  Pity, because as I said, it''s not a bad photograph at all.  5<br/>P.S.  Please don''t take this personally.  I''m also getting murdered in the voting, but for the opposite reason; TOO dark!</td>', 'You must by now be fed up with all the "doesn''t meet the challenge" comments, and presumably the associated poor scores.  Especially as it''s a pretty good photograph, and quite interesting from a compositional point of view.  However, whether this light is on or off, the fact is that your image will not be seen as having any meaningful association with "darkness".  Pity, because as I said, it''s not a bad photograph at all.  5P.S.  Please don''t take this personally.  I''m also getting murdered in the voting, but for the opposite reason; TOO dark!', '2005-06-18 22:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465997, 188296, 22734, '<td valign="top">A very strong  composition with that illusive negative dark space and the little tone that is allowed to show does it with deftly detail.</td>', 'A very strong  composition with that illusive negative dark space and the little tone that is allowed to show does it with deftly detail.', '2005-06-18 23:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1465998, 189462, 22734, '<td valign="top">A most wonderful composition because of the dark and light subjects like universal ying-yang of the interplay of light and dark.</td>', 'A most wonderful composition because of the dark and light subjects like universal ying-yang of the interplay of light and dark.', '2005-06-18 23:03:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1466001, 187296, 22734, '<td valign="top">Very well executed with ideal head pose so as to allow the eyes to peer as if from below. Most convincing.</td>', 'Very well executed with ideal head pose so as to allow the eyes to peer as if from below. Most convincing.', '2005-06-18 23:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1466016, 188332, 22734, '<td valign="top">A very well captured image to show this darker side. Bumping up.</td>', 'A very well captured image to show this darker side. Bumping up.', '2005-06-18 23:10:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1466019, 187401, 30364, '<td valign="top">Love this photograph.  Many similar compositions have been done before, but seldom this effectively.  Especially like the receding alternating splashes of light and dark.  I doubt that this entry really illustrates "what darkness means to you", but who cares?  It''s a terrific image.  9</td>', 'Love this photograph.  Many similar compositions have been done before, but seldom this effectively.  Especially like the receding alternating splashes of light and dark.  I doubt that this entry really illustrates "what darkness means to you", but who cares?  It''s a terrific image.  9', '2005-06-18 23:12:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1466021, 188433, 22734, '<td valign="top">Very nice general even feel to accent this classical pose. Very expressive.</td>', 'Very nice general even feel to accent this classical pose. Very expressive.', '2005-06-18 23:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1466023, 190259, 38930, '<td valign="top">What kind of animal is that?  (Awesome Pic!)</td>', 'What kind of animal is that?  (Awesome Pic!)', '2005-06-18 23:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1466025, 189263, 27293, '<td valign="top">z<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-07-11 21:09:42.</i></td>', 'z', '2005-06-18 23:19:15.000000', '2005-07-11 22:09:42.000000', 1),
(1466030, 187294, 22734, '<td valign="top">Very strong. Of course I see the great possibility of having used a light gothic makeup application. However, as is, it offers a great visual with those captivating feautures and their solemn expression. Bumping up.</td>', 'Very strong. Of course I see the great possibility of having used a light gothic makeup application. However, as is, it offers a great visual with those captivating feautures and their solemn expression. Bumping up.', '2005-06-18 23:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1466032, 190218, 38930, '<td valign="top">WOOOOOOW</td>', 'WOOOOOOW', '2005-06-18 23:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1466034, 188316, 30364, '<td valign="top">Terrific image, beautifully executed.  Not especially ambitious, from the challenge topic perspective, but I love the composition and the perfect exposure.  8</td>', 'Terrific image, beautifully executed.  Not especially ambitious, from the challenge topic perspective, but I love the composition and the perfect exposure.  8', '2005-06-18 23:28:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1466037, 189774, 30364, '<td valign="top">Very effective composition; it makes a striking, artistic sort of image.  Looks a bit soft, but that was probably your intention.  7</td>', 'Very effective composition; it makes a striking, artistic sort of image.  Looks a bit soft, but that was probably your intention.  7', '2005-06-18 23:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
