(1466052, 188888, 30364, '<td valign="top">A very fine night-time urban image.  It comfortably satisfies the challenge topic, but that''s almost irrelevant, given its many other qualities.  Conception, perspective, composition and execution are all first class.  The light on the pipes establishes a strange, artery-like, "living building" feel.  It''s a 10 for me.</td>', 'A very fine night-time urban image.  It comfortably satisfies the challenge topic, but that''s almost irrelevant, given its many other qualities.  Conception, perspective, composition and execution are all first class.  The light on the pipes establishes a strange, artery-like, "living building" feel.  It''s a 10 for me.', '2005-06-18 23:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1466053, 188720, 35530, '<td valign="top">That will scare small dogs and children...:-)</td>', 'That will scare small dogs and children...:-)', '2005-06-18 23:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1466054, 188667, 35530, '<td valign="top">Nice timing.</td>', 'Nice timing.', '2005-06-18 23:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
