(1466545, 188242, 19746, '<td valign="top">I recommended this for DQ as it''s too good to be true ;) <br/> <br/>I''m hoping this image is legit, though.  The only problem I have with the shot is that there appear to be fingers on the left hand side (?!).  Did you achieve the dramatic contrasts with curves and selective colour?  I''ll be interested to know what this looked like originally.<br/> <br/>Good luck with this challenge, a dramatic image!  A 9 from me because of the weird black shaped silhouette on the left which detracts from the image.  Good luck!<br/> <br/>Alex</td>', 'I recommended this for DQ as it''s too good to be true ;)  I''m hoping this image is legit, though.  The only problem I have with the shot is that there appear to be fingers on the left hand side (?!).  Did you achieve the dramatic contrasts with curves and selective colour?  I''ll be interested to know what this looked like originally. Good luck with this challenge, a dramatic image!  A 9 from me because of the weird black shaped silhouette on the left which detracts from the image.  Good luck! Alex', '2005-06-19 10:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1466546, 187475, 19746, '<td valign="top">Fantastically creative and well executed, I hope this great idea produces a ribbon for ya :)<br/> <br/>Alex (10)</td>', 'Fantastically creative and well executed, I hope this great idea produces a ribbon for ya :) Alex (10)', '2005-06-19 10:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1466548, 189956, 19746, '<td valign="top">One of my favourite images from this challenge.  You''ve used negative space brilliantly here to convey the ''darkness feeling''.  Within the tunnel the colours are interesting enough to keep the viewer enthralled by the relatively small subject and the blurry character in red in the tunnel is a good finishing touch.  <br/> <br/>10!<br/> <br/></td>', 'One of my favourite images from this challenge.  You''ve used negative space brilliantly here to convey the ''darkness feeling''.  Within the tunnel the colours are interesting enough to keep the viewer enthralled by the relatively small subject and the blurry character in red in the tunnel is a good finishing touch.   10! ', '2005-06-19 10:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1466550, 190247, 19746, '<td valign="top">Very ''headless horseman'' sort of feel to this shot (if that makes any sense at all).  I think this is great, inner framing on a beautiful but dark green forest with some dull foreground clutter leaves.  Possibly a little oversaturated at the back but it''s a very fine line!  I hope this does well, I predict top 10 but what the hell do I know :)<br/> <br/>Alex (9)<br/> <br/>REVISITED:  Perhaps a little bit could have been cropped off the left.  If only you could clone out that bit of greenery on the top right ;)<br/> <br/>Still 9 :)</td>', 'Very ''headless horseman'' sort of feel to this shot (if that makes any sense at all).  I think this is great, inner framing on a beautiful but dark green forest with some dull foreground clutter leaves.  Possibly a little oversaturated at the back but it''s a very fine line!  I hope this does well, I predict top 10 but what the hell do I know :) Alex (9) REVISITED:  Perhaps a little bit could have been cropped off the left.  If only you could clone out that bit of greenery on the top right ;) Still 9 :)', '2005-06-19 10:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
