(1466777, 190164, 36309, '<td valign="top">Definitely a strong image.  I think you could have made it even better by using some tape or something to block the light showing through the gap between the door and door frame, and by making the foot look dirty: as it is it looks too clean.  Given that he looks asleep or passed out the lit cigarette also looks a little out of place.</td>', 'Definitely a strong image.  I think you could have made it even better by using some tape or something to block the light showing through the gap between the door and door frame, and by making the foot look dirty: as it is it looks too clean.  Given that he looks asleep or passed out the lit cigarette also looks a little out of place.', '2005-06-19 13:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
