(1467047, 189376, 38492, '<td valign="top">The concept is obvious, and well executed. The foreground objects on the right and bottom are distracting from it, however. I think you could have cropped these out without losing the interesting items: the shadow of the chair, and the soft reflections in the table. 7</td>', 'The concept is obvious, and well executed. The foreground objects on the right and bottom are distracting from it, however. I think you could have cropped these out without losing the interesting items: the shadow of the chair, and the soft reflections in the table. 7', '2005-06-19 17:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
