(1467052, 188674, 19961, '<td valign="top">I don''t ''get'' this picture, there is no-one left behind in the picture. The execution is rather poor in composition and the B&amp;W conversion seems bad.  On the whole it leaves a rather unattractive impression and does not convey any message or story convincingly.</td>', 'I don''t ''get'' this picture, there is no-one left behind in the picture. The execution is rather poor in composition and the B&W conversion seems bad.  On the whole it leaves a rather unattractive impression and does not convey any message or story convincingly.', '2005-06-19 17:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
