(1467056, 189153, 19961, '<td valign="top">I like the use of back light on the subject. Not quite sure about the left part of the picture, perhaps a little less clutter would have improved it?</td>', 'I like the use of back light on the subject. Not quite sure about the left part of the picture, perhaps a little less clutter would have improved it?', '2005-06-19 17:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
