(1467070, 188596, 38492, '<td valign="top">A slight rotation anticlockwise to make the candle holder vertical would have helped reduce a minor distraction in an otherwise great shot.</td>', 'A slight rotation anticlockwise to make the candle holder vertical would have helped reduce a minor distraction in an otherwise great shot.', '2005-06-19 18:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
