(1467657, 190113, 39484, '<td valign="top">A quirky and ugly photo, but for some reason I keep coming back to it.  The other submissions that used masks really turned me off as cliche and setup.  The angle of this shot, the banal back ground and even the awkward reflection of the lamp on the wall, all add to the photo''s off-beat fun.  Looking forward to your future submissions.</td>', 'A quirky and ugly photo, but for some reason I keep coming back to it.  The other submissions that used masks really turned me off as cliche and setup.  The angle of this shot, the banal back ground and even the awkward reflection of the lamp on the wall, all add to the photo''s off-beat fun.  Looking forward to your future submissions.', '2005-06-19 23:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467663, 190217, 39484, '<td valign="top">Great black.  Nice detail in the texture.  The flash in the cats left eye is unfortunate, but hard to avoid.<br/>Here is how I broke down my score.<br/>Content: 2/4<br/>Composition: 1/2<br/>Color/Light: 2/2<br/>Clarity: 2/2<br/>Total:7/10<br/>Keep up the good work.<br/></td>', 'Great black.  Nice detail in the texture.  The flash in the cats left eye is unfortunate, but hard to avoid.Here is how I broke down my score.Content: 2/4Composition: 1/2Color/Light: 2/2Clarity: 2/2Total:7/10Keep up the good work.', '2005-06-19 23:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467666, 189775, 39484, '<td valign="top">This photo has been growing on me.  It tells a story.  Great emotion on the subjects.  And nice lighting on all three layers of the composition...Boat, water and hillside.  Great job.</td>', 'This photo has been growing on me.  It tells a story.  Great emotion on the subjects.  And nice lighting on all three layers of the composition...Boat, water and hillside.  Great job.', '2005-06-19 23:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467676, 188749, 11800, '<td valign="top">It is well taken. The tonal range is very nice. The props are not overstated and the rain creates a moodiness for the scene. Technically the only thing I''d change is the orientation of the pictures. She wouldn''t be looking at them sideways but want to glance down from time to time to see her lost baby without having to turn the album each time.<br/></td>', 'It is well taken. The tonal range is very nice. The props are not overstated and the rain creates a moodiness for the scene. Technically the only thing I''d change is the orientation of the pictures. She wouldn''t be looking at them sideways but want to glance down from time to time to see her lost baby without having to turn the album each time.', '2005-06-19 23:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467691, 190279, 39484, '<td valign="top">Good quirky content.  I think your title does a disservice to the photo.  A title should  sort of frame the picture with an added bit of intent.  Some suggestions: "Color Suprememe II" or maybe something like VHF/UHF.  I don''t know.  When I see adfgasd, I just see: "Look, I can type fast with my left hand".</td>', 'Good quirky content.  I think your title does a disservice to the photo.  A title should  sort of frame the picture with an added bit of intent.  Some suggestions: "Color Suprememe II" or maybe something like VHF/UHF.  I don''t know.  When I see adfgasd, I just see: "Look, I can type fast with my left hand".', '2005-06-19 23:25:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1467710, 189708, 27789, '<td valign="top">i like a lot in this photo, the smooth water, the texture of the rocks, i really like the title once I looked up aphotic in the dictionary, but the color seems to unnatural, and i would have liked it to be cropped a little more on the bottom.  Just my personal preferences, I''m not saying there''s anything wrong with the photo.</td>', 'i like a lot in this photo, the smooth water, the texture of the rocks, i really like the title once I looked up aphotic in the dictionary, but the color seems to unnatural, and i would have liked it to be cropped a little more on the bottom.  Just my personal preferences, I''m not saying there''s anything wrong with the photo.', '2005-06-19 23:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
