(1469527, 190163, 38663, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed Shot</td>', 'Nicely composed Shot', '2005-06-20 17:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1469530, 190185, 38663, '<td valign="top">Great shot. good timing</td>', 'Great shot. good timing', '2005-06-20 17:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1469531, 190311, 38663, '<td valign="top">Awesome lighting. Stunning work.</td>', 'Awesome lighting. Stunning work.', '2005-06-20 17:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1469533, 188257, 38663, '<td valign="top">Wonderful perspective.</td>', 'Wonderful perspective.', '2005-06-20 17:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1469536, 190231, 36199, '<td valign="top">I think this is a fantastic shot!</td>', 'I think this is a fantastic shot!', '2005-06-20 17:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1469559, 189951, 39567, '<td valign="top">I like this concept for the theme. Would have liked to have seen more of the light moving through particles but that all depends on the setting. Nice shot though, good framing!</td>', 'I like this concept for the theme. Would have liked to have seen more of the light moving through particles but that all depends on the setting. Nice shot though, good framing!', '2005-06-20 17:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1469577, 188596, 5792, '<td valign="top">Looks like writer''s block to me. Looks like a candle I have on my desk. LOL.<br/> <br/>Decently setup image. Content and composition are fine.  The blank page opened is a nice touch. Focus is generally good.<br/> <br/>It is doubtful viewers will have any problem seeing how it meets the challenge topic.<br/> <br/>There are a couple technical issues to consider. Though in color this image really only has one color and because of the nature of this challenge you might want to try B&amp;W to see how that looks. Generally speaking cameras record low light objects with a yellow hue and it doesn''t really look all that good even when it is accurate. :)<br/> <br/>Focus is centered on the candle which might confuse viewers considering this for a "darkness" challenge. That also gives makes the foreground part of the image out of focus. It could be that way to support your image theme,but generally viewer''s do not like out of focus intents in the foreground and vote them lower. You might consider a wider depth of field or centering the focus on the pen to see what that looks like.<br/> <br/>The candle flame is also overexposed which usually does not work but seems to be OK in this image.</td>', 'Looks like writer''s block to me. Looks like a candle I have on my desk. LOL. Decently setup image. Content and composition are fine.  The blank page opened is a nice touch. Focus is generally good. It is doubtful viewers will have any problem seeing how it meets the challenge topic. There are a couple technical issues to consider. Though in color this image really only has one color and because of the nature of this challenge you might want to try B&W to see how that looks. Generally speaking cameras record low light objects with a yellow hue and it doesn''t really look all that good even when it is accurate. :) Focus is centered on the candle which might confuse viewers considering this for a "darkness" challenge. That also gives makes the foreground part of the image out of focus. It could be that way to support your image theme,but generally viewer''s do not like out of focus intents in the foreground and vote them lower. You might consider a wider depth of field or centering the focus on the pen to see what that looks like. The candle flame is also overexposed which usually does not work but seems to be OK in this image.', '2005-06-20 18:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1469580, 188438, 39570, '<td valign="top">Like the motion.</td>', 'Like the motion.', '2005-06-20 18:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1469582, 188074, 5792, '<td valign="top">The lighting angle on the building is the strength of this image. For low lighting conditions the overall clarity and quality of this image is very good.<br/> <br/>Don''t know if the greenish lighting color is the result of actual conditions or the effect of post processing but it does not matter. It is effective adds a lot of viewer interest to the image. Even the porch in complete shadow, which normally would be an error, seems to work with this image to give it a surrealist quality that is appealing.</td>', 'The lighting angle on the building is the strength of this image. For low lighting conditions the overall clarity and quality of this image is very good. Don''t know if the greenish lighting color is the result of actual conditions or the effect of post processing but it does not matter. It is effective adds a lot of viewer interest to the image. Even the porch in complete shadow, which normally would be an error, seems to work with this image to give it a surrealist quality that is appealing.', '2005-06-20 18:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1469585, 189779, 39570, '<td valign="top">A bit like being blinded by a spotlight.</td>', 'A bit like being blinded by a spotlight.', '2005-06-20 18:09:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1469587, 189018, 5792, '<td valign="top">One of the most creative thoughts for this challenge. The image quality is excellent and the use of lighting to highlight what you are trying to imply works very, very well. You have the man brightly lighted yet you can  still see very fine detail in the dark areas of the refrigerator.<br/> <br/>Very nice job!</td>', 'One of the most creative thoughts for this challenge. The image quality is excellent and the use of lighting to highlight what you are trying to imply works very, very well. You have the man brightly lighted yet you can  still see very fine detail in the dark areas of the refrigerator. Very nice job!', '2005-06-20 18:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1469644, 189172, 34134, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea with the people packing up and going home. However, the noise in the sky is very distracting.</td>', 'Interesting idea with the people packing up and going home. However, the noise in the sky is very distracting.', '2005-06-20 18:41:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1469678, 188800, 7994, '<td valign="top">i love the composition, b/w  10</td>', 'i love the composition, b/w  10', '2005-06-20 18:58:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1469680, 188168, 7994, '<td valign="top">aahh yes, her eyes are the mirror of her soul...  10</td>', 'aahh yes, her eyes are the mirror of her soul...  10', '2005-06-20 18:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1469709, 189599, 20941, '<td valign="top">a perfect 10</td>', 'a perfect 10', '2005-06-20 19:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1469791, 190083, 34134, '<td valign="top">Focus is too soft.</td>', 'Focus is too soft.', '2005-06-20 19:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1469800, 190292, 33732, '<td valign="top">Not so dark.</td>', 'Not so dark.', '2005-06-20 19:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1469816, 187064, 34134, '<td valign="top">Focus is way too soft to enjoy this picture.</td>', 'Focus is way too soft to enjoy this picture.', '2005-06-20 19:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1469891, 189197, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nice that you filled the whole frame with your flower macro (pansy is it?). Decent detail in the small detail at the center.<br/> <br/>Obviously you will be beat up over submitting a flower to a darkness challenge but you are already know that so should not be surprised.<br/> <br/>On the technical side tere are a cople suggestions for improvement. Shallow depth of field (DOF) is always a problem with macro images. The ant is not in very good focus. That is either because the DOF is too shallow or the ant was movign a little during the exposure. It is difficult to tell which it might be but might be a slow shutterspeed. You might have considered another shot without the ant in it.<br/> <br/>For a macro the focus is still soft. They are always best with razor sharp focus. The color and/or contrast in this image is weak. Both should be beefed up to give the image more visual impact. There is great detail in the leaves  that is crying to be brought out.</td>', 'Nice that you filled the whole frame with your flower macro (pansy is it?). Decent detail in the small detail at the center. Obviously you will be beat up over submitting a flower to a darkness challenge but you are already know that so should not be surprised. On the technical side tere are a cople suggestions for improvement. Shallow depth of field (DOF) is always a problem with macro images. The ant is not in very good focus. That is either because the DOF is too shallow or the ant was movign a little during the exposure. It is difficult to tell which it might be but might be a slow shutterspeed. You might have considered another shot without the ant in it. For a macro the focus is still soft. They are always best with razor sharp focus. The color and/or contrast in this image is weak. Both should be beefed up to give the image more visual impact. There is great detail in the leaves  that is crying to be brought out.', '2005-06-20 20:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1469904, 190271, 5792, '<td valign="top">Almost a surrealistic landscape  that makes the viewer perk up and take notice. Great tonal range and the composition is made stronger with the placement of the small tree on the left in the foreground. For a lot of fine detail the clarity is pretty good.<br/> <br/>The lighting  and tree are wonderful but not quite enough to carry the whole composition. The image needs some balencing agent on the right like a giant billowing cloud in the background, a horse or other farm animal in the foreground or an impatient partner looking at their watch and asking, "Honey, aren''t you done yet?" LOL<br/> <br/>The bright white sign near the center of the image is a distraction in this otherwise fine picture.</td>', 'Almost a surrealistic landscape  that makes the viewer perk up and take notice. Great tonal range and the composition is made stronger with the placement of the small tree on the left in the foreground. For a lot of fine detail the clarity is pretty good. The lighting  and tree are wonderful but not quite enough to carry the whole composition. The image needs some balencing agent on the right like a giant billowing cloud in the background, a horse or other farm animal in the foreground or an impatient partner looking at their watch and asking, "Honey, aren''t you done yet?" LOL The bright white sign near the center of the image is a distraction in this otherwise fine picture.', '2005-06-20 20:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1469914, 189691, 5792, '<td valign="top">Bet you had fun with this one. :)<br/> <br/>Nice fire capture and a horrifying (perhaps you? LOL) devil. Lighting and color work well. The positioning of the head and the way you framed this makes for a nice composition.<br/> <br/>The fingers look a little funky but overall this is a good picture. Now, to get someone "lighted", do you have to be physically present and do you take VISA?</td>', 'Bet you had fun with this one. :) Nice fire capture and a horrifying (perhaps you? LOL) devil. Lighting and color work well. The positioning of the head and the way you framed this makes for a nice composition. The fingers look a little funky but overall this is a good picture. Now, to get someone "lighted", do you have to be physically present and do you take VISA?', '2005-06-20 20:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1469925, 187746, 5792, '<td valign="top">A very difficult low contrast to pull off but you have done it spectacularly well. The detail is great without much electronic noise. The pose and composition are good. Nice facial expression capture.<br/> <br/>The only problem you will have with scoring is that some folks will not have their monitors properly calibrated and won''t be able to see this fine image well enough to give it a high score.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-06-22 02:23:56.</i></td>', 'A very difficult low contrast to pull off but you have done it spectacularly well. The detail is great without much electronic noise. The pose and composition are good. Nice facial expression capture. The only problem you will have with scoring is that some folks will not have their monitors properly calibrated and won''t be able to see this fine image well enough to give it a high score.', '2005-06-20 20:46:08.000000', '2005-06-22 03:23:56.000000', 1),
(1469930, 188296, 5792, '<td valign="top">Very good interpretation of the challenge topic. Nice expression even though facing away. The overexposed openning to the outside world works perfect in this situation. The hint of detail beyond the guy''s ear without really showing it is a nice touch. Good solid black background. This should score reasonable high.</td>', 'Very good interpretation of the challenge topic. Nice expression even though facing away. The overexposed openning to the outside world works perfect in this situation. The hint of detail beyond the guy''s ear without really showing it is a nice touch. Good solid black background. This should score reasonable high.', '2005-06-20 20:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1469932, 189409, 34412, '<td valign="top">Too much noise! Details not enough. Could have been a very good. I gave a 5.</td>', 'Too much noise! Details not enough. Could have been a very good. I gave a 5.', '2005-06-20 20:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1469935, 190252, 34412, '<td valign="top">Nice. Gave a 6.</td>', 'Nice. Gave a 6.', '2005-06-20 20:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1469939, 186975, 5792, '<td valign="top">Backlighting the bottle is a great idea and you have a solid black point for the background. It has no more than a tiny amount of electronic noise.<br/> <br/>There are a couple things that will hold back a high score for this image.<br/> <br/>The general image technical quality is not that high. For the size of the frame the main subject is not very big. You may want to consider taking this in portrait mode.<br/> <br/>The small lighted red background is more distracting in the image than supportive.<br/> <br/>The border of this image is very, very distracting. You are probably trying to emphasize the idea of darkness through its contrast with the solid white border but that will not work for most viewers.</td>', 'Backlighting the bottle is a great idea and you have a solid black point for the background. It has no more than a tiny amount of electronic noise. There are a couple things that will hold back a high score for this image. The general image technical quality is not that high. For the size of the frame the main subject is not very big. You may want to consider taking this in portrait mode. The small lighted red background is more distracting in the image than supportive. The border of this image is very, very distracting. You are probably trying to emphasize the idea of darkness through its contrast with the solid white border but that will not work for most viewers.', '2005-06-20 20:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1469944, 189587, 34412, '<td valign="top">Very good use of light. Simplistic. I gave a 6.</td>', 'Very good use of light. Simplistic. I gave a 6.', '2005-06-20 20:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1469946, 189757, 34412, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Very good use of light and "Darkness." I gave a 7, even though I dont play chess! Good luck.</td>', 'Beautiful. Very good use of light and "Darkness." I gave a 7, even though I dont play chess! Good luck.', '2005-06-20 20:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1469952, 189355, 5792, '<td valign="top">This is a nice tranquil sunset. It makes the viewer relax. You have not oerexposed the moon which is very easy to do in these images because it is so many f/stops brighter than its surroundings.The technical quality of this image is fine.<br/> <br/>This is fine as it is but would have extra punch with sunlight on the wispy clouds above the lighthouse and/or a pleasure boat coming into the harbor.</td>', 'This is a nice tranquil sunset. It makes the viewer relax. You have not oerexposed the moon which is very easy to do in these images because it is so many f/stops brighter than its surroundings.The technical quality of this image is fine. This is fine as it is but would have extra punch with sunlight on the wispy clouds above the lighthouse and/or a pleasure boat coming into the harbor.', '2005-06-20 20:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1469967, 190231, 5792, '<td valign="top">An excellent lightning bolt capture. The clarity is outstanding. You can take pictures all night and not get one that nice. The bolt itself provides wonderful lighting for the scene.<br/> <br/>Just a couple of small items. The bird feeder or whatever that is competes with the bolt for attention and is a little distracting in the image. It appears to have a little electronic noise you may want to remove if you make a print of this shot.<br/> <br/>It could be that the pole supporting the object is just a little crooked itself but you might want to check your horizon and rotate it ever so slightly counterclockwise if that is needed.<br/> <br/>Congratulations on a great capture!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-06-22 02:17:01.</i></td>', 'An excellent lightning bolt capture. The clarity is outstanding. You can take pictures all night and not get one that nice. The bolt itself provides wonderful lighting for the scene. Just a couple of small items. The bird feeder or whatever that is competes with the bolt for attention and is a little distracting in the image. It appears to have a little electronic noise you may want to remove if you make a print of this shot. It could be that the pole supporting the object is just a little crooked itself but you might want to check your horizon and rotate it ever so slightly counterclockwise if that is needed. Congratulations on a great capture!', '2005-06-20 21:06:40.000000', '2005-06-22 03:17:01.000000', 1),
(1469982, 190165, 5792, '<td valign="top">A very haunting image. Making the eyes black holes is a stroke of genius. The tonal range is good and technical quality and composition itself of the image fine.<br/> <br/>The are some minor technical issues that will affect this image''s score.<br/> <br/>There are a number of tiny white specks that are distracting to the viewer.<br/> <br/>The fingers closest to the camera are out of focus and orovide a minor distraction as well. That may have been intentional but will not appear that way to viewers.<br/> <br/>Lastly, the transition areas from dark to shadow on the left side of the image looks unnatural. But that is probably a necessary artifact of your post processing.<br/> <br/>Overall this is a very fine image that should score in the upper tier of the challenge.</td>', 'A very haunting image. Making the eyes black holes is a stroke of genius. The tonal range is good and technical quality and composition itself of the image fine. The are some minor technical issues that will affect this image''s score. There are a number of tiny white specks that are distracting to the viewer. The fingers closest to the camera are out of focus and orovide a minor distraction as well. That may have been intentional but will not appear that way to viewers. Lastly, the transition areas from dark to shadow on the left side of the image looks unnatural. But that is probably a necessary artifact of your post processing. Overall this is a very fine image that should score in the upper tier of the challenge.', '2005-06-20 21:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1470011, 190164, 35602, '<td valign="top">Very powerful photo..  Since it appears you had to use a slow shutter, the image is a little blurred.  Even with a tripod it would have been hard for sharp focus.  I had the same problem.  I guess the only way is to get a better camera, though I''m not ready to invest just now.</td>', 'Very powerful photo..  Since it appears you had to use a slow shutter, the image is a little blurred.  Even with a tripod it would have been hard for sharp focus.  I had the same problem.  I guess the only way is to get a better camera, though I''m not ready to invest just now.', '2005-06-20 21:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1470016, 189773, 35602, '<td valign="top">Just too blurry.</td>', 'Just too blurry.', '2005-06-20 21:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1470021, 190030, 35602, '<td valign="top">Way too dark and lacking in detail.  Increase the brightness in your editing program and I think it would have been better.</td>', 'Way too dark and lacking in detail.  Increase the brightness in your editing program and I think it would have been better.', '2005-06-20 21:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1470025, 188235, 35602, '<td valign="top">I don''t agree, but to each his own.  I thought the picture needed more subject or perhaps it could have been cropped a bit more.</td>', 'I don''t agree, but to each his own.  I thought the picture needed more subject or perhaps it could have been cropped a bit more.', '2005-06-20 21:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1470027, 189700, 35602, '<td valign="top">Really nice image.  The stars just add such a beauty to the picture.  Thainls for sharing it with us.</td>', 'Really nice image.  The stars just add such a beauty to the picture.  Thainls for sharing it with us.', '2005-06-20 21:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1470034, 189433, 35602, '<td valign="top">A little overexposed.  The size of the file could have been bigger to see a better representation of the picture.</td>', 'A little overexposed.  The size of the file could have been bigger to see a better representation of the picture.', '2005-06-20 21:50:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1470071, 188290, 5792, '<td valign="top">Good way to convey a pleasant dark activity. The image is great as long as viewers don''t notice the sky is overcast. LOL The perspective is good and the blue tones in the sky touch off the composition nicely. The silhouette works well to.<br/> <br/>On the technical side there is a lot of noise in the sky and you should consider applying some noise reduction to get rid of it.You have no control over the white specks in the sky but they are still distractions just the same that will affect your score.<br/> <br/>Outside the noise this image should do well in scoring.</td>', 'Good way to convey a pleasant dark activity. The image is great as long as viewers don''t notice the sky is overcast. LOL The perspective is good and the blue tones in the sky touch off the composition nicely. The silhouette works well to. On the technical side there is a lot of noise in the sky and you should consider applying some noise reduction to get rid of it.You have no control over the white specks in the sky but they are still distractions just the same that will affect your score. Outside the noise this image should do well in scoring.', '2005-06-20 22:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1470082, 189352, 5792, '<td valign="top">Hmmmmmmmmmmmm...<br/> <br/>Perhaps it is the snapshot-like perspective... perhaps it is the large amount of noise in it... perhaps it is the weak tonal quality and/or overexposed surface on the right... perhaps it is the concept itself... but if you combine all of that it is hard to imagine reviewer''s giving this image a very good score. Sorry. If it means anything to you, I gave it a 10.</td>', 'Hmmmmmmmmmmmm... Perhaps it is the snapshot-like perspective... perhaps it is the large amount of noise in it... perhaps it is the weak tonal quality and/or overexposed surface on the right... perhaps it is the concept itself... but if you combine all of that it is hard to imagine reviewer''s giving this image a very good score. Sorry. If it means anything to you, I gave it a 10.', '2005-06-20 22:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
