(1470280, 189356, 5792, '<td valign="top">A kid playing with a firefly brings back memories of early childhood visits to Kansas. A good darkness activity. Composition, color and exposure are fine in this image. Good solid black background.<br/> <br/>Items that will hold back its score are that the focus is very soft and the firefly looks artificial. It might be better if the child''s eyes could be seen. Many viewer''s might not make the connection between firefly and darkness.</td>', 'A kid playing with a firefly brings back memories of early childhood visits to Kansas. A good darkness activity. Composition, color and exposure are fine in this image. Good solid black background. Items that will hold back its score are that the focus is very soft and the firefly looks artificial. It might be better if the child''s eyes could be seen. Many viewer''s might not make the connection between firefly and darkness.', '2005-06-20 23:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
