(1470574, 187982, 5792, '<td valign="top">Good tones mid-tones and a quality B&amp;W. Natural framing appears fine. Shallow depth of field (DOF) still shows christian church detail in background.<br/> <br/>It is not immediately apparent what this abstract is about. Therefore many viewers will not relate to it and will vote it lower as a result.<br/> <br/>It is hard to tell but there appears to be an overexposed area to the left of the church. Viewers would like more clues about what this image means.<br/> <br/>From a pure photographic standpoint it might be better if the focus on the cement structure in the foreground were absolutely razor sharp. The focus here seems a little soft.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Good tones mid-tones and a quality B&W. Natural framing appears fine. Shallow depth of field (DOF) still shows christian church detail in background. It is not immediately apparent what this abstract is about. Therefore many viewers will not relate to it and will vote it lower as a result. It is hard to tell but there appears to be an overexposed area to the left of the church. Viewers would like more clues about what this image means. From a pure photographic standpoint it might be better if the focus on the cement structure in the foreground were absolutely razor sharp. The focus here seems a little soft. ', '2005-06-21 04:47:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1470575, 188626, 24486, '<td valign="top">Now there''s a scary thought. Just the right amount of light.</td>', 'Now there''s a scary thought. Just the right amount of light.', '2005-06-21 04:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1470578, 188020, 24486, '<td valign="top">Good concept. The glasses &amp; their contents seem a bit out of focus. I have tryed this lighting effect of a candle through a glass of wine &amp; i can appreciate the difficulty involved.</td>', 'Good concept. The glasses & their contents seem a bit out of focus. I have tryed this lighting effect of a candle through a glass of wine & i can appreciate the difficulty involved.', '2005-06-21 04:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1470579, 190255, 37632, '<td valign="top">Fantastic photo and I think it meets the "darkness" criteria as well as most photos, despite that there is lot''s of light in the photo.</td>', 'Fantastic photo and I think it meets the "darkness" criteria as well as most photos, despite that there is lot''s of light in the photo.', '2005-06-21 04:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1470580, 190214, 5792, '<td valign="top">Curious photograph.Apears focused for the stars at the infinity position. What is surprising is that you could capture anything at all. The stars are best focused but it seems like you would have to have the shutter open so long that the waves would be completely blurred out.<br/> <br/>The idea for this image seems solid but it will score poorly primarily because of poor focus of the foreground elements of ocean and sand. It almost looks hand held. If this is the case then using a tripod would be recommended. You will need  a longer exposure time and a narrower aperature in order to get everything clear in this image. That will likely result in the ocean being blurry because of wave action motion during the time the shutter is open, but that might turn out to be a neat effect.</td>', 'Curious photograph.Apears focused for the stars at the infinity position. What is surprising is that you could capture anything at all. The stars are best focused but it seems like you would have to have the shutter open so long that the waves would be completely blurred out. The idea for this image seems solid but it will score poorly primarily because of poor focus of the foreground elements of ocean and sand. It almost looks hand held. If this is the case then using a tripod would be recommended. You will need  a longer exposure time and a narrower aperature in order to get everything clear in this image. That will likely result in the ocean being blurry because of wave action motion during the time the shutter is open, but that might turn out to be a neat effect.', '2005-06-21 04:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1470583, 189331, 5792, '<td valign="top">There are a lot of images like this in this particular challenge. Yours has good clarity and fine detail without unwanted electronic noise caused by low light levels. Content and perspective is good. Clarity is exceptionally good.<br/> <br/>There are so many similar images to this it will be hurt in voting because it will not be thought to be particularly creative or different from the rest.<br/> <br/>On the technical side you might consider applying color/contrast processing to better bring out the wonderful colors of your ''subject'' to give it more visual impact.</td>', 'There are a lot of images like this in this particular challenge. Yours has good clarity and fine detail without unwanted electronic noise caused by low light levels. Content and perspective is good. Clarity is exceptionally good. There are so many similar images to this it will be hurt in voting because it will not be thought to be particularly creative or different from the rest. On the technical side you might consider applying color/contrast processing to better bring out the wonderful colors of your ''subject'' to give it more visual impact.', '2005-06-21 05:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1470586, 189955, 25735, '<td valign="top">good idia.well done. this is my openion.</td>', 'good idia.well done. this is my openion.', '2005-06-21 05:06:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1470587, 188591, 37632, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, well framed, but not really "darkness".  Maybe a closeup of the statue (perhaps taken from close to the ground and looking up) would have come out better.  Just a thought.</td>', 'Nice photo, well framed, but not really "darkness".  Maybe a closeup of the statue (perhaps taken from close to the ground and looking up) would have come out better.  Just a thought.', '2005-06-21 05:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1470588, 189007, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nice evening cityscape that conveys a concept of darkness well. Good clarity, composition and the horizon is level.<br/> <br/>The image is slightly low contrast and you can give it a little more visual appeal by setting a true black point or by using selective color to make blacks just a little balcker. It will loose some detail but will have better contrast as a payoff.<br/> <br/>You might consider color processing to bring out brighter and more eye catching color in the sky at the top of the frame.<br/> <br/>Overall this is a nice image.</td>', 'Nice evening cityscape that conveys a concept of darkness well. Good clarity, composition and the horizon is level. The image is slightly low contrast and you can give it a little more visual appeal by setting a true black point or by using selective color to make blacks just a little balcker. It will loose some detail but will have better contrast as a payoff. You might consider color processing to bring out brighter and more eye catching color in the sky at the top of the frame. Overall this is a nice image.', '2005-06-21 05:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1470589, 190164, 25735, '<td valign="top">did you mean darkness life</td>', 'did you mean darkness life', '2005-06-21 05:09:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1470592, 189030, 25735, '<td valign="top">i do not think the meanning of this photo related to the challenge.</td>', 'i do not think the meanning of this photo related to the challenge.', '2005-06-21 05:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1470594, 187263, 24486, '<td valign="top">just love that perspective</td>', 'just love that perspective', '2005-06-21 05:13:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1470597, 189184, 5792, '<td valign="top">Interesting and creative idea for this challenge. Color is OK and clarity of the open eyes is good. Generally decent photo quality.<br/> <br/>You will be rewarded by viewers for a creative idea but to what degree is to be seen.<br/> <br/>On the technical side there is a bright patch of light on the upper right side that will act as a distraction to the average viewer. It probably should be removed. Viewers will be curious to know what the jagged edge around the eyes is and why it was set up that way but the image itself does not provide an answer. <br/> <br/>You might score higher if the eyes occupied a physically larger area of the frame.</td>', 'Interesting and creative idea for this challenge. Color is OK and clarity of the open eyes is good. Generally decent photo quality. You will be rewarded by viewers for a creative idea but to what degree is to be seen. On the technical side there is a bright patch of light on the upper right side that will act as a distraction to the average viewer. It probably should be removed. Viewers will be curious to know what the jagged edge around the eyes is and why it was set up that way but the image itself does not provide an answer.  You might score higher if the eyes occupied a physically larger area of the frame.', '2005-06-21 05:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1470599, 190232, 25735, '<td valign="top">what do you mean with this photo. i do not think the photo related to the subject of this challenge. great photo though. well done.</td>', 'what do you mean with this photo. i do not think the photo related to the subject of this challenge. great photo though. well done.', '2005-06-21 05:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
