(1470647, 189732, 22459, '<td valign="top">Different...... you have captured some excellent lighting and this has really lifted the black and white tones, not sure if the bucket has any significance but I feel it  distracts and has become to central also not sure what the wrist/arm band is all about but I suppose it adds to the intrigue.<br/>I have given it a seven and will be most interested in seeing how the average DPC voter see''s it. good luck.</td>', 'Different...... you have captured some excellent lighting and this has really lifted the black and white tones, not sure if the bucket has any significance but I feel it  distracts and has become to central also not sure what the wrist/arm band is all about but I suppose it adds to the intrigue.I have given it a seven and will be most interested in seeing how the average DPC voter see''s it. good luck.', '2005-06-21 06:49:55.000000', NULL, 1),
