(1471128, 189372, 12051, '<td valign="top">I like your lighting, color and focus. It does have the feel of an impending storm.</td>', 'I like your lighting, color and focus. It does have the feel of an impending storm.', '2005-06-21 12:28:02.000000', NULL, 1),
