(1471131, 189331, 12051, '<td valign="top">Dark and scary.</td>', 'Dark and scary.', '2005-06-21 12:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1471132, 187889, 5792, '<td valign="top">Focus is OK and it meets the challenge topic.<br/> <br/>Photographically there are some improvments that could be made. The contrast is a little on the low side and should be upped a little to give the image more ''pop''.<br/> <br/>There are a number of compositional items that alone do not mean much but combined make this more of an average photograph. You can do better with this.<br/> <br/>The wiring visible to the left at the bottom of the frame is a major distraction. The nearer leaves, though not badly out of focus, are major elements that also detract from the image and draw the viewer''s attention away.<br/> <br/>The main subject is centered and completely within the frame. You are probably saying to yourself that is the way you intended it. But you can remove unwanted distracting elements and add considerable viewer interest to your main subject by judicious framing.<br/> <br/>For example, if you cropped from just to the left of the skull but below the chin to just above and all the way to the right in the current framing to just above the skull enough to show part of the feathers then the image would be better. You would crop out almost all the distracting items mentioned, make the skull much larger in the frame and offset it from center frame to give it more eye appeal. You will still have part of the out of focus plant included in the composition but it will act as framing rather than be a major element in the composition.  Try it, you might like it. :)</td>', 'Focus is OK and it meets the challenge topic. Photographically there are some improvments that could be made. The contrast is a little on the low side and should be upped a little to give the image more ''pop''. There are a number of compositional items that alone do not mean much but combined make this more of an average photograph. You can do better with this. The wiring visible to the left at the bottom of the frame is a major distraction. The nearer leaves, though not badly out of focus, are major elements that also detract from the image and draw the viewer''s attention away. The main subject is centered and completely within the frame. You are probably saying to yourself that is the way you intended it. But you can remove unwanted distracting elements and add considerable viewer interest to your main subject by judicious framing. For example, if you cropped from just to the left of the skull but below the chin to just above and all the way to the right in the current framing to just above the skull enough to show part of the feathers then the image would be better. You would crop out almost all the distracting items mentioned, make the skull much larger in the frame and offset it from center frame to give it more eye appeal. You will still have part of the out of focus plant included in the composition but it will act as framing rather than be a major element in the composition.  Try it, you might like it. :)', '2005-06-21 12:29:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1471134, 189946, 12051, '<td valign="top">Those do look like eyes in the clouds. Interesting.</td>', 'Those do look like eyes in the clouds. Interesting.', '2005-06-21 12:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1471138, 190230, 12051, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for the frame, but ignoring that, the angle and color of light are excellent. The clouds also assist the effect. Seems like a familiar skyline?</td>', 'I don''t care for the frame, but ignoring that, the angle and color of light are excellent. The clouds also assist the effect. Seems like a familiar skyline?', '2005-06-21 12:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1471142, 190231, 2223, '<td valign="top">One of the best lightning strikes I ever seen! great capture!</td>', 'One of the best lightning strikes I ever seen! great capture!', '2005-06-21 12:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1471146, 189350, 5792, '<td valign="top">This supports the darkness theme in at least two easily discenable ways. The composition and leading lines are fine. Repetative items well positioned in the frame are always nice. Framing is good from this perpective.<br/> <br/>The overall quality of the photograph is average and the final score will reflect that. It is partly because the image was captured using flash photography.<br/> <br/>This is a wonderful composition but seems to lack something. Perhaps if you captured the image from something other than a ''snapshot'' perspective it would be better. You might try taking the picture from ground level to emphasize the lines of the composition even more and that perspective is in keeping with being in a jail. A gun laying angled on the floor would also add CONSIDERABLE impact to the image.<br/> <br/>This picture has a lot of good photographic qualities as it is but could be improvd for move viewer interest and a higher score.</td>', 'This supports the darkness theme in at least two easily discenable ways. The composition and leading lines are fine. Repetative items well positioned in the frame are always nice. Framing is good from this perpective. The overall quality of the photograph is average and the final score will reflect that. It is partly because the image was captured using flash photography. This is a wonderful composition but seems to lack something. Perhaps if you captured the image from something other than a ''snapshot'' perspective it would be better. You might try taking the picture from ground level to emphasize the lines of the composition even more and that perspective is in keeping with being in a jail. A gun laying angled on the floor would also add CONSIDERABLE impact to the image. This picture has a lot of good photographic qualities as it is but could be improvd for move viewer interest and a higher score.', '2005-06-21 12:40:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1471147, 188648, 12051, '<td valign="top">Nice lightning photo. Even the vehicle lights are OK. I just don''t care for the electrical wires.</td>', 'Nice lightning photo. Even the vehicle lights are OK. I just don''t care for the electrical wires.', '2005-06-21 12:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
