(1471338, 189776, 39598, '<td valign="top">Nice picture. Would change the composition if it was me though.<br/>Like put the leaf more to the left or right, depending on whatever else then comes into view</td>', 'Nice picture. Would change the composition if it was me though.Like put the leaf more to the left or right, depending on whatever else then comes into view', '2005-06-21 14:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1471342, 188233, 39598, '<td valign="top">Love where you''re going with this.<br/>Just seems meaningless in terms of composition.<br/>Maybe a close up of the face, with the shell reduced to an eye-pleasing bokeh.<br/>Or vice-versa.</td>', 'Love where you''re going with this.Just seems meaningless in terms of composition.Maybe a close up of the face, with the shell reduced to an eye-pleasing bokeh.Or vice-versa.', '2005-06-21 14:40:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1471345, 187594, 25678, '<td valign="top">I like the capture of this picture.  If this is a stage shot, however, I''d recommend tweaking the color balance to offset the redness of the stage lights.</td>', 'I like the capture of this picture.  If this is a stage shot, however, I''d recommend tweaking the color balance to offset the redness of the stage lights.', '2005-06-21 14:42:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1471347, 186975, 39598, '<td valign="top">Nice try.<br/>Keep at it.<br/>Play with the composition.<br/>Your red and blue would work better showing through the bottle (distortion and refraction would add some more depth to the photo), plus - don''t forget to move your subject according to the rule of thirds.<br/>It''s a rule for a reason.</td>', 'Nice try.Keep at it.Play with the composition.Your red and blue would work better showing through the bottle (distortion and refraction would add some more depth to the photo), plus - don''t forget to move your subject according to the rule of thirds.It''s a rule for a reason.', '2005-06-21 14:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1471348, 189549, 39598, '<td valign="top">ceiling lamp.<br/>I like it.</td>', 'ceiling lamp.I like it.', '2005-06-21 14:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
