(1471468, 190212, 39598, '<td valign="top">Nice.<br/>I''m a musical photographer myself.<br/>I like the lighting you''ve brought into the picture.<br/>Maybe just put the singer to the left of the picture (with the neck of the guitar following the row of lights)<br/>Or put him in centre (extreme close up) with only one blue light shining down behind.<br/>Keep up the great work!<br/>(Doesn''t it annoy you when amateur hacks walk up and flash the place silly?)</td>', 'Nice.I''m a musical photographer myself.I like the lighting you''ve brought into the picture.Maybe just put the singer to the left of the picture (with the neck of the guitar following the row of lights)Or put him in centre (extreme close up) with only one blue light shining down behind.Keep up the great work!(Doesn''t it annoy you when amateur hacks walk up and flash the place silly?)', '2005-06-21 15:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
