(1472157, 188468, 37719, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting image.  I would be interested in how you composed/created it.  However, I did not vote on it.  I tried to see your ''darkness'' in this image, but nothing has come to mind.  No idea, concept, expression, emotion, fear...I didn''t think it fair to ding you for my inability to see your concept.  Good luck!</td>', 'This is an interesting image.  I would be interested in how you composed/created it.  However, I did not vote on it.  I tried to see your ''darkness'' in this image, but nothing has come to mind.  No idea, concept, expression, emotion, fear...I didn''t think it fair to ding you for my inability to see your concept.  Good luck!', '2005-06-21 22:40:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1472159, 190311, 39349, '<td valign="top">Out of all the pictures on the first page of entries, this is the one I viewed first. I guess your first instincts are the best because this picture is just amazing to me. Bravo!</td>', 'Out of all the pictures on the first page of entries, this is the one I viewed first. I guess your first instincts are the best because this picture is just amazing to me. Bravo!', '2005-06-21 22:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1472160, 190162, 37719, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting photo and I have come back to it a few times now.  I really tried to put together the image, the title, what your concept of darkness is, and I could not come up with a relationship between a dark picture of make-up and darkness other than the picture is dark.  I am sure I am missing something, some relationship.  I passed on voting on this pic since I don''t think it fair to knock your score just because I am unable to see your concept.  Good luck!</td>', 'This is an interesting photo and I have come back to it a few times now.  I really tried to put together the image, the title, what your concept of darkness is, and I could not come up with a relationship between a dark picture of make-up and darkness other than the picture is dark.  I am sure I am missing something, some relationship.  I passed on voting on this pic since I don''t think it fair to knock your score just because I am unable to see your concept.  Good luck!', '2005-06-21 22:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1472161, 190241, 37719, '<td valign="top">There are a lot of photos I am not voting on, this is one of them.  I am not sure if you wanted to show an emotion or fear or what with this photo as it relates to ''darkness'' other than the picture is shot dark.  I didn''t think it fair to knock your score because I couldn''t see your concept.  It is a good picture, I just can''t relate it to the challenge.  Good luck!</td>', 'There are a lot of photos I am not voting on, this is one of them.  I am not sure if you wanted to show an emotion or fear or what with this photo as it relates to ''darkness'' other than the picture is shot dark.  I didn''t think it fair to knock your score because I couldn''t see your concept.  It is a good picture, I just can''t relate it to the challenge.  Good luck!', '2005-06-21 22:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1472162, 190001, 39349, '<td valign="top">Nice picture but I wish it was a bit larger.</td>', 'Nice picture but I wish it was a bit larger.', '2005-06-21 22:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1472163, 189353, 37719, '<td valign="top">I have come back to this photo 5 or 6 times now.  I keep looking at it and looking at it.  I try and relate your title to it.  I really have tried to see your''darkness'' in this image, but just can''t.  Instead of dinging you because I cannot see something inyour image,  I passed on voting.  It certainly is a good image and an interesting one speaking from perspective.  Good luck!</td>', 'I have come back to this photo 5 or 6 times now.  I keep looking at it and looking at it.  I try and relate your title to it.  I really have tried to see your''darkness'' in this image, but just can''t.  Instead of dinging you because I cannot see something inyour image,  I passed on voting.  It certainly is a good image and an interesting one speaking from perspective.  Good luck!', '2005-06-21 22:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1472164, 188888, 39349, '<td valign="top">Love the angle and lighting on this shot!</td>', 'Love the angle and lighting on this shot!', '2005-06-21 22:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1472184, 190311, 2223, '<td valign="top">Very pretty! I love the blue tint. Gives a great feel of darkness too!</td>', 'Very pretty! I love the blue tint. Gives a great feel of darkness too!', '2005-06-21 22:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1472193, 190256, 34154, '<td valign="top">without the smoke this would''ve been a 10 from me</td>', 'without the smoke this would''ve been a 10 from me', '2005-06-21 22:58:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1472200, 190252, 15305, '<td valign="top">Great job, congratulations!!!</td>', 'Great job, congratulations!!!', '2005-06-21 23:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1472202, 187566, 30214, '<td valign="top">I''m sure people have mentioned the camera glare... <br/>The light seems to be too bright to convey the notion of "dying"... <br/>otherwise, an interesting shot. I like the eyes</td>', 'I''m sure people have mentioned the camera glare... The light seems to be too bright to convey the notion of "dying"... otherwise, an interesting shot. I like the eyes', '2005-06-21 23:01:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1472204, 188138, 30817, '<td valign="top">Bold, unafraid, unbound by constraints (I am sure you will get a few "rule of thirds ... hey... rules of thirds... no fair..." comments); this image speaks volumes on a correct predisposition toward darkness: do not fear, but embrace that which is as essential as light. One compliments the other. Form is unidimensional if lighted without shadow.  The light would turn days into deserts without night''s darkness  to refreshen it once more.  I applaud the thought you put into this piece, recognize your accomplished effort and pronounce as a result that this is my top choice for this challenge. This will go in my favorites file as well. 10.</td>', 'Bold, unafraid, unbound by constraints (I am sure you will get a few "rule of thirds ... hey... rules of thirds... no fair..." comments); this image speaks volumes on a correct predisposition toward darkness: do not fear, but embrace that which is as essential as light. One compliments the other. Form is unidimensional if lighted without shadow.  The light would turn days into deserts without night''s darkness  to refreshen it once more.  I applaud the thought you put into this piece, recognize your accomplished effort and pronounce as a result that this is my top choice for this challenge. This will go in my favorites file as well. 10.', '2005-06-21 23:02:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1472205, 190184, 30214, '<td valign="top">Great shot, my favorite so far</td>', 'Great shot, my favorite so far', '2005-06-21 23:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1472206, 188332, 34154, '<td valign="top">i love the grai</td>', 'i love the grai', '2005-06-21 23:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1472208, 187294, 30817, '<td valign="top">This is the work of a very accomplished editor.  I applaud the skills you''ve nurtured in order to process an image as evocatively as this one.  The muted, suggested shapes in the BG further indicate the presence of artistic endeavor.  My only suggestion is to release the poet inside your soul.  The title does not begin to strive to compliment the rest of this superior effort.  One of my top ten favorites of this challenge.</td>', 'This is the work of a very accomplished editor.  I applaud the skills you''ve nurtured in order to process an image as evocatively as this one.  The muted, suggested shapes in the BG further indicate the presence of artistic endeavor.  My only suggestion is to release the poet inside your soul.  The title does not begin to strive to compliment the rest of this superior effort.  One of my top ten favorites of this challenge.', '2005-06-21 23:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1472212, 190273, 30817, '<td valign="top">Nicely framed, well rendered and a very fine example of the art that swirls around us unheralded at every turn.  This is not the decorative "calendar shot" that usually wins online challenges, but this is one of the ten best efforts of this week''s challenge.  For sure!</td>', 'Nicely framed, well rendered and a very fine example of the art that swirls around us unheralded at every turn.  This is not the decorative "calendar shot" that usually wins online challenges, but this is one of the ten best efforts of this week''s challenge.  For sure!', '2005-06-21 23:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1472214, 190293, 30214, '<td valign="top">interesting idea!</td>', 'interesting idea!', '2005-06-21 23:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1472216, 190061, 30817, '<td valign="top">I usually disdain an image where processing dominates subject, but this photograph works well within itself on boh levels.  The processing adds moodiness and profundity to the enigmatic subject.  Without the fence, this would have been average.  As you thoughtfully captured it, I pick it as a ribbon winner.</td>', 'I usually disdain an image where processing dominates subject, but this photograph works well within itself on boh levels.  The processing adds moodiness and profundity to the enigmatic subject.  Without the fence, this would have been average.  As you thoughtfully captured it, I pick it as a ribbon winner.', '2005-06-21 23:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1472219, 189549, 30817, '<td valign="top">The enigmatic nature of this shot alone makes it a worthy challenge top ten finisher as far as I am concerned.  I love a good abstract .... and this is a great one. The combination of ellispe, crescent and round shapes work so well in combination.  Throw in a dash of warm color and the dark intrigue; this becomes a winner!</td>', 'The enigmatic nature of this shot alone makes it a worthy challenge top ten finisher as far as I am concerned.  I love a good abstract .... and this is a great one. The combination of ellispe, crescent and round shapes work so well in combination.  Throw in a dash of warm color and the dark intrigue; this becomes a winner!', '2005-06-21 23:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1472222, 190274, 30214, '<td valign="top">obviously a make-believe shot, but a good one. Great model, and I like the processing, too.</td>', 'obviously a make-believe shot, but a good one. Great model, and I like the processing, too.', '2005-06-21 23:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1472223, 187559, 30817, '<td valign="top">This proves that many times good things happen for those who thoughtfully, thoroughly and patiently go after a shot.  I know this was not random or accidental.  Your planning, thinking and work was rewarded with one of the most outstanding captures I have seen in a long time.  The repetitive slice shapes of alternating tonal quality are so effective in making the statement to define the difference of darkness from light.  That lightning pierces the darkness in order to define the contrast, is a master (THE master''s) stroke!  One of my top three picks of this week''s challenge.</td>', 'This proves that many times good things happen for those who thoughtfully, thoroughly and patiently go after a shot.  I know this was not random or accidental.  Your planning, thinking and work was rewarded with one of the most outstanding captures I have seen in a long time.  The repetitive slice shapes of alternating tonal quality are so effective in making the statement to define the difference of darkness from light.  That lightning pierces the darkness in order to define the contrast, is a master (THE master''s) stroke!  One of my top three picks of this week''s challenge.', '2005-06-21 23:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1472225, 187356, 30817, '<td valign="top">I really like this quirky, creative answer to a somewhat nebulous challenge theme.  The use of the mouth as the rotation point works very well to give the face an other-world look.  Well done and one of my top ten picks for this week.</td>', 'I really like this quirky, creative answer to a somewhat nebulous challenge theme.  The use of the mouth as the rotation point works very well to give the face an other-world look.  Well done and one of my top ten picks for this week.', '2005-06-21 23:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1472228, 190285, 30817, '<td valign="top">I like your honesty and realistic entry to a challenge some tried to over-philosophize upon.  Lonliness IS darkness ... of course ... so simple.  I think you compromised to the "Ruler", because there might be a MacDonald''s parking lot just out of sight off the right border.  Centered would have worked well here.  But, I believe you when you say she is alone.  You have presented this so well with clarity and muted tones in a digital world where extreme saturation is sometimes equated with extreme satisfaction.  One of my ten favorites from this week''s challenge.</td>', 'I like your honesty and realistic entry to a challenge some tried to over-philosophize upon.  Lonliness IS darkness ... of course ... so simple.  I think you compromised to the "Ruler", because there might be a MacDonald''s parking lot just out of sight off the right border.  Centered would have worked well here.  But, I believe you when you say she is alone.  You have presented this so well with clarity and muted tones in a digital world where extreme saturation is sometimes equated with extreme satisfaction.  One of my ten favorites from this week''s challenge.', '2005-06-21 23:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1472231, 189409, 30214, '<td valign="top">very nice lighting and processing</td>', 'very nice lighting and processing', '2005-06-21 23:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1472235, 188797, 30817, '<td valign="top">Bold, artistic approach to the subject of darkness.  I like your combination of form and line; light and dark that transcends "rules" in order to deliver an evocative image.  Your freedom of thought in composition adds to this as one of my top ten favorites from this week.</td>', 'Bold, artistic approach to the subject of darkness.  I like your combination of form and line; light and dark that transcends "rules" in order to deliver an evocative image.  Your freedom of thought in composition adds to this as one of my top ten favorites from this week.', '2005-06-21 23:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1472238, 188438, 30817, '<td valign="top">Do not like the lines of the plastic furniture, but I sure like everything else about this simple, but effective composition.  The movement of the drape is so effective as a suggestion that the light is pushing its way into the room.  The slivers of light forming an arrow pointing to the light''s origin is genius, if intentional.  If you had paid more attention to the setup in the darker portions of the frame as you did to the lighted part, this would have been a top 3 for me.  As is, it is one of my top ten favorites for this week.</td>', 'Do not like the lines of the plastic furniture, but I sure like everything else about this simple, but effective composition.  The movement of the drape is so effective as a suggestion that the light is pushing its way into the room.  The slivers of light forming an arrow pointing to the light''s origin is genius, if intentional.  If you had paid more attention to the setup in the darker portions of the frame as you did to the lighted part, this would have been a top 3 for me.  As is, it is one of my top ten favorites for this week.', '2005-06-21 23:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1472245, 190061, 34154, '<td valign="top">this is crazy, i want to see the original photo too</td>', 'this is crazy, i want to see the original photo too', '2005-06-21 23:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1472249, 188290, 30214, '<td valign="top">It would be nicer to see some stars in the sky, but still a nice shot.</td>', 'It would be nicer to see some stars in the sky, but still a nice shot.', '2005-06-21 23:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1472254, 190158, 35530, '<td valign="top">Yum. The best kind of darkness.</td>', 'Yum. The best kind of darkness.', '2005-06-21 23:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1472260, 187305, 24805, '<td valign="top">this is a very strong concept. the actual image would be more compelling if it were in clearer focus more more intentionally out of focus</td>', 'this is a very strong concept. the actual image would be more compelling if it were in clearer focus more more intentionally out of focus', '2005-06-21 23:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1472264, 189521, 35530, '<td valign="top">Very nice effect.</td>', 'Very nice effect.', '2005-06-21 23:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1472406, 188888, 24951, '<td valign="top">Really like the angle of the shot as well as the colour tone.</td>', 'Really like the angle of the shot as well as the colour tone.', '2005-06-21 23:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1472415, 190300, 37632, '<td valign="top">LOL!!! Good one.</td>', 'LOL!!! Good one.', '2005-06-22 00:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1472416, 188257, 37632, '<td valign="top">I think this needs a subject, other than just the arches, to really make it.  Nice B&amp;W though.</td>', 'I think this needs a subject, other than just the arches, to really make it.  Nice B&W though.', '2005-06-22 00:02:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1472419, 190276, 24951, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting shot - the blinds that resemble knife blades casting shadow slashes across her face and neck really help accentuate the darkness of the photo.</td>', 'This is an interesting shot - the blinds that resemble knife blades casting shadow slashes across her face and neck really help accentuate the darkness of the photo.', '2005-06-22 00:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1472420, 189757, 37632, '<td valign="top">May have been better with less light and without the board being illuminated...Just a thought.  Nice effect though.</td>', 'May have been better with less light and without the board being illuminated...Just a thought.  Nice effect though.', '2005-06-22 00:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1472422, 189952, 37632, '<td valign="top">Would be more effective if there was actually someone being accomodated there.</td>', 'Would be more effective if there was actually someone being accomodated there.', '2005-06-22 00:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1472423, 190255, 37539, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot.  It fits the challenge, it has great lighting and it doesn''t have that ''set up'' feel to it.  It provokes an emotion of darkness.  Nice job.  9</td>', 'I really like this shot.  It fits the challenge, it has great lighting and it doesn''t have that ''set up'' feel to it.  It provokes an emotion of darkness.  Nice job.  9', '2005-06-22 00:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1472425, 190186, 24951, '<td valign="top">Good use of grainy-ness</td>', 'Good use of grainy-ness', '2005-06-22 00:06:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1472426, 188468, 37632, '<td valign="top">CRAZY LIGHTS!!!</td>', 'CRAZY LIGHTS!!!', '2005-06-22 00:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1472428, 189153, 37632, '<td valign="top">Ripper.  One of my favourites, if not the best....but I haven''t seen them all yet.</td>', 'Ripper.  One of my favourites, if not the best....but I haven''t seen them all yet.', '2005-06-22 00:07:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1472431, 189353, 25313, '<td valign="top">I can assume the sliver of light from the window is your justification for darkness or an addiction to scent. never the less this is the best entry for this chall. A beautiful photo with great comp and lighting as well as an intriging statement....Good Luck!!!!</td>', 'I can assume the sliver of light from the window is your justification for darkness or an addiction to scent. never the less this is the best entry for this chall. A beautiful photo with great comp and lighting as well as an intriging statement....Good Luck!!!!', '2005-06-22 00:09:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1472432, 190278, 37632, '<td valign="top">Very Bill Henson''ish.  I like it. Darkness? Maybe/maybe not, but still a great photo.</td>', 'Very Bill Henson''ish.  I like it. Darkness? Maybe/maybe not, but still a great photo.', '2005-06-22 00:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1472433, 188332, 24951, '<td valign="top">Ha if the model bought his liquor in Canada he might not be at it so often. LOL $4.97 for a bottle!? I''d be at it myself more than I probably should at those prices.</td>', 'Ha if the model bought his liquor in Canada he might not be at it so often. LOL $4.97 for a bottle!? I''d be at it myself more than I probably should at those prices.', '2005-06-22 00:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1472437, 188977, 37632, '<td valign="top">Who, the dinner chime?</td>', 'Who, the dinner chime?', '2005-06-22 00:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1472439, 189691, 37632, '<td valign="top">Looks like a fun photo shoot</td>', 'Looks like a fun photo shoot', '2005-06-22 00:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1472442, 190185, 37632, '<td valign="top">Must''ve been a windy day for fireworks....or you turned the photo on the side</td>', 'Must''ve been a windy day for fireworks....or you turned the photo on the side', '2005-06-22 00:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1472443, 190121, 37632, '<td valign="top">Nice work on the lighting. Would have been good if you could have also accentuated the fact that it is a cactus.  This seems to be an afterthought in the shot</td>', 'Nice work on the lighting. Would have been good if you could have also accentuated the fact that it is a cactus.  This seems to be an afterthought in the shot', '2005-06-22 00:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1472444, 190241, 37632, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but not much darkness going on here.</td>', 'Nice shot, but not much darkness going on here.', '2005-06-22 00:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1472447, 189771, 37632, '<td valign="top">Highlights have been blown out.  Suggest stopping down the appeture next time, and/or waiting a few more minutes for the sun to dissapear.</td>', 'Highlights have been blown out.  Suggest stopping down the appeture next time, and/or waiting a few more minutes for the sun to dissapear.', '2005-06-22 00:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1472449, 190302, 37632, '<td valign="top">Would be been perfect if you''d got it just as it went out....with that puff of smoke that comes up.</td>', 'Would be been perfect if you''d got it just as it went out....with that puff of smoke that comes up.', '2005-06-22 00:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1472455, 189708, 37632, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but not in line with the topic</td>', 'Nice shot, but not in line with the topic', '2005-06-22 00:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1472460, 190008, 24951, '<td valign="top">I picture this being more effective with a good crop on both sides . Needs height not width.</td>', 'I picture this being more effective with a good crop on both sides . Needs height not width.', '2005-06-22 00:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1472464, 189739, 37632, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t demonstrate darkness.  Maybe more granularity and the detatchment of the child from the teddy bear may have improved the effect.</td>', 'Doesn''t demonstrate darkness.  Maybe more granularity and the detatchment of the child from the teddy bear may have improved the effect.', '2005-06-22 00:22:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1472468, 190302, 24951, '<td valign="top">Too much nose showing</td>', 'Too much nose showing', '2005-06-22 00:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1472475, 190118, 24951, '<td valign="top">Great colour, use of light and motion. Your model actually looks scared. An easy 10</td>', 'Great colour, use of light and motion. Your model actually looks scared. An easy 10', '2005-06-22 00:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1472483, 187622, 37632, '<td valign="top">Bit difficult to see exactly what''s going on here.</td>', 'Bit difficult to see exactly what''s going on here.', '2005-06-22 00:30:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1472484, 187142, 24951, '<td valign="top">Have you tried playing around with this. How does it look in b&amp;W</td>', 'Have you tried playing around with this. How does it look in b&W', '2005-06-22 00:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1472486, 189307, 24951, '<td valign="top">Sorry to harsh for me</td>', 'Sorry to harsh for me', '2005-06-22 00:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1472488, 189780, 39349, '<td valign="top">Only my favorite movies of all time!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-06-22 20:23:47.</i></td>', 'Only my favorite movies of all time!', '2005-06-22 00:32:31.000000', '2005-06-22 21:23:47.000000', 1),
(1472491, 189774, 39349, '<td valign="top">I really like the erieness (sp?) of this photo.</td>', 'I really like the erieness (sp?) of this photo.', '2005-06-22 00:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1472492, 190102, 39349, '<td valign="top">Very Cool.</td>', 'Very Cool.', '2005-06-22 00:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
