(1472662, 189952, 19708, '<td valign="top">NEVER!!<br/>This was a metering nighmare shot! Only one out of about 40 attempts at triggering the shutter worked. Only 8 possible takes due to card size. Spot metered and had be be really choosy about where I metered. This was more of a "I''m gonna'' make this $*%#*@ camera take a picture if I gotta'' beat it into submission" thing. ROFL.<br/> <br/>And NO filters were applied - this is the way it is due to something strange in low-light shooting I guess..<br/></td>', 'NEVER!!This was a metering nighmare shot! Only one out of about 40 attempts at triggering the shutter worked. Only 8 possible takes due to card size. Spot metered and had be be really choosy about where I metered. This was more of a "I''m gonna'' make this $*%#*@ camera take a picture if I gotta'' beat it into submission" thing. ROFL. And NO filters were applied - this is the way it is due to something strange in low-light shooting I guess..', '2005-06-22 01:19:17.000000', NULL, 0),
