(1473280, 189351, 37632, '<td valign="top">I agree with Brad. This was one of the best in the comp.  Shame I didn''t get to it in my voting. The longer exposure needed to capture sufficient light meant that the humans present blurred just slightly.  The effect is that they are miscellaneous people with no defined facial details and a ghost like appearance.  The people make this shot, not the wall itself, although that''s nice too.</td>', 'I agree with Brad. This was one of the best in the comp.  Shame I didn''t get to it in my voting. The longer exposure needed to capture sufficient light meant that the humans present blurred just slightly.  The effect is that they are miscellaneous people with no defined facial details and a ghost like appearance.  The people make this shot, not the wall itself, although that''s nice too.', '2005-06-22 04:06:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(1473296, 190015, 31443, '<td valign="top">For what it''s worth, I gave this photo a 5, the title didn''t quite get through to me although I suspected it. I agree with you that all those 1,2, and a whooping 25 3''s was not fair! You did get my attention though and I thank you for loving a beautiful creature that nobody else was willing to love :)</td>', 'For what it''s worth, I gave this photo a 5, the title didn''t quite get through to me although I suspected it. I agree with you that all those 1,2, and a whooping 25 3''s was not fair! You did get my attention though and I thank you for loving a beautiful creature that nobody else was willing to love :)', '2005-06-22 04:12:01.000000', NULL, 0),
