(1473310, 187294, 22748, '<td valign="top">Wow, please tell us how you executed this shot. What is the lighting, is it flash? Is it really shot at 1/1000 sec f/8 ISO64??? That seems like a really low exposure for anything but a powerful flash, and I didn''t know the F828 could sync with flash at such a high shutter speed.<br/> <br/>I''m still blown away and I wish I could make images like this. Awesome.</td>', 'Wow, please tell us how you executed this shot. What is the lighting, is it flash? Is it really shot at 1/1000 sec f/8 ISO64??? That seems like a really low exposure for anything but a powerful flash, and I didn''t know the F828 could sync with flash at such a high shutter speed. I''m still blown away and I wish I could make images like this. Awesome.', '2005-06-22 04:17:06.000000', NULL, 0),
