(1473876, 187967, 30049, '<td valign="top">Thanks to everyone that "got it".  The theme of the challenge was to take an image of something that meant "darkness" to you (the photographer...me).  This little guy means the world to me and "Losing Him" in any way...well, just can''t think about that.</td>', 'Thanks to everyone that "got it".  The theme of the challenge was to take an image of something that meant "darkness" to you (the photographer...me).  This little guy means the world to me and "Losing Him" in any way...well, just can''t think about that.', '2005-06-22 09:01:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(1473881, 189599, 25397, '<td valign="top">WWWWWWOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOAH!<br/>Okay okay okay.<br/>I love this.<br/>The tree branch shadows (I think that''s what it is) are almost magick.<br/>Your the man.<br/>Looks like a scene from a movie I would make. ;-)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-06-22 08:04:36.</i></td>', 'WWWWWWOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOAH!Okay okay okay.I love this.The tree branch shadows (I think that''s what it is) are almost magick.Your the man.Looks like a scene from a movie I would make. ;-)', '2005-06-22 09:03:37.000000', '2005-06-22 09:04:36.000000', 0),
(1473887, 187967, 37544, '<td valign="top">I thought that this one should have done better. Yes the black circle is a little distracting until you read the title. That is what made this photo "click" for me.  To me it was like an abducter spying on your child waiting for the right time to take him. For those of us who have children, there is no worse darkness than the fear of something bad happening to our babies!!</td>', 'I thought that this one should have done better. Yes the black circle is a little distracting until you read the title. That is what made this photo "click" for me.  To me it was like an abducter spying on your child waiting for the right time to take him. For those of us who have children, there is no worse darkness than the fear of something bad happening to our babies!!', '2005-06-22 09:06:13.000000', NULL, 0),
