(1473936, 190279, 36231, '<td valign="top">I gave it a 2 ... but now I understand why. :)  When I first looked at this, I thought, "OK ... couldn''t think of anything else and going for the brown." The funny thing is, for your story on why this got submitted, it still was not the worst and is in fact a pretty good photo! :)  Would work well for the "Obsolete" challenge, seeing as how I don''t see rabbit ears much anymore. :)</td>', 'I gave it a 2 ... but now I understand why. :)  When I first looked at this, I thought, "OK ... couldn''t think of anything else and going for the brown." The funny thing is, for your story on why this got submitted, it still was not the worst and is in fact a pretty good photo! :)  Would work well for the "Obsolete" challenge, seeing as how I don''t see rabbit ears much anymore. :)', '2005-06-22 09:17:33.000000', NULL, 0),
