(1474018, 190184, 24099, '<td valign="top">There was a question about whether I used an additional red light to <br/>illuminate the models face.  The answer is yes, I used a flashlight <br/>with a red lens cover.  The clock did not provide nearly enough light<br/>to see the model.  <br/> <br/>Many thanks to those who commented, I am glad that photo touched you,<br/>many indicated that they have had nights of insomnia, it''s nice to know<br/>that we are not alone in the dark.<br/> <br/>Cheers,</td>', 'There was a question about whether I used an additional red light to illuminate the models face.  The answer is yes, I used a flashlight with a red lens cover.  The clock did not provide nearly enough lightto see the model.   Many thanks to those who commented, I am glad that photo touched you,many indicated that they have had nights of insomnia, it''s nice to knowthat we are not alone in the dark. Cheers,', '2005-06-22 09:35:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(1474024, 189224, 12986, '<td valign="top">hi.. thanx all for the kind comments and critiques.. this is my first try at a challenge and found great joy in findin the photo fitting of the challenge.. cheers!</td>', 'hi.. thanx all for the kind comments and critiques.. this is my first try at a challenge and found great joy in findin the photo fitting of the challenge.. cheers!', '2005-06-22 09:36:43.000000', NULL, 0),
