(1474107, 189115, 36231, '<td valign="top">I gave this a low score (higher than your average, tho), mainly because I didn''t get it.  I thought it was a child "headed home".  I did get the feeling of poverty, which I connected to the darkness theme.  I can imagine it''s hard to get a photo of a homeless person.  Alone, it''s a good photo, but coupled with the other dark photos of this challenge, it didn''t really stand out much.  However, I think it deserved better than a 3.8.  That''s just silly! :)</td>', 'I gave this a low score (higher than your average, tho), mainly because I didn''t get it.  I thought it was a child "headed home".  I did get the feeling of poverty, which I connected to the darkness theme.  I can imagine it''s hard to get a photo of a homeless person.  Alone, it''s a good photo, but coupled with the other dark photos of this challenge, it didn''t really stand out much.  However, I think it deserved better than a 3.8.  That''s just silly! :)', '2005-06-22 09:57:46.000000', NULL, 0),
