(1474157, 189352, 36231, '<td valign="top">First I went "Ewe!" Then I went, "Huh?"  Then I went, "Oh."  It definitely made me look ... Going for different isn''t always a bad thing, but this was just weird. :)<br/> <br/>PS ... Correct me if I''m wrong, but it''s just water, right?  Turning it to greyscale makes it look gooey, but the drips down the side of the pot tells me it''s just water. ??? :)</td>', 'First I went "Ewe!" Then I went, "Huh?"  Then I went, "Oh."  It definitely made me look ... Going for different isn''t always a bad thing, but this was just weird. :) PS ... Correct me if I''m wrong, but it''s just water, right?  Turning it to greyscale makes it look gooey, but the drips down the side of the pot tells me it''s just water. ??? :)', '2005-06-22 10:13:29.000000', NULL, 0),
