(1476682, 190165, 36231, '<td valign="top">This was my highest rated photo. Congrats on the top 20.  If you care, what I love about it:<br/> <br/>- The eyes in shadow, conveying sorrow<br/>- The hands gripped in front of the face, as if afraid<br/>- The deep shadows and highlights contrasting against each other - can''t have the darkness without the light!<br/> <br/>It just me stare at it, which is a good thing in MY book! :)<br/>Tara</td>', 'This was my highest rated photo. Congrats on the top 20.  If you care, what I love about it: - The eyes in shadow, conveying sorrow- The hands gripped in front of the face, as if afraid- The deep shadows and highlights contrasting against each other - can''t have the darkness without the light! It just me stare at it, which is a good thing in MY book! :)Tara', '2005-06-22 20:47:35.000000', NULL, 0),
