(1478955, 188235, 25555, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all who commented, really appreciated and really needed! I know this photo wasn''t as interesting as I would have liked, but my first "subject" really didn''t work so I settled for this one as a representation of what darkness means to me (and no, not everyone has to agree with me on this point).  I just bought a Canon EOS-20D and this was my first submission so hopefully I''ll get better, practise makes perfect an all that!</td>', 'Thanks to all who commented, really appreciated and really needed! I know this photo wasn''t as interesting as I would have liked, but my first "subject" really didn''t work so I settled for this one as a representation of what darkness means to me (and no, not everyone has to agree with me on this point).  I just bought a Canon EOS-20D and this was my first submission so hopefully I''ll get better, practise makes perfect an all that!', '2005-06-23 16:46:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(1479209, 190166, 37544, '<td valign="top">I gave you a 7! I would have given a higher score, if the model wasn''t clean. you are in this dark creepy corner and you are clean as a whistle. It looks like you may have a few boo-boos or dirt on your legs, but the slip (?) is SOOOOOOO clean.</td>', 'I gave you a 7! I would have given a higher score, if the model wasn''t clean. you are in this dark creepy corner and you are clean as a whistle. It looks like you may have a few boo-boos or dirt on your legs, but the slip (?) is SOOOOOOO clean.', '2005-06-23 18:06:33.000000', NULL, 0),
