(1480558, 187746, 31990, '<td valign="top">I have a LCD flat screen home and at work as well. And every time I see<br/>a picture I tend to move my head a bit and see it from different angles.<br/>If I am watching it with my eyes below the center of the monitor I can''t see it at all. But when I am moving up the image slowly appears.<br/>It looks like the man appears from the dark. Amazing! It almost looks like a 3D. And believe me I am not having those expensive monitors.<br/>It is true that is darker but that was the challenge about...<br/>Well...just my opinion...the picture was supposed to be on top 10.</td>', 'I have a LCD flat screen home and at work as well. And every time I seea picture I tend to move my head a bit and see it from different angles.If I am watching it with my eyes below the center of the monitor I can''t see it at all. But when I am moving up the image slowly appears.It looks like the man appears from the dark. Amazing! It almost looks like a 3D. And believe me I am not having those expensive monitors.It is true that is darker but that was the challenge about...Well...just my opinion...the picture was supposed to be on top 10.', '2005-06-24 08:03:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(1480627, 190274, 34058, '<td valign="top">This is my daughter, and she does have a boyfriend!!  He was creeped out by this photo and the other one I decided not to enter!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-06-24 17:13:33.</i></td>', 'This is my daughter, and she does have a boyfriend!!  He was creeped out by this photo and the other one I decided not to enter!', '2005-06-24 09:00:41.000000', '2005-06-24 18:13:33.000000', 0),
(1480761, 187401, 27763, '<td valign="top">I really like this.  I think that the thing that really strikes me about this photo is (besides the cool composition) the lighting and tones.  I like the way that the walls and track are lit, with shadows and highlights.  Very cool.  When I tried to take subway photos, the subway police kicked me out :(  Apparently, it''s not allowed in Chicago...<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-06-24 12:51:20.</i></td>', 'I really like this.  I think that the thing that really strikes me about this photo is (besides the cool composition) the lighting and tones.  I like the way that the walls and track are lit, with shadows and highlights.  Very cool.  When I tried to take subway photos, the subway police kicked me out :(  Apparently, it''s not allowed in Chicago...', '2005-06-24 10:12:36.000000', '2005-06-24 13:51:20.000000', 0),
(1480872, 188046, 3569, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments.  Ya folks have to read the challenge who didn''t like my title, what darkness means to me.  Well without Jesus, darkness is hell.</td>', 'Thanks for the comments.  Ya folks have to read the challenge who didn''t like my title, what darkness means to me.  Well without Jesus, darkness is hell.', '2005-06-24 11:22:21.000000', NULL, 0),
