(1500710, 189115, 18349, '<td valign="top">I can see where you''re coming from with the title and the connection to darkness...it''s unfortunate that the average DPC voter doesn''t make the kinds of connections necessary to do so in an average 2 second viewing.  The large patch of light is enough for most to say "DNMC" and click the 4 or below.  I like the composition; the left side feels a bit crowded from the pillar running along there.  I think if you had shot it at twilight, a step or so more to your right, this image would have scored higher for you.  :)</td>', 'I can see where you''re coming from with the title and the connection to darkness...it''s unfortunate that the average DPC voter doesn''t make the kinds of connections necessary to do so in an average 2 second viewing.  The large patch of light is enough for most to say "DNMC" and click the 4 or below.  I like the composition; the left side feels a bit crowded from the pillar running along there.  I think if you had shot it at twilight, a step or so more to your right, this image would have scored higher for you.  :)', '2005-07-02 22:42:36.000000', NULL, 0),
