(1533582, 190010, 9668, '<td valign="top">Funny to think that we spent about 2 hours setting this up and shooting different tries and it only score a 5.5 (better then in the 4s, true), and a photo like <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=141895" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">this</a> is just taken on a whim mid-run. Still it was fun to do, looking forward to more of your photos in some challenges/portfolio =).</td>', 'Funny to think that we spent about 2 hours setting this up and shooting different tries and it only score a 5.5 (better then in the 4s, true), and a photo like this is just taken on a whim mid-run. Still it was fun to do, looking forward to more of your photos in some challenges/portfolio =).', '2005-07-13 17:48:57.000000', NULL, 0),
