(1822138, 187746, 43148, '<td valign="top">Well, now that I have recalibrated this monitor, this is a MUCH better photo, much less subtle than when I first looked at it. Did not vote in this competition, glad I did not now, for I know in my heart I would have undervalued this one. Earlier all I saw was the nose, chin, some eyes and the edge of the hood, can see even the background behind the hood now, see the hem along the shoulder and think someone needs a shave!! LOL, WELL DONE photo, would vote it very high if I had the chance to. Oh well, at least you are getting some very high praise NOW!! Not much good in the challenge, but sure should make you feel better!!! <br/> <br/>Jacque</td>', 'Well, now that I have recalibrated this monitor, this is a MUCH better photo, much less subtle than when I first looked at it. Did not vote in this competition, glad I did not now, for I know in my heart I would have undervalued this one. Earlier all I saw was the nose, chin, some eyes and the edge of the hood, can see even the background behind the hood now, see the hem along the shoulder and think someone needs a shave!! LOL, WELL DONE photo, would vote it very high if I had the chance to. Oh well, at least you are getting some very high praise NOW!! Not much good in the challenge, but sure should make you feel better!!!  Jacque', '2005-10-28 23:22:10.000000', NULL, 0),
