(3069498, 189700, 40718, '<td valign="top">This is what I''m talking about!  I love a story like that and it gets lost in the 5.8 score.  Nice shot.  It''s too bad the star trails were the size they were.  it''s probably what hurt the shot as they are too short and look more like blur than trails.  A 5 minute exposure probably would have made this a winning shot!</td>', 'This is what I''m talking about!  I love a story like that and it gets lost in the 5.8 score.  Nice shot.  It''s too bad the star trails were the size they were.  it''s probably what hurt the shot as they are too short and look more like blur than trails.  A 5 minute exposure probably would have made this a winning shot!', '2006-11-28 22:33:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(3069739, 189700, 29797, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by DrAchoo:</b></div><hr/><i> This is what I''m talking about!  I love a story like that and it gets lost in the 5.8 score.  Nice shot.  It''s too bad the star trails were the size they were.  it''s probably what hurt the shot as they are too short and look more like blur than trails.  A 5 minute exposure probably would have made this a winning shot! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks Doc! I totally agree, the stars were not enough to be trails, yet too much to be plain old stars. Just somewhere in limbo between the two.</td>', 'Originally posted by DrAchoo: This is what I''m talking about!  I love a story like that and it gets lost in the 5.8 score.  Nice shot.  It''s too bad the star trails were the size they were.  it''s probably what hurt the shot as they are too short and look more like blur than trails.  A 5 minute exposure probably would have made this a winning shot!   Thanks Doc! I totally agree, the stars were not enough to be trails, yet too much to be plain old stars. Just somewhere in limbo between the two.', '2006-11-28 23:43:26.000000', NULL, 0),
