(3555600, 190217, 63269, '<td valign="top">Cool! I know from experience myself how difficult it is to photograph black-furred animals: either the details of the fur become very harsh or washed out, or the details are completely lost in a black void. But I think you''ve captured the fur details perfectly here! It would be cool if the cat''s eyes were a little wider open (although it certainly does make the cat look evil!) But, having a cat myself, I know how difficult models they can be!</td>', 'Cool! I know from experience myself how difficult it is to photograph black-furred animals: either the details of the fur become very harsh or washed out, or the details are completely lost in a black void. But I think you''ve captured the fur details perfectly here! It would be cool if the cat''s eyes were a little wider open (although it certainly does make the cat look evil!) But, having a cat myself, I know how difficult models they can be!', '2007-04-17 16:29:17.000000', NULL, 0),
